<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Lughulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Zab</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaburi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Zaburi</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZABURI</para>
  <para style="is">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha zabuli chika hamwe tsiwila na ghamaombi, mna ilugha ya chiebulaniya. Zabuli mana yake wila tsa ukutunya. Tsisula nyingi tsa zabuli tsa wila, na mna tsiwila atso Imulungu kotunyighwa, lekeni tsisula nyingi tsa zabuli tsolonga pfinu pfingi, tsimwenga tsa malombi na tsingi tsa ukumlomba Imulungu yakwapfile, tsingi keli tsosimulila usungu mkulu. Tsisula tsingi tsa Zabuli tsomtunya mfalume wa Isiraeli, na tsimwenga tsowafunda iwanu ihekima na ighayobama Imulungu tutende. Ichitabu cha Zabuli chandikighwa na wanu wengi na chikighwa hamwe kwa miyaka mingi. Tsisula tsingi tsa Zabuli tsandikighwa ghumwande na tsandikighwa mna ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Daudi. Ibibilia nayo yolonga ka yeye yuyo iyandike tsisula tsimwenga tsa Zabuli. Tsimwenga tsandikighwa mna ghamatsuwa Waisiraeli hawoyile kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa ya Babeli. Iwanu iwasomile wotoghola ghendo ka ichitabu achino chikighwa hamwe mna ikaline ya kadatu mbaka yakane. Na ichitabu achino cha Zabuli ichikighwe hamwe china Zabuli miya imwe na hamsini, na chigholeka mna pfitabu pfidopfido pfitano.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zabuli atsino tsiwe tsa Wila au tsa Ukulomba, tsose tsandikighwa mna ushaili. Apfo ukumanya chidogho ghamashaili gha chiebulaniya kutsokwapfila kumanya izabuli, ghumstali ghwa kwanza gholonga chinu kwa ukwandika ghamalonga ing'agheghala baye, au wolonga chinu nacho ng'achili baye mna ghumsitali ghwa kwanza, au wolonga ghumstali ghwa kwanza kwa ghamalonga ing'agheghala baye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Zabuli cha ichitabu ichimanyika ng'ani na iwanu wochideng'elela ng'ani. Zabuli nyingi iwanu wang'ali wotsitumila mna ukumlomba Imulungu kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu. Chitabu cha Zabuli chotufunda apfila pfatubamighwa kumlomba na kumtumya Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani. Izabuli ya 23 yowakanza iwanu iwang'ali wolila, izabuli ya 51 yowalonga iwanu watsileke tsinzambi tsawo na wamuyile Imulungu. Izabuli ya 110 yotuguma ghumoyo na yotwing'a lolelo kwa kutulongela ka kakutsa Masia iyatsakuwa mfalume na mtambika.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna Ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitabu cha 1 cha Zabuli chakwanzila 1-41</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitabu cha 2 cha Zabuli chakwanzila 42-72</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitabu cha 3 cha Zabuli chakwanzila 73-89</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitabu cha 4 cha Zabuli chakwanzila 90-106</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitabu cha 5 cha Zabuli chakwanzila 107-150</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="s">Ukubweda na Ukughaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyolema kuwinza ghamalangulitso gha iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">na iyolema ukwima mna inzila yawo iwototsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">na iyolema ukukala hana libalatsa lya iwatalatsi,<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Lekeni yeye kodeng'elela ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">nagho koghapfikitsa misi na chilo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Naye keghala ghendo na mbiki ighuhandighwe mmbalimbali mwa ipfikolongo pfa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">ghukweleka matunda ghake mna ghumsimu ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">na imitsani yake ng'aisakala baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">na chila chinu chayotenda choghenda ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Lekeni si pfipfo baye pfawali iwehile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">Wawo weghala na tsing'umvi atsila itsighulusighwa kutali na libeho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Apfo lelo, iwehile watsohighighwa ahala hawatsohighighwa iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">wala wana tsinzambi ng'awatsakwoneka baye mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwelile wa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Kwa apfila IMNDEWA koimanya inzila ya iwanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">lekeni inzila ya iwanu iwehile itsowalongotsa mna ukuhinyighwa.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume iyasaghulighwe na Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Hebali iwanu wali mna tsiisi wotenda ughobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">na iwanu wakwika mitsengwe ya bule?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Wafalume wali mna tsiisi wehandaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">iwatawala wetingana hamwe wamleme IMNDEWA na Imbakighwa Mapfuta wake.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Wolonga, “Tubatsule tsipingu tsawo, na imitsabi yawo tuyase kutali na twetwe.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Ayula iyokala kulanga koseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">IMNDEWA kowabetsa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Kuya kawakembela kwaapfila tsakaghudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na imaya yake ng'ulu iwatenda wone wogha, ahala hayalongile,<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />“Nene nimwika imfalume wangu ako Sayuni, ichidunda changu ichelile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Imfalume ayo kolonga, “Nitsolonga chayanongele IMNDEWA, kanongela apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">‘Ghweghwe kwa mwanangu, leloli aino nene nikweleka.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Unilombe, na nene nitsokwing'a tsiisi tsa wanu tsiwe tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">na isi yose itsakuwa yako.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Kutsowahonda honda kwa ing'weku ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">na kutsowatula tula ka apfila inongo pfaitulighwa.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Apfo lelo, mwemwe iwafalume, mkengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">mwalangitse ng'ani, mwemwe iwatawala wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Mtumikileni IMNDEWA kwa ukupfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">na mumdeng'elele kwa kughudema.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Mmwinamile Imwanaghe ayo Mmale hela katsoghudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">hela namwe mtsakwagha mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Kwa apfila yeye ng'okawa baye ukona maya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Wabweda awala wose iwomtsumila.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba nemitondo wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, lola maaduwi wangu pfawali wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">wawengi ng'ani awala iwonyinukila wanitende pfihile.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Wengi wonilonga, “Imulungu ng'atsomwapfila ghendo baye.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Lekeni ghweghwe, IMNDEWA kwa ngao yangu iinikinga chila ubali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">ghweghwe yuning'alitsa tenda nihume, naghwe yuyo yunyinula.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Nimlilila IMNDEWA kwa litsi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">naye kanyidika kulawa kuchidunda chake ichelile.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Newasitsa hasi nowasa, kuya nolamka keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">kwa apfila IMNDEWA kondola ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Sitsowapfuka ghendo baye maaduwi elufu kumi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">iwanyinukile kunitsunguluka chila ubali.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Ulawile ghwe IMNDEWA! Unikombole ghwe Imulungu wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Ghweghwe kuwabena ghamataya maaduwi tsangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">na kuwabena matsino ghawo iwanu iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Ukombotsi wolawa kwa IMNDEWA. Uwabaliki iwanu wako.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba nemihe wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Hanikukema unyidike, Ghwe Imulungu wa ihaki yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">mbone ng'apfu kulawa kuna ukughaya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">umbonele libatsi na unihulike apfila pfanikulomba.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Mwemwe iwanu, mtsoghendelela kulighela chinyala taghwa lyangu mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Mtsokunda ughutsu na kuhaghatila ung'enye mbaka tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Mmanye ka IMNDEWA kesaghulila imwenyegho munu wake iyompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">naye katsonihulika ahala hanimkema.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Mghudeme kwa wogha na mleke kutenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">mtongelele hamuwasa mpfinanda mwenu, na mwinyamale ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Mlapfe nambiko tsa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">na mwihuwile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Wengi weghutsa, “Nani yatsotulangusa ighanoghile?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Utumwemwesele ghumwanga ghwa uhanga wako, ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Kughutenda ghumoyo ghwangu ghudeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">kubita pfawodeng'elela wawo ahala ingano yawo na idipfai yawo haikongetseka.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Nitsofughama na kuwasa tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwa apfila ghweghwe uliyeka, MNDEWA, yuyo yunitenda nikale tseghamba.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Utegheletse ghamalonga ghangu, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">uhulike nene pfanighuta.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Uhulike litsi lya ichililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">ghwe Mfalume wangu na Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">kwa apfila ghweghwe yuyo yanikulomba.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Hamitondo kutsohulika litsi lyangu, Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">hamitondo nitsokulomba, na nene nitsobetelela.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe ng'uli Imulungu iyonoghelwa na matotso bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">wala ighehile ng'aghodaha kukala na ghweghwe baye.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Iwanu iwetunya ng'awatsakwima hambele hako baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">ghweghwe kowahila awala wose iwotenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Ghweghwe kowatighina ghendo awala iwolonga ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">iwokoma wayawo na iwaghutsu IMNDEWA kowahila sideke.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Lekeni nene, kwa uluso wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nitsakwingila mng'anda mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">kwa kughudema nitsokwinamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">aku nihundukila kuna ing'anda yako iyelile<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Ghwe MNDEWA, unilongotse mna ihaki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">kwaapfila awala iwonyihila wawengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">uigholose inzila yako hambele hangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Kwaapfila imilomo yawo ng'ailawa mbuli yakutogholeka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">ichili mna imimoyo yawo ukuhinya kuliyeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mimelo yawo yeghala na likaburi lili mwatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">imilimi yawo yolonga ung'enye uliyeka.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Uwahighe, Ghwe Imulungu, uwaghwise kwa aghala ighehile ghawapangile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">Uwabalase kunze kwa ajili ya tsinzambi tsawo tsili nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">mana wakubiduka ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Lekeni uwaleke awala wose iwokukimbilila ghweghwe wadeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">matsuwa ghose wembe kwa ukudeng'elela. Uwaghubike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">awala iwolikunda litaghwa lyako, uwaleke wadeng'elele litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Kwa apfila ghwe MNDEWA, kombaliki imunu yana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">komtsungulusila uluso wako ka ngawo.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, haughudubuka, uleke kunikembela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">na haukona imaya, uleke kuning'a adabu.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Umbonele libatsi, Ghwe MNDEWA, kwaapfila notsilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">Ghwe MNDEWA, unihonetse, kwaapfila noghanzika mbaka mna imipate yangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Iloho yangu ighanzika sideke, Ghwe MNDEWA, ukutsa tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Uye, Ghwe MNDEWA, unilopole ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">unikombole kwa apfila ghweghwe kumema uluso.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Kwaapfila imunu yafile ng'odaha baye kukumbuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">wala imunu yali mna likabuli ng'odaha baye kukulongela ghweghwe mighede?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Nene nyipfa ghendo ukughuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">chila chilo nochighebetsa ichinanda changu hanilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">na ghamasotsi ghangu ghopfulumsa ligodolo lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Tsinenge tsangu tsiyauka kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">tsiyauka kwa aghala ghawonitendela aduwi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Mke mndeke, mwemwe wose imtenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">kwa apfila IMNDEWA kahulika litsi lya ichililo changu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />IMNDEWA kahulika ukulomba kwangu, IMNDEWA katsakwidika chanilomba.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Adui tsangu wose watsoghelighwa chinyala, na watsopfuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">watsakuya kuchughu, na baho watsohumbulighwa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu iyobama ihaki</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Mulungu wangu, nene nikutsumila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">Unikombole na unilopole kulawa kwa awala wose iwoniwinza wandaghe,<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Hela watsolutsaula ilukuli lwangu ka simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">waludeghe pfihande pfihande bila kulawila munu wa kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, ka nitenda chihile mna aghano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">ka mna ghamoko ghangu mna ghehile,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />au nimliha ighehile imunu iyakalile tseghamba na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">lekeni si pfipfo baye! Nene nimkombola imunu iyanihile hela,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />Aho mleke iaduwi yangu yaniwinge na yangoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">Yaubajughebajughe ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na kuniwatsisa mna litimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Kwa imaya yako, Ghwe MNDEWA, winuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">ukaimalitse imaya ya maadui tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">winuke, Ghwe Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">ghweghwe yuubama ihaki itendeke.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Na ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wa tsiisi ghukutsunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">na ghweghwe uwatawale kulawa ako kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA yuyo yuhigha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">lelo nihamile nene, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">unihighe kwa kulola ihaki yangu pfaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">na kwa kulola ukutogholeka kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Ukumalitse ukwiha kwa wanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">lekeni iwanu wana ihaki uwemise ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">Ghwe Imulungu yuna ihaki, yughetsa imimoyo na tsiloho tsa wanu.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Imlungu yuyo ingao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">yeye iyowakombola awala wana imimoyo inoghile.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Imulungu yuyo mlamtsi wa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">yeye kowaghudubukila iwanu wehile chila haukucha.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Munu iyolema kuleka ghehile, katsomnolela lipanga lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">upinde wake kaupfedula, na kawika ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Kamtengenetsela silaha tsa ukukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">na imishale yake itsakwaka milambi ya ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Munu kughula usungu wa ukweleka ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">inda iyakindile ya ughobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">naye kakweleka ung'enye.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Kohimba lipondo na kolimalitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">kuya kakughwa imwenyegho mna lipondo liyahimbile.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Ghehile ghayatendile ghomuyila imwenyegho, na ughobo wake womughwila mna lilotsi lyake imwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Nitsomlongela mighede IMNDEWA kwaapfila yeye kana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">Nitsakwimba nilitunye litaghwa lya IMNDEWA iyali kuchanya ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukwela kwa Imulungu na ukulu wa imunu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">lola litaghwa lyako pfalili na utunitso mkulu mna isi yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Ghweghwe yuwikile utunitso wako kuchanya ng'ani kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Imilomo ya iwana wadowado na iwoghwaghwa ina tsingupfu tsa kukutunya ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">nawo wowatenda awala iwokwihila na iwobama kukuyitsila ghehile wenyamale.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Hanilola kulanga, kuumbile kwa ipfidole pfako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">ghumwetsi na tsinondo, ipfinu pfawikile ako,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />Imunu yali chinu chachi ghendo mbaka ghweghwe umkumbuke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">Na imwana wa imunu yali choni ghendo mbaka ghweghwe umwalangitse?<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Kumtenda chidogho yawe ka Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">kumpfatsa litaji lya utunitso na heshima.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Kumwika yatawale mchanya mwa tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">pfinu pfose kupfika hasi ha ghamaghulu ghake,<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />wang'olo wose, na wang'ombe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">pfipfila na wanyama wa kunyika,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />wapfideghe wa kulanga, na wasomba iwali mna ibahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">na chila ichiumbe ichipfosa mna tsinzila tsa ibahari.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">lola litaghwa lyako pfalili na utunitso mkulu mna isi yose!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s">Mighede Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Nitsomtunya IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">nitsoghapeta matendo ghako ghose gha ukukangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Nitsosekelela na kukudeng'elela Ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">nitsakwimba nilitunye litaghwa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">ghweghwe yuli Kuchanya ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Aduwi tsangu hawakuya kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">wekwala na wohupa hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Mana Ghweghwe kunilamlila kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kukala mna ichighoda chako cha ufalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kulamla kwa ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Kuwakembela iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">na iwehile kuwatighina tighina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">litaghwa lyao kulibaghusa ghendo matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Maaduwi wamalitsika matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">imiji yawo kuibomola iwa mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">nawo ng'awokumbukighwa keli baye.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kotawala matsua ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">keka ichighoda chake cha ufalume yaighe.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Naye katsolamla isi kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">naye katsowahigha iwanu wali mna tsiisi kwa ukugholosa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Iwanu iwodununzighwa watsomtsumila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">naye ka ingome mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughanzika.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Iwolimanya litaghwa lyako, wehuwila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">ghweghwe, MNDEWA ng'uwaleka baye awala iwokubama.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA iyokala Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">muwalongele iwanu aghala ghayatendile,<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Kwaapfila yeye kokumbuka na kowaliha ghehile awala iwokoma wayaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">ng'achisemwile baye ichililo chawo iwodununzika.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Umbonele libatsi, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">ulole pfanidununzika kulawa kwa awala iwonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">Ghwe MNDEWA, unyinule kulawa kuna ghamalango gha lifwa,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />ili nikakwimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">mna ghamalango gha Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">ako nitsodeng'elela apfila pfaunikombole.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Iwanu wa isi nyingi waghwa mna lipondo lyawahimbile iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">ghamaghulu ghawo ghonzeka mna tsinyapfu tsawateghile iwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />IMNDEWA kelangusa apfila pfayali kwa ukuhigha ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">iwanu wehile wonzeka kwa aghala ghawatendile iwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Iwehile watsoghenda kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">ona, iwanu wose iwomsemwa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Lekeni imunu mhingwa ng'atsosemwighwa baye matsua ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">wala ukuhuwila kwa munu iyodununzika ng'akutsohupa baye matsua ghose.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Winuke, ghwe MNDEWA! Uleke kumleka imunu yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">waleke iwanu wa tsiisi wahighighwe hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Ghwe MNDEWA, watende waghudeme kwa wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">waleke iwanu wa tsiisi wetambule kama wawo wanu hela.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba hutendelighwe gha ihaki</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Hebali, ghwe MNDEWA, ukwima kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Hebali wipfisa mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughanzika?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Kwa ichidandali chake imunu yehile komuwinda imunu mhingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">naye imhingwa kakonzeka mna imitegho ayo.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Kwaapfila imunu yehile kotambila aghala ghayosulukila mmoyo mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">imunu yana imisi kombetsa na komlighita IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Kwa ichidandali chake imunu yehile ng'ombama baye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">mna tsimbutsi tsake tsose komwona Imulungu si chinu baye.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Chila chinu chayotenda yeye kobweda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">ghamalamtsi ghako gha kuchanya, ghakutali na tsinenge tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">aduwi tsake wose kowabetsa.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Mna ghumoyo ghwake kolonga, “Haduhu chinu cha kunihighisa nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">ipfeleko pfangu pfose ipfikutsa ng'apfitsoghanzika baye.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Ghumlomo ghwake ghumema ghamalighito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">ukughutsuka na ukulagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">ilulimi lwake lolonga mbuli itsighala maghayo na ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Kopfisila iwanu habehi na ipfijiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">kepfisa yamkome imunu yalihela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">tsinenge tsake tsomwinda imunu iyali nyonde nyonde.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Kopfisila kulonga simba iyobama kughogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">kopfisila yamghoghe imunu iyali nyonde nyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">komghogha imunu nyonde nyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">na komkwegheta aku kamna ghumtegho ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Iwanu iwali nyonde nyonde wohondighwa na wakughwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">wonzeka na imunu yehile yana tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Naye mmoyo kelongela apfino, “Imulungu kesemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">uhanga wake kaupfisa, ng'akona ghendo baye.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Winuke! Ghwe IMNDEWA, winule ghumoko ghwako uwatowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">Uleke kuwasemwa awala iwodununzika.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Hebali imunu yehile yombetsa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">Mna ghumoyo ghwake kelongela apfino, “Ng'atsonihigha baye.”<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Lekeni ghweghwe kwakwona ghamadununzo na ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">naghwe kutsowatowa kwa ghumoko ghwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Imunu nyonde nyonde keghwisa mmoko mwako umwapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Mana ghweghwe yuyo yuwapfila ing'awana baba.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Ughubene ghumoko ghwake imunu yehile na yang'ana libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">umtende yaghaleke ghamatendo ghake ghose ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />IMNDEWA kamfalume matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Iwanu wa tsiisi wohupa kulawa mna isi yake.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Ghweghwe, ghwe MNDEWA, kuhulika achila chawobama iwodununzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">ghumoyo ghwawo kughutenda ghusindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">Mana lighutwi lyako lyowahulikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />kowawamile ing'awana baba na iwodununzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">iwanu iwali dongo hela, waleke kuwaghela chidedemo keli.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlolela IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />IMNDEWA yuyo yanimtsumile nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">hebali lelo mnongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Ghuluka ka chideghe utsumile kuchidunda,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />kwa apfila iwanu wehile wopfedula tsiminde tsao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wakwika imishale yao mna tsiminde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wawatowe mchisi iwanu wana imimoyo inoghile.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Ka imisingi ing'ahinyighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">imunu yana ihaki yatsodaha kutenda choni?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />IMNDEWA kamna ing'anda yake yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">yeye IMNDEWA ichighoda chake chakulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Tsinenge tsake tsolola, na tsikope tsake tsowaghetsa iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />IMNDEWA komghetsa imunu yana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">lekeni ghumoyo ghwake ghomwihila imunu iyehile na imghobo.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Katsowaghalila imitegho, na katsowatowela iwanu wehile imvula ya makala gha moto na ibaluti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">naye katsowatowa ghendo na libeho ililakatsa, achi chicho chayatsowaliha.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kana ihaki, koghakunda matendo gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">iwanu wana imimoyo inoghile watsowona uhanga wake.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Unikombole, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwaapfila kuduhu keli imunu iyompfuka Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">iwompfuka Imulungu wahupa ghendo kulawa mna iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Chila munu komghutsukila miyaghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">wana imilomo ilonga utalatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">na welongela aku mimoyo yawo ina mitsengwe.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Leka IMNDEWA yaikane imilimi yose ikomba komba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">na imilimi ilonga mbuli tsa ukwighoda,<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />ya awala iwolonga, “Kwa milimi yetu tutsohuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">imilomo yetu twinayo tuwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">haduhu munu wa kutughoma tuleke kulonga.”<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">“Kwaapfila iwanu wahingwa wakonelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">na wanu nyonde nyonde woghutilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">nene lelo nitsakwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">na nitsowakombola awala iwonibama nene niwakombole.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Ghamalonga gha IMNDEWA ghela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ka fetsa ihopfughighwe mna litanulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ihopfughighwe mala saba.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Ghweghwe, Ghwe IMNDEWA, utwike tuwe wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">utukinge matsua ghose na icheleko achino chihile.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Iwanu iwehile wakwanga chila hanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">akuno ighehile ghawo ghotunyighwa mna iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukumbolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, utsonisemwa nene mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Pfihi kutsonisemwa kwa matsuwa ghose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Kutsonipfisa uhanga wako mbaka tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Nitsakwalangula mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Chilo na misi noghanzika mmoyo mwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Aduwi yangu yanitoweghe mbaka tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Undole na unyidike, ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Utsimwemwesele tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">ndeke kuwasa tsinongo tsa lifwa.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Hela aduwi yangu katsalonga, “Nimhuma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Nawo iwonidununza watsodeng'elela ukughwa kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Lekeni nene nihuwila mna uluso wa lilaghano lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">ghumoyo ghwangu ghutsodeng'elela kwaapfila ghweghwe kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Ghwe IMNDEWA nitsokwimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">kwa aghala ghaunitendele kwa uluso wako.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s">Ghehile gha iwanu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Iwanu wabotsi wolonga mmoyo mwawo, “Kuduhu Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Wose wagha ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">wotenda pfinu pfa ukudesa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">kuduhu hata yumwe iyotenda ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Kulawa kulanga IMNDEWA kowalola iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">yalole ka kuna munu wowose yana tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">ayula iyombama Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Lekeni mwe! Wose ghendo wagha, wose wola ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">kuduhu iyotenda ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">baye, haduhu hata yumwe ghendo!<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Angu pfihi, iwanu awala wose iwotenda ighehile ng'awomanya baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Awala iwowadafuna iwanu wangu kulonga wodafuna pfighate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">wala ng'awomlomba IMNDEWA baye.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Baho watsakwingilighwa na wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwaapfila Imulungu kahamwe na icheleko cha iwanu wana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Mwodaha kupfulaghitsa achila chayobama kutenda imunu mhingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">lekeni yeye komtsumila IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Ukombotsi wa Isiraeli ung'atsile kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">yaghale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Aho IMNDEWA hayowoyitsa iwanu wake iwohighwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Yakobu katsosekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Isiraeli katsodeng'a.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s">Chayobama Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, nani iyatsokala mna lihema lyako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Nani iyatsokala mna ichidunda chako ichelile?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Ng'ambe imunu ayula iyokala bila kutotsatotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">iyotenda ighali ghahaki matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">iyolongesa kulawa mmoyo mwake,<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />ng'ambe ayula yana ilulimi iluleka kulonga ung'enye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">ayula ing'ayomtendela baye sale yake ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">na ayula ing'ayombangitsila imunu iyokala habehi naye.<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />Ona, iwanu wehile yeye kowabetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">lekeni kowatoghola wose awala iwompfuka IMNDEWA.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Yang'elaha mna imbuli yoyose, yeye koitenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">hata ka itsombidukila imwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />Yeye kowatsima iwanu litobole na ng'obama baye inyongetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Wala ng'obokela baye hongo yamdidimitse imunu iyali hela totso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Imunu iyotenda aghano ghose, matsuwa ghose ng'atsohighitsika baye.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yakukinge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, unikinge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwaapfila nene nokutsumila ghweghwe niwe mgima.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Nimlongela IMNDEWA, “Ghweghwe kwa Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">chila chinu chinoghile chilawa kuna ghweghwe,”<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Na iwanu iwelile iwali muisi, wawo wanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">nene nonoghelwa kukala nawo.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Awala iwomleka Imulungu na kuibama imilungu ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">ukudununzika kwawo kutsakongetseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">nene sitsohangila nawo baye mna ukutsilapfa tsinambiko tsawo tsa idamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">wala kughakema ghamataghwa gha imilungu yawo mna ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA yuyo yungaya chila chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">ugima wangu wamna ghamoko ghako.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Isi yungaile inogha ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">ona, nibokela hanu hanoghile ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Nene nitsomdeng'elela IMNDEWA iyonifunda ghamahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">hata kuchilo ghumoyo ghwangu ghonilangulisa cha ukutenda.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Matsuwa ghose nene nimwika IMNDEWA hambele hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">yeye kaubali wangu wa kujilo, sitsohighisika baye.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Apfo lelo ghumoyo ghwangu ghosekelela na ukudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">na ilukuli lwangu lutsobwihila tulu.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Ona! Ghweghwe ng'utsonileka nene baye nikale kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">wala ng'utsomleka baye imunu wako iyelile yole.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Ila kutsonilangulitsa nitsimanye tsinzila itsilongotsa kuna ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">na kutsonimemetsa indeng'elo kwa ukuwa kwako habehi na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">mana kuna ubali wako wa kujilo kumema ighanoghile ing'aghomala baye.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu iyali hela totso</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, uhulike, ukulomba kwangu ikuli kwa ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">uhulikitse ichililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">uwambe lighutwi lyako utegheletse chanilomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">ichilawa mna ghumlomo ighuli hela ung'enye.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Unitendele malamtsi gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">kwaapfila tsinenge tsako tsakona aghala ighagholoke.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Kughulolesa ghumoyo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">na kunyangila kuchilo unighetse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">na ng'wonile chinu chochose chihile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kwaapfila nene niwania ghendo nileke kutotsa kwa imilomo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Kwa aghala ghawotenda iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">nene nibita kutali na tsinzila tsa iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">kwaapfila tsanitegheletsa chaunilaghitse.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Matsayo ghangu ghakoleletsa tsinzila tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">ghamaghulu ghangu ng'aghatotsile inzila baye.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Nokulanga ghwe Imulungu, kwaapfila kutsonyidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">uniteghele lighutwi lyako uhulike ghanilomba.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Wonese ghamatendo ghako makulu gha ukukangawatsa ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">ghweghwe yuwakombola kwa ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">awala iwokutsumila ghweghwe kulawa kwa aduwi tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Unikinge ka pfachikingighwa ichiluli cha inenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">unipfise hachimbeho ha ghamabawa ghako,<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />kulawa kwa iwanu iwehile iwonidununza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">maaduwi tsangu iwonitsunguluka wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Imimoyo yawo ihindighwa yahela libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">kwa imilomo yawo wolonga kwa chidandali.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Wanikoleletsa na sambi wanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">na tsinenge tsawo watsikodola wanighwise hasi,<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />kulonga simba iyadowile iyobama kumdeghadegha imnyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">kama imwana wa simba iyopfitsila imnyama wa ukumghogha.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Winuke, ghwe MNDEWA, witowe nawo, uwaghwise hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">kwa lipanga lyako uukombole ugima wangu kulawa kwa iwanu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Kwa ghumoko ghwako, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">unikombole kulawa kwa iwanu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">iwanu iwosulukila ipfinu pfa muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">na wodeng'elela tsimali tsawo, na aghala ighanoghile ghauwongetse wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">na iwana wawo, mbaka nawo wawalekele iwana wawo.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Lekeni nene nahela totso, apfo nitsowona uhanga wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">hanilamka nitsodeng'elela kwa ukuwona uhanga wako pfauli.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Daudi pfayahumile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Nokukunda, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:1">yauli tsingupfu tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />IMNDEWA yeye libambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">ngome yangu na mkombotsi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Imulungu wangu yuyo libambalawe lyangu lyanitsumila nihone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">ingao yangu, na imembe ya ukombotsi wangu, na ingome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Nomkema IMNDEWA, yeye iyobamighwa kutunyighwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">Yeye konikombola kulawa kwa aduwi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Imitsabi ya lifwa tsainitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">na ghamawimbi gha ukunikoma ghanikululusa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Imitsabi ya ukufa tsainitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">mitegho ya ukufa iteghighwa mnzila mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Nene nimkema IMNDEWA haning'ali noghanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Nimlilila Imulungu wangu yanyapfile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Naye kahulika litsi lyangu kulawa kuko kuna ing'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">na ichililo changu chipfika mna ghamaghutwi ghake.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Baho isi idedema na ihighisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">na imisingi ya ipfidunda ihighisika na idedema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">kwa apfila Imulungu tsakaghudubuka.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Yosi lilawa mna imula yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">lilambi lya ghumoto lilawa mna ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">na makala ighakwaka ghalawa mghati mwake.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Kalipfughula lilanga kahulumka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">na kukala na bingu titu hasi ha ghamaghulu ghake.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Kadina mchanya mwa kelubi kaghuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">naye kaghuluka mchanya mwa ghamabawa gha ikelubi ayo.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Kachitenda ichisi chimpfiseghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">imvula na libingu litinile kapfitenda pfiwe hema lyake.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Lumwesa halupulike hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">kulawila mabingu matitu ghabita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">hamwe na mvula ya mabwe na makala gha ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />IMNDEWA kaduma kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">yeye iyali kuchanya ng'ani kalapfa litsi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">baho kulawila mvula ya mabwe, na makala gha moto.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Kawasila imishale yake, nawo wapwililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">na kawapulika na lumwesa, nawo watsuma ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, hauwakembele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">na tsimula tsako hatsihumule kwa ukuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">baho tsoneka tsinzila ng'ulu tsa ghamatsi mna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">na imisingi ya isi nayo yoneka mwatsi.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Kanihulumkila kulawa kuchanya, kanisola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">kanipfula kulawa kuna ghamatsi ighamemile.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Kanikombola kulawa kwa aduwi tsangu wana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">na kulawa kwa awala iwonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kwaapfila wawo tsawana ngupfu nyingi kunibita nene.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Wanipfamila mna litsuwa lya ukughanzika kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">lekeni IMNDEWA kanyapfila,<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Kanilapfa kanighala hanu ihenelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">kanihonetsa kwa apfila tsa kanoghelighwa na nene.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />IMNDEWA kanitendela apfo kwaapfila nene tsanitenda ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">kanigweka kwa ukulola ghamoko ghangu pfaghelile.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Kwaapfila tsanitsikinda tsinzila tsa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">wala sitendile baye ighehile kwa kumleka Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Nighakinda ghamalaghitso ghake ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">wala siilekile baye imiko yake.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Nene tsasikalile na totso baye hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">na nikinga nimwenyegho ndeke ukutenda inzambi.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />MNDEWA kanitendela apfo kwaapfila nene nitenda ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">kanighweka kwa ukulola ghamoko ghangu pfaghelile hambele hake.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Ghweghwe kotogholeka kwa awala iwotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">na kwa awala iwalihela matotso kwebonesa kunogha.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Kwebonesa kwela kwa iwanu iwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">lekeni kwamkali kwa iwanu iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Ghweghwe kowakombola iwanu iwodununzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">lekeni awala iweghoda kowahulumsa.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA, yuyo yutuwagha itala yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">ghwe Imulungu wangu, lelo umwemwese mna ichisi changu.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Ghweghwe haunyapfila, nene nodaha kuwawinga maasikali wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">Ona, Imulungu wangu ung'anyapfila, nene nodaha kudaluka ubanda.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Imulungu ayuno ghamatendo ghake ghaghoya ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">lilonga lyake IMNDEWA lyotogholeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">Yeye kangawo kwa awala wose iwomtsumila.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Nani iyali Mulungu ka si IMNDEWA yaliyeka baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Na nani iyali Bambalawe ka si Imulungu wetu baye?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Imulungu yuyo iyongaya tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">yuyo iyoitenda inzila yangu ileke kuwa na totso.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Kaitenda imighulu yangu iwa ka imighulu ya mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">na kanimisa ghoya hanu hangu henulighwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Kaghafunditsa ghamoko ghangu ukwitowa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">nagho ghodaha ukupfedula iminde ya shaba.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Ghweghwe kungaya ingao ya ukombotsi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghunikindilisa uchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">naghwe kwihulumsa na kunitenda niwe mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Tsihatuwa tsangu kutsongetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">na mighulu yangu ng'aitelebuke baye.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Niwakoleletsa aduwi tsangu mbaka niwaghogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">nani suyile kuchughu baye ghendo mbaka haniwamalitse.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Niwabenabena mbaka ng'awadahile kwinuka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">waghwa hasi ha ghamaghulu ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Naghwe kunyoha tsingupfu tsa ukwitowa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">awala iwanyinukile kuwatenda wanyinamile hamaghulu ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Na aduwi tsangu kungaya niwabajughe msingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">na awala iwonyihila niwabanyanga.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Wakemelela lekeni ng'oneke munu wa kuwakombola baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">wamlilila IMNDEWA lekeni ng'awedike baye.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Niwahondahonda wawa ka timbwisi ilighulusighwa na libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">niwasa kunze ka likododo lya mnzila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Kunikombola kulawa kwa iwanu iwonitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">kunitenda niwe mkulu wa iwanu wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">wanu ing'asiwamanyile baye wonitumikila.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Iwagheni wonitsila aku wonyinamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">hawohulika tsimbuli tsa ukuhuma kwangu wonitsila.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Iwagheni tsawatenyuka imimoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">wonitsila akuno woghudema kulawa mna tsingome tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyali mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">na yatunyighwe yeye iyali Libambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">naye yenulighwe ng'ani, Imulungu wa ukombotsi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Yeye yuyo Imulungu iyowoyitsila iwanu ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">naye kaweka iwanu wa isi tsingi hasi ha ghamaghulu ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Kanikombola kulawa kwa aduwi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">kanyinula niwe mchanya mwa awala iwanyinukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">na kanikombola kulawa kwa iwanu waghobo.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Ghwe MNDEWA, apfo nitsokulongela mighede mna tsiisi tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">na nitsakwimba nilitunye litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Komtenda yahume ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">ona! Yahume ng'ani, mfalume wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">na komtendela uluso wa lilaghano lyake Masiha wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">Daudi na iwanu wa ilweleko lwake matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Imulungu mna ukuumba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Kulanga kotangatsa utunitso wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">na lilanga lyopeta isang'ano ya ghamoko ghake,<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />imisi imwe mbaka imisi ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">tsakonesa ukumanya chilo chimwe mbaka chilo ichikutsa.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Kuduhu malonga, wala lugha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">na litsi lyao ng'alihulikika baye,<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />lekeni imbuli yawo yenela mna isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">na ghamalonga ghawo ghapfika kwaitsighila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">kuko kulanga kalikila hema litsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />Nalyo lyolawa kama immale iyokwela pfayolawa kuchumba kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">lyodeng'elela kulonga munu mmale yana ngupfu iyowinza inzila yake.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Lyolawa kulawa ubali umwe wa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">lyotsunguluka mbaka ubali ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">na kuduhu chinu chochose ichidaha ukuhepa ukusoma kwake.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Ghamalangulitso gha IMNDEWA ghenelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">ghomwing'a imunu ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">imiko ya IMNDEWA yotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">yomwing'a hekima imunu ayula iyalihela nayo.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Imilongotso ya IMNDEWA inogha ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">yotenda ghumoyo ghudeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">na laghitso lya IMNDEWA lyomeletseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">lyomwemwesela tsinenge.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA chinu chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">na kutsokala matsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Malamtsi gha IMNDEWA gholongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">na ghose ghahaki ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Agho ghabamighwe kubita inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kubita inzahabu inoghile ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">agho ghamta kubita ukwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kubita ukwi uli mna lisegha.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Pfipfila ghonikanya nene inili mtumwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">na ghonighweka makulu ning'aghakinda.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Lekeni nani iyodaha ukutanga ghamatotso ghake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Apfo nileghusile tsinzambi tsangu itsipfisike.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Pfipfila unikinge nene imtumighwa wako ndeke kutenda nzambi kwa ukubama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">na tsinzambi atso tsileke kunitawala nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">aho nitsakuwa nyela, na nitsakuwa nahela totso kulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Ughaleke ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">na ghamawatso gha ghumoyo ghwangu ghatogholighwe hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Ghwe MNDEWA, Bambalawe lyangu, na Mkombotsi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba uhume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />IMNDEWA yakwidike mna litsuwa lya ukughanzika kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">litaghwa lya Imulungu wa Yakobo likwinule.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Yeye yatse yakwapfile kulawa kuna ing'anda yake iyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">na yakwing'e ingupfu kulawa kuchidunda cha Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Yatsikumbuke tsinambiko tsako tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">na yatsitoghole tsinambiko tsako tsa ukulakatsighwa.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Yakwing'e chaghubama ghumoyo ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">Na yaitimilitse imipango yako yose.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Natwe tutsakwimba tudeng'elele ukuhuma kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">na kwa litaghwa lya Imulungu wetu tutsodinitsa tsibendela tsetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">IMNDEWA yakutendele aghala ghose ghaumlombile.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Lelo nomanya ka IMNDEWA komkombola mbakighwa mapfuta wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">komwidika kulawa kulanga kwake ikwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">katsomkombola kwa ghamatendo makulu gha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Wamwe wehuwila imituka ya ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">na wangi wehuwila wafalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">lekeni twetwe twehuwila litaghwa lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Wawo wohulumsighwa hasi na wakughwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">lekeni twetwe tutsakwinuka na kwima ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, mkombole mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">mna litsuwa lyatukukema utwidike.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s">Mighede Imulungu kwa ukuhuma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, mfalume kodeng'elela tsingupfu tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">lola pfayobweda ghengo ahala haumtenda yahume.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Kumwing'a achila chaghubamile ghumoyo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">na achila chayakulombile kwa ghumlomo ghwake ng'umwimile baye.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Kwaapfila kumtsila kumghweka pfinu pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">na mwitwi mwake kumpfatsa taji ya nzahabu.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Kakulomba ugima, naghwe kumwing'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">kumwing'a ugima wa matsuwa mengi, ghamatsuwa ing'aghomala baye.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Ukuhuma kwaumwapfile kumwongetsela iheshima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">kumwing'a ukulu na ukutunyighwa.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Komwing'a tsibalaka ing'atsihupa matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">komtenda yadeng'elele na kusekelela hayakuwa hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Kwaapfila mfalume kehuwila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">na kehuwila uluso wa ayula iyali kuchanya ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">apfo lelo yeye ng'atsohighisika baye.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Ghumoko ghwako ghutsowaghogha aduwi tsako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">ona, ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghutsowaghogha awala iwokuhila.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Aho hautsowalawila, kutsowatenda wawe kama tanulu lya ghumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">IMNDEWA katsowaghudubukila na katsowametsa, na ghumoto ghutsowalambita.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Iwana wawo kutsowahinya kulawa mna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">na ilweleko lwawo kulawa mna iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Kwaapfila tsawabama wakutendele ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">na imitsengwe yawo yawekile ng'awatsoitenda baye.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Kwaapfila hautsowasila imishale yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">watsohunduka watsume.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Lelo winuke ghwe MNDEWA, kwaapfila kuna ng'apfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">na twetwe tutsakwimba tutsideng'elele tsingupfu tsako.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s">Chililo cha ukughuta na wila wa ukutunya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, hebali unilekile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Hebali ukala kutali, na nene nobama unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">naghwe ng'uhulika baye ukughuta kwangu?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nolila nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">lekeni ng'unyidika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">nolila nechilo, lekeni sikona ng'apfu baye.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Lekeni ghweghwe kwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">yukalila ichighoda cha ufalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">na yutunyighwa na Waisiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Wahenga wetu tsawehuwila kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">tsawehuwila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">naghwe kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Tsawakulilila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">nawo wakombolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">wehuwila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">nawo ng'awaghelighwe chinyala baye.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Na nene namng'onyo, wala sili munu ghendo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">chila munu konikojonga, na iwanu wose wonibetsa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Wose iwombona nene woniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">wonifonza akuno wohighisa ghamatwi ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Wolonga, “Kehuwila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">leka lelo IMNDEWA yamhonetse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">leka yamkombole, kwaapfila yeye tsakanoghelwa naye.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Lekeni ghweghwe yuyo yunilapfile kulawa munda mwa mai wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">kunyika mgima ahala hanikalile mna ghamatombo gha mai wangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Nene nawakwako ghweghwe tangiya hanyoneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">tangiya hanikalile mna lida lya mai wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Uleke kukala kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">kwaapfila maghayo gha habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">wala haduhu munu wa ukunyapfila.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Maaduwi wengi wanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wakali ka mbogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wanitsingila ka mbogho wa Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Wanyasamila imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">kulonga simba iyodadatsula na iyoduma.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Nyitika kama matsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">imipate yangu yose ihulusuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">Ghumoyo ghwangu ghuwa kama nta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">ghulumbuka mghati mwangu ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Tsingupfu tsangu tsinyala kama chihali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">na ilulimi lwangu lunanahila mna lipate lya ghamatsino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">naghwe kuniwasitsa mna litimbwisi lya lifwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Mana mtingano ghwa iwotenda ighehile ghunitsingila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">kulonga wambwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">wanitsunguluka na waghadeghadegha ghamoko ghangu na ghamaghulu ghangu ka simba.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Nene nisoka mbaka mipate yangu yopeteka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">maaduwi tsangu wondola na wonikodolela tsinenge.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Wegholela tsinguwo tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">na libwende lyangu wegholela kwa ukwasa simbi.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Lelo naghwe, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">uleke kukala kutali ghweghwe yauli tsingupfu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">utse hima unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Uukombole ugima wangu ndeke kulaghighwa na lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">ugima wangu ghendo kulawa mna tsinumba tsa yumbwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Unilopole kulawa mna ghumlomo ghwa isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">ka apfila pfaunikombole kulawa mna tsimembe tsa imbogho.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Nitsopeta tsimbuli tsa litaghwa lyako kwa wandughu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">mghati mwa ghumtingano ghwawo nitsokutunya ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Mwemwe yamumpfuka IMNDEWA mtunyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">mwemwe iwatsukulu wa Yakobu wose mtunyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">mpfukeni mwemwe wose yamli watsukulu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Ng'obetsa baye wala si mtalatsi baye mna ukughaya kwa imunu iyoghanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Wala ng'ampfisile ichihanga chake baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">lekeni hayamlilile yamwapfile kamwidika.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Nene nitsokutunya kuna ghumtingano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">hambele ha awala iwokupfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">nene nitsotenda aghala ghanilahile ukutenda.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Iwahole watsakuja na kwighuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">awala iwombama IMNDEWA watsomtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">imimoyo yenu naiwe na ugima matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Iwanu iwali chila ubali kwaitsighila isi watsokumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">na kumhundukila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">na tsikolo tsose tsa iwanu wali muisi watsokwinamila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA yuyo mfalume, naye kotawala tsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Matajili wose iwali muisi watsakuja na kumwinamila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">wose iwakufa watsomwinamila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">awala ing'awodaha baye ukwitenda wakale wagima.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Iwatsukulu iwakutsa watsomtumikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">na ipfileko pfitsolongelighwa tsimbuli tsa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Na iwanu iwatsakoneka hambele watsolongelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">“IMNDEWA yuyo iyawakombole apfino iwanu!”<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA yuyo mdimi wangu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />IMNDEWA yuyo imdimi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">sitsohungukighwa na chinu baye.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Koniwasitsa mna ghumghina ghwa imitsani imibisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">na konilongotsa mmbalimbali mwa ipfikolongo pfa ghamatsi ighatindimale.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Konitenda niwe na tsingupfu keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">na konilongotsa mna tsinzila tsa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">kwa ajili ya litaghwa lyake.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Hata hanibita mna ilubonde luna ligitsa totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">sitsopfuka ighehile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa hamwe na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">ligongo lyako na ing'weku yako pfonikanza.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Koitanda imetsa ya ipfijo hambele hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">akuno aduwi tsangu wolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kunibaka ghamafuta mwitwi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">ichikombe changu chomema ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Ona ghendo, uluso wako na libatsi lyako pfitsonikoleletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">na nene nitsokala mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA kwa matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Isi na pfose pfili mumo pfakwake yeye IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">na awala wose iwali muisi wose wakwake.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Mana yeye keka imisingi ya isi mchanya mwa ibahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">na kaihimika ime ghoya mchanya mwa imito ya ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Nani iyatsogheluka yaghende kuna ichidunda cha IMNDEWA?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Na nani iyatsakwima hanu hake helile?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Ng'ambe ayula yana ghamoko ghelile na yana ghumoyo ghunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">ayula iyeghomile imwenyegho ukutambikila ipfinyagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">na ayula ghendo ing'ayoghutsuka baye hayelaha.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Ayo katsobokela tsibalaka kulawa kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">na haki kulawa kwa Imulungu imkombotsi wake.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Acho chicho icheleko cha awala iwombama yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">awala iwoubama uhanga wako, ghwe Imulungu wa Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Mwinule ghamatwi ghenu mwemwe ghamalango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">na mwemwe imilango ya ghumwande ghendo mwinuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">mfalume wa utunitso yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Angu imfalume ayo wa utunitso nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ng'ambe ayo IMNDEWA, yana tsingupfu na uwetso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">yana uwetso mna ukwitowa kung'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Mwinule ghamatwi ghenu mwemwe ghamalango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">na mwemwe imilango ya ghumwande ghendo mwinuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">mfalume wa utunitso yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Angu imfalume ayo wa utunitso nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Ng'ambe ayo IMNDEWA, imkulu wa maasikali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">yeye yuyo mfalume wa utunitso.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yakulongotse na yakukinge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Kuna ghweghwe ghwe MNDEWA, nakwinula iloho yangu,<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nene nehuwila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">ndeke kughelighwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">aduwi tsangu waleke kunihuma.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Awala wose iwokubeta ghweghwe ng'awatsoghelighwa chinyala baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">lekeni watsoghelighwa chinyala awala wose iwowania kutenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Ghwe MNDEWA, unilanguse tsinzila tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">unilangulitse tsinzila tsaubama nene nibite.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Nilongotse mna ukulongesa na unilangulitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">ghweghwe kwa Imulungu imkombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">nikubeta ghweghwe imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Ukumbuke libatsi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">na uluso wako, ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kwaapfila apfo pfabaho kulawa ghumwande.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Uleke kukumbuka tsinzambi tsanitendile haning'ali na msongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">wala ghamatotso ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">ila unikumbuke kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">na kwaapfila ghweghwe IMNDEWA kunogha.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />IMNDEWA kanogha na kagholoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">apfo kowalangulitsa wana tsinzambi inzila yake.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Kowalongotsa iwanu wahole watende ighali ghahaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">na kowafunda iwanu iwahole inzila yake.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Tsinzila tsose tsa IMNDEWA tsa uluso na tsotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">kwa awala wose iwolikinda lilaghano lyake na ghamalaghitso ghake.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Kwa ajili ya litaghwa lyako, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">unileghusile litotso lyangu mana kulu.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Angu nani iyompfuka IMNDEWA?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Ayo katsomlangulitsa mna inzila iyatsoisaghula.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Imunu ayo katsobweba ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">na iwanaghe watsakwing'ighwa isi iwe yawo.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />IMNDEWA kowalongotsa na awala iwompfuka yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">naye kowatenda walimanye lilaghano lyake.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Tsinenge tsangu tsomlolela IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">naye katsoilapfa imighulu yangu kulawa mna ilwapfu.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Unihundukile undole, na umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwaapfila nene na mchuwa na noghanzika.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Ghamaghayo gha ghumoyo ghwangu ghongetseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">lelo undapfe kulawa mna ukughanzika kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Lola apfila pfanighaya na pfanighanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">kuya unileghusile tsinzambi tsangu tsose.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Ulole aduwi tsangu pfawali wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">na apfila pfawonyihila mno.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Uukinge ugima wangu, na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">uleke kunileka nighelighwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">kwaapfila nene nokutsumila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Ighanoghile na ighali ghahaki ghanyike mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwaapfila nene nehuwila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Ghwe Imulungu, wakombole iwanu wako Waisiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:22">kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghawo ghose.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu yanoghile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Unihighe, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwaapfila nene ng'ala aku nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">nani nihuwila IMNDEWA, bila kuya kuchughu.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Ghwe MNDEWA, unikaghule na undole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">ughetse ghumoyo ghwangu na ghamawatso ghangu tsangu,<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Mana uluso wako mkulu wa hambele ha tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">nani nokala mna ukulongesa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Sikala na iwanu iwang'enye baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">wala sikwanga na awala iwebalaghutsa baye.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Noghuhila ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">na sitsokala baye hamwe na iwanu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Nonawa ghamoko ghangu kulangusa ka nene nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">na noitsunguluka imatsabahu yako, ghwe MNDEWA,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />aku nokemelelela nolonga mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">na kutsisima tsing'onde tsa ukukangawatsa tsautendile.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Ghwe MNDEWA, nohakunda hanu haukala ha ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">na hanu haukala utunitso wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Uleke kunikoma hamwe na iwanu wana tsinzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">na hamwe na iwokoma iwanu,<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />awala iwotenda ighehile kwa ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">na awala iwobokela hongo kwa ghumoko ghwawo ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Lekeni nene nitsokala kwa ukutenda ighagholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">umbonele libatsi na unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Ghumghulu ghwangu ghwima hanu ihatindimale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">mna imitingano nitsomtunya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s">Kwa Imulungu kuna ugima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />IMNDEWA yuyo ghumwanga ghwangu na ukombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">lelo nene yanitsompfuka nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">IMNDEWA yuyo ingome ya ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">lelo nene yanitsamwonela wogha nani?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Iwotenda ghehile hawanitsile habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wandiye inyama yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">awo iwehile wangu na aduwi tsangu wekwala waghwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Hata maasikali wengi wang'anitsunguluka wetowe na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">ghumoyo ghwangu ng'aghutsopfuka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">hata ng'ondo ing'anilawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">nene sitsoleka baye ukwihuwila Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Chinu chimwe nimlomba IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nacho chicho chanitsobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nene nikale mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose gha ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nilolese ukunogha kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na ukumbama yeye mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Kwaapfila mna litsuwa lya maghayo katsonikinga niwe mgima mghati mwa ing'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">katsonipfisa mna ichimbeho cha lihema lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">na katsonyinula mchanya mwa libambalawe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Kuya litwi lyangu litsakwinulighwa mchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">na nitsowalola kwa ukuwatambila aduwi tsangu iwonitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">na nene nitsomlapfila IMNDEWA tsinambiko kwa ukudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nitsakwimba, na kumdeng'elela IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Ghwe MNDEWA, uhulikitse litsi lyangu hanikukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">naghwe umbonele libatsi na unyidike.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghonongela apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">“Uubame uhanga wake.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">apfo ghwe MNDEWA, nene nitsoubama uhanga wako.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Uleke kunipfisa uhanga wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">uleke kughudubuka na kundema nene imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">ghweghwe yuyo yunyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">uleke kunileka, wala kunyasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Ghwe Imulungu wa ukombotsi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Aba wangu na mai wangu wang'anileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">IMNDEWA katsonibokela.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Ghwe MNDEWA, unifunde inzila yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">na unilongotse mna inzila igholoke, kwaapfila ninawo maaduwi wengi.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Uleke kunileka maadui tsangu wanitende ka pfawobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwaapfila wakalangama wa ughutsu wanyinukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">nawo wobama kunendela ughobo.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Nene notoghola ghendo ka nitsakona ukunogha kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">mna isi ya iwali wagima.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Umbete IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">uwe na ngupfu, na ghumoyo ghwako ghugangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Ona, umbete IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, nokukema ghweghwe, yauli libambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">uleke kuwa chitsiwi kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">kwaapfila ung'enyamala ghendo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">nene nitseghala na awala iwoghenda kuna likaburi.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Hulika ichililo changu na umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">ahala hanikukema unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">na hanikwinulila ghamoko ghangu hanu hako helile ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Uleke kunibuluta hamwe na iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">na hamwe na awala iwotenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">iwolonga ighanoghile na wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">lekeni mna imimoyo yawo mna ung'enye.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Uwalihe kwa kulola aghala ghawatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">na kwa kulola ighehile ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">uwalihe kwa kulola tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghawo pfatsili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">Ona, uwalihe achila chawobamighwa walihighwe.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Kwa apfila wawo wotsitendela utalatsi tsing'onde tsa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">atsila tsayatendile kwa ghamoko ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">apfo yeye katsowabondabonda na ng'atsowenula keli baye.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Lelo yatunitsighwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">kwa apfila kahulika ichililo cha ukulomba kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyali tsingupfu tsangu, na ingao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">ghumoyo ghwangu ghwehuwila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">na nene nyapfilighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">ghumoyo ghwangu ghudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">na nene nitsomwimbila wila wa mighede.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />IMNDEWA yuyo yali tsingupfu tsa iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">na imbakighwa mapfuta wake yuyo iyomtsumila yamkombole.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Uwakombole iwanu wako, na ubaliki ulisi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">na uwadime, na uwakindise matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">Litsi lya Imulungu lina ngupfu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Mwing'eni IMNDEWA, mwemwe pfiumbe pfa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">mwing'eni IMNDEWA utunitso na tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Longeni kuwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA lina utunitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">mwinamileni aku mwela ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lyohulikika mchanya mwa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Imulungu wa utunitso koduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">IMNDEWA kamchanya mwa ghamatsi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lina ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">litsi lya IMNDEWA lina ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lyobena imikataluba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">ona, IMNDEWA koibenabena imikataluba ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Na kaitenda idalukedaluke kulonga imwana wa ing'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">na Lebanoni na Herimoni kulonga imwana wa mbogho.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lyolapfa ghamalambi gha ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lyotenda inyika idedeme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">IMNDEWA koitenda inyika ya Kadeshi idedeme.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Litsi lya IMNDEWA lyohighisa imibiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">na lyolaghatsa imitsani ya mibiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">na mna lihekalu lyake wose wolonga, “Utunitso!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />IMNDEWA kakala mchanya mwa ghamatsi ghamemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">naye IMNDEWA kakala ka mfalume wa matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />IMNDEWA katsoweng'a ngupfu iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">IMNDEWA katsowabaliki iwanu wake kwa kuweng'a tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s">Mighede Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, nitsokutunya kwaapfila kunyinula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">na ng'uwalekile baye aduwi tsangu waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, nikulilila ghweghwe unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">naghwe kunihonetsa.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Ghwe MNDEWA, kunikombola kulawa kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kungaya keli ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kundapfa ndeke kughenda hamwe na awala iwoghenda kutsimu.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA wila wa kumtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">mwemwe iwanu wake iwotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">mkumbuke apfila pfayelile na mlongeleni mighede.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Kwaapfila imaya yake yokala chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">na uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">chililo chodaha kukala chilo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">lekeni ukudeng'elela kwakutsa nemitondo.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Na nene hanikalile nibweda tsanilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Sitsohighisika ghendo baye!”<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Ghwe MNDEWA, kwa uluso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">kunitenda nime ghoya ka ichidunda chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">lekeni haunipfisile uhanga wako, nene nighanzika.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Nikulilila ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">na nimlomba IMNDEWA mbonelighwe libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />Angu utsopata choni nene ning'afa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Na utsobweda choni nene hanitsikighwa kukabuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Pfihi litimbwisi litsokulongela ghweghwe mighede?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Au litsolonga apfila ghweghwe pfautogholeka?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Uhulike, ghwe MNDEWA, umbonele libatsi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Ghwe MNDEWA, unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Ghweghwe kukutenda ukulila kwangu kuwe kubigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">kunitsula ligwanda lya ghunila kunipfatsa ukudeng'elela,<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />ili ghumoyo ghwangu ghukutunye ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">na ghuleke kwinyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">nene nitsokulongela mighede matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Nikutsumila ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">nileke kughelighwa chinyala hata chidogho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">ghweghwe yutenda ighali gha haki unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Uwambe lighutwi lyako unitegheletse nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">na unikombole nene sambi baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">kuna nene uwe bambalawe lya ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">uwe ngome inikombola nene,<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa bambalawe lyangu, na kwa ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">kwa ajili ya litaghwa lyako unikinge, na unilongotse.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Unyonzole kulawa mna ghumtegho ghwawaniteghele hanu hapfisike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">mana ghweghwe yuyo yanikutsumila.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Mna ghamoko ghako noyika iloho yangu, ghweghwe kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa yutogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Nowehila awala iwopfitambikila ipfinyagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">lekeni nene nehuwila IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Nitsosekelela na kuudeng'ela uluso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwona ukudununzika kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">na kumanya apfila pfaighanzike iloho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Wala ng'unighelile baye mna ghamoko gha aduwi tsangu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">lekeni ghamaghulu ghangu kughemisa hanu hana ugima.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Umbonele libatsi, Ghwe MNDEWA, namna ghamaghayo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">inenge yangu iyauka yau ghendo kwa apfila pfanighanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">ilukuli lwangu na iloho yangu pfose pfikeng'eneka kwa usungu.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Nikeng'eneka ghendo kwa ukulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">na imiyaka yangu ihunguka kwa ukughutilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">tsingupfu tsangu tsimala ghendo kwa tsinzambi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">na imipate yangu inyala.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Maaduwi tsangu wose wonibetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">nakoneka nachihulo kwa wayangu wanikala nawo habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">na awala iwanimanyile wombona nene ka chinu cha ukupfukighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">na hanitingana nawo mnzila wawo wonitsuma.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Nene nisemwighwa ghendo ka munu yafile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">nene niwa kama chinongo ichituliketulike.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Nohulika iwanu wengi pfawenong'onetsa ung'enye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wogha mkulu wonitsila kulawa chila ubali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wonikila mitsengwe, wobama wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Lekeni nene nehuwila ghwegwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">nolonga, “Ghweghwe yuyo Imulungu wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Ghamatsuwa gha ugima wangu gha mmoko mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">nikombole kulawa mna ghamoko gha aduwi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">na awala iwonikoleletsa.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Ichihanga chako chinilangatse nene mtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">unikombole kwa uluso wako ing'autsigha baye.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Ghwe MNDEWA, uleke kundeka niumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwaapfila nene nikulilila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">Lekeni waleke iwehile waumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">waghende na watsighile kutsimu na wenyamale tulu.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Uidiwe imilomo ya awala iwolonga ughutsu inyamale tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">imilomo iwalonga pfihile wanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">imilomo ya awala iwana ichidandali na iweghoda.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Lola apfila pfauli mkulu uluso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">uluso wauwekile awala iwokupfuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">yuweng'a awala iwokutsumila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">aku iwanu wose wolola.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Ghweghwe kowapfisa hanu hana ugima hauli ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">wokala kutali na imitsengwe ya iwanu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kowaghubika na ichimbeho chako wakale kutali na imilimi ya ughobo.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Yabalikighwe, IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">kwaapfila kanilangusa uluso wake iukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">ahala maaduwi tsangu hawanitsingile.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Nene tsanonga himahima apfino, “Kunyasa kutali na tsinenge tsako.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">Lekeni ghweghwe kuhulika chililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">ahala hanikulilile unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Mkundeni IMNDEWA, mwemwe wose imtogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">IMNDEWA koweka wagima awala wose iwolongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">lakini kowoyitsila ighehile awala wose iwali na chidandali.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Mgangamale na mdudumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">mwemwe mwose yamumbeta IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s">Ukuleghusighwa tsinzambi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyaleghusighwe ghamatotso ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">imunu ayula tsinzambi tsake itsilekelelighwe.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Kabweda imunu ayula IMNDEWA ing'ompetela baye ghamatotso ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">na mna iloho yake mduhu ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Hanikalile ng'ana nitsilonge baye tsinzambi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">imipate yangu ikeng'eneka, kwaapfila ning'ali nilila misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Mana chilo na misi ghumoko ghwako ghunididimitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">lijasho lyangu linyala kulonga litungwe mna ghumsimu ghwa chiyangatsi.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Kuya nikulongela tsinzambi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">na sipfisile baye ighehile ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Nilonga, “Nitsolonga ghamatotso ghangu kwa IMNDEWA,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">naghwe baho kunileghusila tsinzambi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Apfo, chila munu iyokupfuka yakulombe ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">ahala hauli kwabaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">ghamatsi ighokululusa haghomema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">yeye ng'aghatsompfikila baye.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Ghweghwe kwa hanu hangu ha ukwipfisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">kutsonikinga na ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">na kutsonitsunguluka aku nakwimba tsiwila tsa ukukombolighwa.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Imulungu kolonga, “Nene nitsokufunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">na nitsokulangulitsa inzila ya ukubita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">nitsokushauli, aku inenge yangu yokulolesa.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Mleke kuwa kama falasi, au nyumbu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">iwalihela tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">awo kodaha kuwaghoma kwa chibang'wa na mitsabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">hela ng'awatsokusoghelela baye.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Imunu yehile katsodununzika ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">lekeni ayula iyehuwila IMNDEWA, uluso mkulu utsomtsunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Mumsekelele na mumdeng'elele IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">mwemwe imtenda ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">mwimbe kwa ukukemelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">mwemwe imli na imimoyo inoghile.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Mtoweleni ilukenze IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">mwemwe muwanu yamli na ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">kwaapfila iwanu iwotenda ighanoghile wawo iwobamighwa kumtunya Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA kwa ukutowa ichinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">mwimbileni yeye kwa ukutowa lizeze lina tsinyutsi kumi.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Mwimbileni wila wa sambi sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">mtoweleni pfinoghile ichinubi na lizeze, kemeleleni hamdeng'elela,<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Kwaapfila lilonga lya IMNDEWA lolyongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">naye kotogholeka mna ghose ghayotenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Yeye kokunda ighali gha ihaki na ighagholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">isi yose imema uluso mkulu wa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Kwa lilonga lya IMNDEWA kulanga kuumbighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">na hayahumule kwa ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">pfose pfili kuko kulanga pfiumbighwa.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Ghamatsi gha ibahari kaghatsola na kagheka hanu hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">hata aghala ighaghendese hasi kagheka mna matangi makulu.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Isi yose impfuke IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">iwanu wose iwokala muisi wamdedemekele,<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />mana yeye kalonga, isi iumbighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">na kalaghitsa, isi ima ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />IMNDEWA kopfulaghitsa aghala ghawobama kutenda iwanu wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">na ng'owaleka baye watende ghawobama ukutenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Lekeni ghayobama ukutenda IMNDEWA ghatsokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">ghayobama mmoyo mwake ghatsotendeka mna ipfeleko pfose.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Ibweda ghendo isi imsaghule IMNDEWA yawe Imulungu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">iwanu iyawasaghule wawe wanu wake imwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Kulawa kulanga IMNDEWA kolola hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">na kowona iwanu wose.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Kulawa hana ichighoda chake cha ufalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">kowalola iwanu wose iwokala muisi,<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />yeye iyoumba imimoyo ya iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">yeye iyomanya chila chinu chawotenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Kuduhu mfalume iyokomboka kwa kuwa na maasikali wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">na kuduhu asikali iyokomboka kwa kuwa na ngupfu nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Falasi wa ing'ondo si chinu baye, ng'okwapfila baye ukomboke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">hata ka kana tsingupfu nyingi, ng'odaha baye kukombola.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Lola! Tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA tsowalola awala iwompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">awala iwehuwila uluso wake mkulu,<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />yaukombole ugima wawo kulawa mna ukufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">na yaweke wakale wagima mna ghamatsuwa gha inzala.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Twetwe twombeta na twomlolela IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">yeye yuyo iyotwapfila twetwe, na yuyo iyali ngao yetu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Imimoyo yetu yomdeng'elela yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">natwe twehuwila litaghwa lya ukwela kwake.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Uluso wako mkulu ukale na twetwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">ka apfila twetwe pfatukulolela ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s">Ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Matsuwa ghose nene nitseghodela IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">imilomo yangu itsoghendelela ukumtunya yeye.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghotsomdeng'elela IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">iwaonelighwe wahulike na wasekelele.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA hamwe na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">Na tulitunye litaghwa lyake hamwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Nene nimbama IMNDEWA, naye kanyidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">kanihonetsa kulawa mna iwogha wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Iwanu iwomlola yeye wakuwa ka ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">ipfihanga pfawo ng'apfitsakona chinyala baye.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Imunu ayuno imhingwa kamkema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">naye IMNDEWA kamhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">na kamkombola kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghake ghose.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA kowatsunguluka yawakinge awala iwompfuka yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">naye kowakombola mna ighehile ghose.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Lanzeni mlole apfila pfayanoghile IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">kabweda ghendo imunu ayula iyomsumila yeye.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Mpfukeni IMNDEWA, mwemwe muwanu wake mwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwaapfila wose iwompfuka yeye ng'awohungukighwa na chinu chochose baye.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Hata iwana wa isimba wohungukighwa, na wakona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">lekeni iwombama IMNDEWA ng'awatsohungukighwa baye na chochose ichinoghile.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Mtse mwemwe muwana, mnihulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">na nene nitsowafunda ukumpfuka IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Imunu yuhi iyonoghelwa na ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">iyobama ukwona matsuwa mengi ighanoghile?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Ulughome ilulimi lwako luleke ukulonga ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">na imilomo yako ileke ukulonga ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Uleke kutenda ghehile, tenda ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">na ukale ghoya na wayagho.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA tsowalolesa iwanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">na ghamaghutwi ghake kaghategha ghahulikitse ichililo chawo.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Uhanga wa IMNDEWA wokala kutali na iwanu iwotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">naye katsowalapfa waleke kukumbukighwa keli muisi.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Iwanu wana ihaki womlilila IMNDEWA, naye kowahulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">kowakombola kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghawo ghose.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />IMNDEWA kahabehi na iwanu awala iwatenyuke imimoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">na awala iwalihela chinu cha ukwihuwila.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Ghamaghayo gha imunu yana ihaki mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">lekeni IMNDEWA komkombola na agho ghose.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Koyika migima imipate yake yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">ng'ahana hata ghumwe ighubeneke.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Ukwiha kwawo iwanu iwehile kutsowakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">na awala iwowehila iwana ihaki watsohighighwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />IMNDEWA koukombola ugima wa iwatumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">na awala wose iwomtsumila yeye ng'awatsakoneka wana totso baye.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, wapinge awala iwonipinga nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">witowe nawo awala iwetowa na nene.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Ukinde ingao na chinu cha ukukingila ilukuli, winuke unyapfile,<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Wenulile ghumgoha na limaghe lyako, awala wose iwonikoleletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">unongele, “Nene yuyo yanikukombola.”<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Wone chinyala, na waumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">awala iwoubama ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">woyitsighwe kuchughu, awala iwobama kundagha.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Wawe ka mibangu ighulusighwa na libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">aku imalaika wa IMNDEWA kowawinga.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Inzila yawo iwe na chisi, na itelebuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">aku imalaika wa IMNDEWA kowabalasa.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Mana waniteghela imitegho aku nene siwatendele chihile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">na wanihimbila lipondo aku nene siwatendele chihile baye.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Ukulaghighwa kuwatsile wawo kwa ukwidukitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">imitegho yawo iwonze wawo iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">nawo waghwe mna lipondo alyo na wahupe ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Aho iloho yangu itsomsekelela IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">na nitsodeng'elela kwaapfila yeye kanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Lukuli lwangu lwose lutsolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Ghwe MNDEWA, nani iyali ka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">komkombola imunu mhingwa kulawa kwa imunu iyali na tsingupfu kumbita yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Na komkombola imunu mhingwa na iyalihela ipfinu kulawa kwa imbapfi wawo.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Iwanu wehile wakwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">wonighutsa pfinu nene sipfimanyile baye,<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Woniliha ighehile kwa aghala ighanoghile ghaniwatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">mbaka nene nokala uchuwa.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Lekeni wawo hawang'ali woghula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">nene nipfala maghunila kulangusa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">nidununza nimwenyegho kwa kufunga ukuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">tsanilomba aku nyinamitsa litwi lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />Nighendelela kudomboketsa kulonga nomlilila indughu yangu au isale yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">ninamila hasi kwa usungu ka apfila nomlilila mame wangu iyafile.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Lekeni nene hanikwalile, wawo wetingana hamwe waniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">wetingana wanilaghe, na nene matsali simanyile ghendo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">wang'ali wondagha bila ukuleka.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Ka iwanu ing'awompfuka Imulungu pfawobetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">pfipfo pfawanighudubukile.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Ghwe MNDEWA, utsolola mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Unikombole kulawa kwa maadui tsangu iwonitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">uukombole ugima wangu kulawa kwa iwanu awano iwali ka simba.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Nitsokulongela mighede mna ghumtingano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">nitsokutunya ghweghwe kuna iwanu wengi ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Awala iwali aduwi tsangu hela waleke kunisimanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">nawo iwonihila hela waleke ukuniseka.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Mana ng'awolonga mbulu tsa ukukala ghoya na wayao baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">lekeni wowatungila ghamaghomba gha ughutsu awala iwokala tulu muisi.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Wakwasama imilomo yawo, nawo walonga, “Ona! Ona!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">Tsinenge tsetu tsona ghendo.”<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ghweghwe kwona alino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">lelo uleke kwinyamala ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">leka kukala kutali na nene.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Lamka, Ghwe Imulungu wangu, na Mndewa wangu, unyamile,<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Unihighe kwa kulola ihaki yako, Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">Uleke kuwaleka waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Waleke kulonga mna imimoyo yawo, “Eee, Pfipfo pfatubamile!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Au waleke kulonga, “Tummalitsa.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Wone chinyala, na waweghele ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">awala wose iwosekelela ukughaya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">waghelighwe chinyala na waumbuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">awala wose iwebona wakulu kubita nene,<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Lekeni wadeng'elele na kutowa lukenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">iwanu iwonoghelwa na ihaki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">na matsuwa ghose walongeghe, “IMNDEWA yenulighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">iyonoghelwa na ukubweda kwa imtumighwa wake.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Na ilulimi lwangu lutsolonga tsimbuli tsa ihaki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">Na nitsokutunya misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s">Ghehile gha imunu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Inzambi yolonga na imunu yehile mghati ghendo mwa ghumoyo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">ukumpfuka Imulungu ng'akuli hambele ha tsinenge tsake.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Kwaapfila hambele ha tsinenge tsake kebona imwenyegho kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">yeye ng'oyona baye inzambi yake wala ng'oihila.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwake gheha na ghamema ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">kahela tsimbutsi na ng'otenda baye ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Hata hayowasa mchinanda mwake yeye kobama ukutenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">kakwima mna inzila ihile, na ng'oghaleka baye ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Ghwe MNDEWA, uluso wako mkulu wopfika mbaka kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">na ukutogholeka kwako kwopfika mbaka kuna ghamabingu.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Ihaki yako yeghala na ipfidunda pfikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">ghamalamtsi ghako ka ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA, kowakombola iwanu na iwanyama.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Lola! Uluso wako pfauli mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Ghwe Imulungu, iwanu wotsumila ichimbeho cha ghamabawa ghako.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Weghuta ipfijo ipfinonile, ipfimemile mng'anda mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">naghwe kowanwesa kulawa kuna ghumto ghwa uluso wako.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mbwibwi ya ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">ghumwanga ghwako ghotwapfila twone.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Ughendelele kuwa mluso kwa awala iwokumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">Na awala wana imimoyo inoghile ughendelele kuwatendela ighali gha haki.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Ghumghulu ghwa iwanu wana ichidandali ghuleke kutsa kunitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">na ghumoko ghwa iwanu iwehile ghuleke kuniwinga.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Akula waghwa awala iwotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">waghwisighwa hasi na ng'awadahile ukwinuka baye.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s">Ukubweda kwa iwanu iwehile na iwanoghile kuleke kukudesa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Uleke kukeleka kwaapfila iwanu wotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">wala uleke kuwonela gele awala iwotenda ing'aghanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Kwaapfila awo watsohupa ka mitsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">ka mimeya mibisi pfaisakala.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Wihuwile IMNDEWA na utende ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">ili ukale mna isi na uwe na ugima.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Ukudeng'elela kwako kuwe kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">naye katsokwing'a aghala ghaghubama ghumoyo ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Umwing'e IMNDEWA ugima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">na umlolele yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">na yeye katsotenda.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Na katsotenda ukunogha kwako kulangatse ka ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">na aghala ghaulamla ghatsolangatsa ka tsuwa ilikwalika nemisi.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Winyamale hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">naghwe umbete yeye bila kwipfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">uleke kukeleka hauwona iwanu wehile wobweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">awala iwebweda kwa kwika mitsengwe ihile.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Uleke kwona maya, wala kughudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">kwaapfila ukuludubuka kutsokulongotsa kuna ukutenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Mana iwotenda ighehile watsokomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">lekeni awala iwombeta IMNDEWA, awo watsakwing'ighwa isi iwe yawo.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Kung'ali chidogho imunu iyehile katsohupa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">kutsombama hanu hayakalile, naghwe ng'utsomwona baye.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Lekeni iwanu iwahole watsoisola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">nawo watsoideng'elela na watsokala ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Yehile komtendela tsengwe imunu iyana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">naye komwihila kwa kumsaghila ghamatsino ghake,<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />lekeni IMNDEWA komseka imunu ayo yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwaapfila yeye komanya ka tsuwa lyake lya ukuhighighwa lyakutsa.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Iwehile wasomola lipanga, wapfedula tsiminde tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawaghwise hasi iwahingwa na iwalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawachinje iwanu iwokala kwa ukutenda ighanoghile,<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />lekeni lipanga lyawo litsoihoma imimoyo yawo iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">na tsiminde tsawo tsitsobeneka.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Ng'apfu imunu iyana ihaki yang'awa na mali chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">kubita wanu wehile wang'awa na mali ketseketse,<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Kwaapfila ghamoko gha iwanu iwehile ghatsobeneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">lekeni IMNDEWA katsowakindilisa iwanu iwana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />IMNDEWA koghamanya ghamatsuwa gha iwanu iwalihela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">na achila chawolekelighwa chitsokala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Ng'awatsohumbuka baye mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">na mna ghamatsuwa gha inzala wawo watseghuta.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />lekeni iwanu iwehile watsohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">na maaduwi wa IMNDEWA watsohupa ka maluwa gha kumghunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">na watsohupa ka liyosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Imunu iyehile kokopa na ng'oliha baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">lekeni imunu iyana ihaki kolapfa kwa uluso.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Kwaapfila iwabalikighwe na IMNDEWA watsoihala isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">lekeni iwalighitighwe na yeye watsokomighwa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyolongotsa ghamatsayo gha imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">na yeye koikunda inzila yake,<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />hata yang'ekwala, ng'atsakughwa hasi baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwaapfila IMNDEWA katsomwinula kwa ghumoko ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Nene tsa namsongolo na sambi nilala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">lekeni sina mbone baye imunu yana ihaki kalekighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">na iwanaghe walombelombe ichijo.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Matsuwa ghose yeye kamluso, na koatsima sendi iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">na iwanaghe watsobalikighwa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Uleke ghehile, na tenda ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">naghwe kutsokala mna isi matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kokunda ukutenda ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">naye ng'atsowaleka baye iwanu wake iwotogholeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">yeye kowakinga matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">lekeni iwana wa iwanu iwehile watsokomighwa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Iwotenda ighali gha ihaki watsoihala isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">nawo watsokala muisi amwo matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Ghumlomo ghwake iyana ihaki gholonga ghamalonga gha ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">ilulimi lwake lwolonga ighagholoke.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu wake ghamna ghumoyo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">na ghamaghulu ghake ng'aghotelebuka baye mna agho.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Imunu iyehile komtsodolela tsinenge imunu iyana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">na kobama yamkome,<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />lekeni IMNDEWA ng'atsowaleka baye mna ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">wala ng'atsowaleka wahighighwe baye hawoghalighwa kuna libalatsa.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Umbete IMNDEWA, na uikinde inzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">naye katsokwinula uihale isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">naghwe kutsowona iwehile hawokomighwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Nene nimwona imunu iyehile na mkali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">iyebona kamkulu kulonga ghumbiki ghwa mkataluba ighukula mna lidongo linoghile,<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Lekeni kafosa hima na ahala hayakalile ng'oneke keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">nene nimbama lekeni simwonile baye.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Mlolese imunu iyalihela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">mlole imunu iyotenda ighagholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">kwaapfila mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa katsobweda na katsokala tseghamba.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Lekeni iwotenda tsinzambi wose watsokomighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">na iwatsukulu wao watsong'olighwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />IMNDEWA katsowakombola iwanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">kwaapfila yeye yuyo iyowakombola mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Naye IMNDEWA kawapfila na kawakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kowalapfa kulawa mna na iwanu iwehile na kowakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwa apfila wawo womtsumila yeye.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna ghamaghayo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, haughudubuka uleke kunikembela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">na haukona maya, uleke kunitowa.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Mana imishale yako inihoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">na ghumoko ghwako ghunididimitsa<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Kuduhu ugima mna ilukuli lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwaapfila kunighudubukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">na mipate yangu yahela ugima kwaapfila nene nina tsinzambi.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Tsinzambi tsangu nyingi mno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">tsiwa ka mtsigho ing'aghudutika baye kuna nene.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Imilonda yangu yola na yonung'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">iwa apfo kwaapfila nene tsa nambotsi.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Mbaka ilukuli lwangu lupfeduka na lwinama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">nene noghenda nidomboketsa misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Mana ghmghongo ghwangu chakwaka ghumoto ghuliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">ilukuli lwangu lwose ng'alukona ng'apfu baye.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Nene na nyonde nyonde na nahela ngupfu ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">noghutilila kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwangu ghuna usungu.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ghose ghanibama gha hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">na ukughuta kwangu ng'akupfisike baye kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghopwita pwita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">na tsingupfu tsangu tsimala ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">mbaka tsinenge tsangu ng'atsikona ghoya baye.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Mbwigha tsangu na wayangu iwali habehi wonihepa kwaapfila nene nina pfilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">na iwanu wa ilukolo lwangu wakwima kutali.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Awala iwoubama ugima wangu weka imitegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">na awala iwobama kunilagha wolonga pfawatsonilagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">na wopanga mbuli tsa ughutsu misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Nene na ka munu chitsiwi, ing'ayodaha baye kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">na ka chibubu ing'ayodaha ukulonga baye.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Nene niwa ka imunu ayula ing'ayohulika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">ing'ayodaha ukwidika baye.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Lekeni Ghwe MNDEWA, nene nokubeta ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, kutsonyidika.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Kwaapfila nene tsanilongela, “Maaduwi tsangu waleke kutsa kuniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">au ukwighoda ahala nene hanikughwa.”<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Mana nene nahabehi na ukughwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">usungu wangu ng'aunilawa baye.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Kwaapfila nitsolonga ghamatotso ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">na kusing'inika kwa tsinzambi tsanendile.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Maaduwi wa ugima wangu wawengi na wana ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">na awala iwonyihila hela pfipfila wawengi.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Awala iwoniliha ighehile kwa ighanoghile ghaniwatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">wonibangitsila hela kwa apfila nene nowinza ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Uleke kunileka Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">Ghwe Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">uleke kukala kutali na nene.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Sumka utse unyapfile, Ghwe MNDEWA, yunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu hambele ha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Nene tsanilonga, “Nitsakwalangitsa mna chila chanitenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">na nitsolughoma ilulimi lwangu luleke kutenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">ghumlomo ghwangu nitsoghoha chibang'wa hanikala na iwanu wehile.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Silongile chinu chochose baye, ninyamala tulu ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">sonile ng'apfu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">na usungu wangu wongetseka,<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />mbaka ghumoyo ghwangu ghwaka ghumoto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">Apfila pfaning'ali nikwalangula pfipfo ghumoto pfaghwakile mmoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">kuya nonga aghano kwa ilulimi lwangu,<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Ghwe MNDEWA, unongele ugima wangu utsotsigha tsuwachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">kuna matsuwa mangapi ighakalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">unongele nimanye ghamatsuwa ghangu gha ukukala mgima pfaghosumka kumala.”<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Kughatenda ghamatsuwa ghangu gha ukukala mgima ghawe chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">ugima wangu si chinu baye hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">ona, chila munu iyali muisi kawakuhupa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Imunu koghenda ako na ako ka chimbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">pfose pfayosang'ana, kosang'ana hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">kelundikila tsimali, akuno ng'omanya baye nani iyatsobweda kwa tsimali atso.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, lelo chanibeta chon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Nene nehuwila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Unikombole kulawa mna ghamatotso ghangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">uleke kuwaleka iwanu wabotsi waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Ninyamala tulu ghendo, sasame baye lilomo lyangu nonge mbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">kwa apfila ghweghwe yuyo yughatendile aghano.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Ulapfe ghendo utamu mkulu waungayile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">nene nimalitsika ghendo kwa ukutowighwa na ghumoko ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Ghweghwe komkembela na kumuadabisha imunu kwa ajili ya tsinzambi tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">naghwe kulumbusa ipfinu pfake ipfimnoghele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">kulonga pfijighwa na bulughwa, chila munu ka muhe ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Ghwe MNDEWA, hulika chanikulomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">hulika chililo changu unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">uleke kuwa chitsiwi hanilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">kwapfila nene na mgheni wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">mbita nzila kama pfawakalile sekulu tsangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Lelo undeke nisangalamke ichihanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">sambi apfino ng'ana mbukile lumwe baye.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Nimbeta IMNDEWA kwa ukududumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">naye kanyinamila na kahulika ichililo changu yanyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Kanidinitsa kulawa kuna lipondo lihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kaghemisa ghamaghulu ghangu mchanya mwa libambalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">katenda ghamaghulu ghangu ghagangamle.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Kuya kanilangulitsa wila wa sambi umlomo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">wengi watsakona na ukupfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">nao watsehuwila IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyehuwila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">iyoleka kwihuwila iwanu wana ichidandali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">na awala iwohunduka na kulonga ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">kututendela pfinu pfingi pfa ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">na aghala ghaubama kututendela kuduhu iyodaha kughapeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">kuduhu munu iyeghala na ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">ka ning'abamile kughatangatsa na kughalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">ghang'awile mengi sideke ukughapeta.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Nzabihu na tsinambiko ng'utsibamile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">na tsinambiko tsa inzambi natso ng'utsibamile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">lekeni ghamaghutwi ghangu kughatsibula ghahulike.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Baho hanilongile, “Lola! Nitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">ka tsimbuli tsangu pfatsandikighwe mna ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso.”<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nene nodeng'elela ukutenda chaubama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">na ghamalaghitso ghako gha mghati ghendo mwa ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Mna ghumtingano mkulu, nene niwalongela iwanu apfila ghweghwe pfauli wa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">ka pfaumanya Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">nene silekile baye ukulonga apfila pfauli.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Nene sipfisile baye mna ghumoyo ghwangu kuwalongela apfila ghweghwe pfauli wahaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">niwalongela apfila ghweghwe pfautogholeka na pfaunikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">sipfisile baye kuwalongela iwanu iwali mna ghumtingano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">apfila ghweghwe pfauli mluso na pfaulongesa.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ughendeleleghe ukumbonela libatsi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">kwaapfila uluso wako na ukulongesa kwako kutsonikinga.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe (Zaburi 70)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Kwaapfila ghamaghayo mengi ing'aghopeteka baye ghanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">tsinzambi tsangu tsinitsidi, mbaka sidaha ukwona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">tsiwa nyingi ghendo kubita tsimvili tsa litwi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">na ghumoyo ghwangu ghutsilika mghati mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ung'anoghelwa, utse unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Ghwe MNDEWA, utse sambi baha unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Awala wose iwoubama ugima wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">waghelighwe chinyala na waumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wose iwobama nene nilaghighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">woyitsighwe kuchughu na wone chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Awala iwonyowela, “Alyo! Alyo!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">Waumbuke na wone chinyala<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Lekeni awala wose iwokubama ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wasekelele na wakudeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">na waghendelele ukulonga, “IMNDEWA mkulu,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">awala iwonoghelwa na ukombotsi wako.<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Lekeni nene na mhingwa yanibama nyapfilighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">IMNDEWA yanikumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Ghweghwe yuyo uli wa ukunyapfila na wa ukunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Ghwe Imulungu wangu, uleke kukawa.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna utamu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyomlola ghoya imunu mhingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya IMNDEWA katsomkombola.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />IMNDEWA katsomkinga na kumwika yakale mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">naye katsobweda mna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">wala ng'atsomleka baye yatendendighwe ka pfawobama aduwi tsake.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />IMNDEWA katsomwapfila hayatsakuwa mtamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">naghwe kutsomhonetsa kulawa mna utamu wake wayoghula mlusatsi.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Na nene nilonga, “Ghwe MNDEWA umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">unihonetse kwaapfila nene nikutendela nzambi.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Aduwi tsangu wonilonga pfihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Yatsakufa tsuwachi? Na litaghwa lyake litsohupa tsuwachi?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Na imunu iyakutsa kundola kolonga ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">aku ghumoyo ghwake ghopfikitsa mbuli tsa ung'enye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">naye hayolawa kunze kotsenetsa chila hanu.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Awala wose iwonyihila wenong'onetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">wonipangila ighehile ghandawile, wolonga,<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />“Utamu wihile umkinda ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">naye ng'atsakwinuka keli baye hanu hayawasile.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Hata isale yangu mkulu yanimtoghole, iyajile ichijo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">naye kanibiduka kehanganya na maaduwi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Ghwe MNDEWA, umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">na unyinule nikawatendele apfila pfawanitendele wawo.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Ung'anendela apfo nene nomanya ka ghweghwe kunoghelwa na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">kwaapfila maaduwi tsangu ng'awonihuma baye.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Naghwe kwona ukunogha kwa tsinzila tsangu kunyeghamitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">Na kunika hambele hako matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imlungu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">tangia matsuwa ghose ighabitile mbaka matsuwa ghose ighakutsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Ona pfipfo! Na pfipfo ghendo!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu iyali kuna isi ya utumwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Ka apfila mbala pfayakona ng'ilu ukunwa ghamatsi gha ipfikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">pfipfo nene pfanikwonela ng'ilu ghweghwe, Ghwe Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Iloho yangu yomwonela ng'ilu Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">Imulungu iyali mgima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">nitsoghenda tsuwachi nikoneke hambele ha Imulungu?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Ghamasotsi ghangu ghawa ichijo changu cha nemisi na cha nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">ahala iwanu hawonilonga apfino misi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">“Yali kwani Imulungu wako?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Hanipfikitsa ng'ani mmoyo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">nokumbuka apfila pfanighendile na ghumtingano ghwa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">na kuwalongotsa kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">akuno twodeng'elela na kulonga mighede kwa ukukemelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">mna ghumtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu iwotenda ichihungo.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Nighutsa nimwenyegho, hebali nitsinika apfino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Heule nikwalangula apfino mmoyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Na nene nitsomlolela Imulungu, kwaapfila nitsomtunya yeye keli na keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">iyali Imulungu wangu na iyonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nina hutsuni ng'ani mmoyo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">apfo nene nitsokukumbuka Ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">kulawa muisi ya Yoridani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">na kulawa mpfidando pfa Herimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">na kulawa ichidunda cha Mizari.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Ghumto ghuna ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi ghokemelela ghumto ghungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">kwa litsi lya tsimululu tsa ghamatsi ghako ghose ighamemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">na ghamawimbi ghako ghose ghanibitila mchanya mwangu,<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Nemisi IMNDEWA konilaghitsila uluso wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">na nechilo nomwimbila wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">na nomlomba yeye iyali Imulungu wa ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Nitsomlongela Imulungu, iyali Libambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Hebali unisemwile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Hebali nighendelela kudomboketsa, akuno aduwi tsangu wonidununza?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Imipate yangu yonitama kwa usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">apfila aduwi tsangu pfawoniseka na kunilonga misi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">“Yali kwani Imulungu wako?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Nighutsa nimwenyegho, hebali nitsinika apfino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Heule nikwalangula apfino mmoyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Na nene nitsomlolela Imulungu, kwaapfila nitsomtunya yeye keli na keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">iyali Imulungu wangu na iyonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu iyali kuna isi ya utumwa koghendelela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Ghwe Imulungu unilamlile na unyamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unihighile lighomba lyangu hambele ha iwanu wa isi ing'aimpfuka Imulungu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unikombole kulawa kwa iwanu waghutsu na iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Kwapfila ghweghwe yuyo Imulungu yanikutsumila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Hebali unilemile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Hebali nighendelele kudomboketsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">akuno aduwi tsangu wonidununza?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Nighalile ghumwanga ghwako na ukulongesa kwako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">pfitse pfinilongotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">na pfinighale mbaka kuna ichidunda chako chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">mbaka hanu haukala.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Kuya nene nitsoghenda kuna imatsabahu ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">kuna ghweghwe Imulungu yanikudeng'elela na yanikusekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">na nitsokutowela chinubi na kukutunya ghweghwe Imulungu, yauli Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Nighutsa nimwenyegho, hebali nitsinika apfino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Heule nikwalangula apfino mmoyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Na nene nitsomlolela Imulungu, kwaapfila nitsomtunya yeye keli na keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">iyali Imulungu wangu na iyonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yakukinge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, kwa ghamaghutwi ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">tuhulika aghala sekulu tsetu ghawatusimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">aghala ghautendile mna ghamatsuwa ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">ghamatsuwa gha ghumwande ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Ghweghwe kwa ghumoko ghwako kuwawinga iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kuweka sekulu tsetu wakale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">ghweghwe kuwadununza iwanu wa tsiisi atso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">lekeni wawo kuwatenda wabwede.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Kwaapfila iwanu wako ng'awaisolile isi kwa ghamapanga ghao baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">wala ng'awahumile kwa tsingupfu tsa ghamoko ghawo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">lekeni tsawahuma kwa ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">ona, kwa ghumoko ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">na kwa ukuwamwesesela ichihanga chako, kwaapfila tsakuwakunda,<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Ghweghwe kwa Mfalume wangu, na Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">yulaghitsa iwanu wa Yakobo wahume.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Kubitila ghweghwe, twetwe twowoyitsa kuchughu aduwi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa litagwa lyako towakanyagha awala iwotwinukila.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Kwaapfila nene sihuwila upinde wangu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">wala lipanga lyangu ng'alidaha baye ukunikombola,<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />lekeni ghweghwe kutukombola kulawa kuna maaduwi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">na kuwaghela chinyala ghendo awala iwotwihila.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Twetwe tweghodela ghweghwe Imulungu wetu misi ngima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">na tutsolitunya litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Lekeni sambi apfino ghweghwe kutwasa, na kutughela chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">na ng'ughenda kung'ondo baye hamwe na maasikali wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Kututenda tuwatsume maaduwi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">na awala iwotuhila watuboka ipfinu pfetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Kututenda ka ng'olo wa kujighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">naghwe kutupwililisa kuna isi tsingi.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Kuwautsa chibohola iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">wala ng'upatile chinu baye kwa kuwautsa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Kututenda twoneke twawabotsi na iwanu iwokala habei na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">na awala iwatutsunguluke wotuseka na wotubetsa.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Wanu wa isi tsingi wotutaniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">wotubetsa aku wohighisa ghamatwi ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Nene noumbuka misi ngima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">na ichihanga changu nacho chakona chinyala,<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />hanihulika apfila pfawonibetsa na pfawondigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">hambele ya aduwi yangu na ayula iyobama kundagha.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Aghano ghose ghatulawila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hata ka ng'atukusemwile baye ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">wala ng'atulekile baye kulikinda lilaghano lyako.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Imimoyo yetu ng'aihunduke kuchughu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">wala ghamaghulu ghetu ng'aghabaghuke baye ghaileke inzila yako.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Lekeni kutuhonda honda hanu hawokala wambwa wa kumuhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">naghwe kutughubika na chisi totolo.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Ka tsatulisemwa litaghwa lya Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">na kugholosa ghamoko ghetu kwa Imulungu mgheni,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />pfihi Imulungu yang'alekile kulyona alyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">Kwaapfila yeye koghamanya ghose ighapfisike mmoyo mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Kwaapfila twetwe twokomighwa misi ngima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">twakoneka ka ng'olo wa kuchinjighwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Ghwe MNDEWA, lamka! Hebali uwasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Winuke, uleke kutwasa matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Hebali utupfisa uhanga wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Heule wisemwa apfila pfatughanzika na pfatughaya?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Kwaapfila twetwe tuhulumsighwa mbaka hasi mna litimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">tsing'uli tsetu tsiwasa mwidongo.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Winuke, utse utwapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">na utukombole kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mluso kuna twetwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya mfalume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghumema longa linoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">nene nimtungila wila mfalume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">Ilulimi lwangu lwa ikalamu ya imunu iyadahile ukwandika ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Ghweghwe kunogha kubita iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">ghumlomo ghwako gholonga uluso uliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">apfo lelo Imulungu kakubaliki matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Wiyohe lipanga lyako mhatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">ghweghwe yuli na tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">Yunoghile ng'ani na yuna utunitso,<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Ukulu wako ughendelele kwenela na uhume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">haudina ifalasi ulanguse tsimbuli itsilongesa, tsauhole, na tsa ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">na ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghulanguse ghamatendo makulu ighoghuma wogha.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Imishale yako inolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">nayo yowahoma maaduwi wa mfalume mna imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">na iwanu wa tsiisi watsakughwa hasi hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Ghwe Imulungu, ichighoda cha ufalume wako cha matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">na ing'weku ya ufalume wako yotenda ighagholoke.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Ghweghwe tsakunoghelwa na ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">na ighehile ng'unoghelighwe nagho baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">apfo lelo Imulungu, Imulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">kakubaka mapfuta na kakwinula kubita sale tsako.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Tsinguwo tsako tsose tsonung'ila utuli, manemane, udi na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Mna ghamang'anda gha chifalume ighahambighwe membe tsa nembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">naghwe kodeng'elela litsi lya ipfinubi.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Mna iwapinga yuwakemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">wamwenga wawo neghe tsa wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">na kuna ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo pinga malikiya iyokwelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">naye kapfala inzahabu ilawile Ofiri.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Hulikitsa ghwe mwana pinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">uwambe lighutwi utegheletse ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">wasemwe iwanu wako na iwali mng'anda mwa baba wako,<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />naye mfalume katsonoghelwa apfila ghweghwe pfaunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">mana yeye yuyo imndewa wako, naghwe umuhulikitse.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Na neghe Tiro katsokughalila inzawadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">na iwanu iwali matajili watseghalaghala kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Lola, neghe wa mfalume mng'anda komelemeta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">Ligaoni lyake lifumighwa kwa nyutsi tsa nzahabu.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Koghalighwa kwa mfalume akuno kapfala inguo italitsighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">sale tsake wali womsindikitsa, nawo wose woghalighwa kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Woghalighwa akuno wakwimba na kudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">wakwingila kuna ing'anda ya mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Hanu ha sekulu tsenu watsokala iwanenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">namwe mtsowatenda wawe wakulu mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Nitsolitenda litaghwa lyako likumbukighwe mna ipfeleko pfose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">apfo lelo iwanu watsokutunya matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kahamwe na twetwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Kuna twetwe Imulungu yuyo yatumtsumila na iyotwing'a ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">yeye kotwapfila ng'ani mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Apfo lelo ng'atutsopfuka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">hata isi ing'aghalambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">na hata ipfidunda pfing'adedema haghatighati ha ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />hata ibahali ing'atibuka na kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">hata ipfidunda pfing'adedema kwa ukutibuka ako kwa ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Hana mto, ipfikolongo pfake pfoghutenda ghumji ghwa Imulungu ghudeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">ghumji agho ghwa hanu helile hayokala yeye Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Imulungu kamghati mwa ghumji agho, nagho ng'aghutsohighisika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">Imulungu katsoghwapfila chila haukucha.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Yeye hayadumile, isi ilumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">na tsiisi tsa iwanu tsipfuka ghendo, na tsifalume tsighwa.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />IMNDEWA yana tsingupfu kahamwe na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Imulungu wa Yakobu yuyo yatumtsumila.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Mtse mlole tsisang'ano tsa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">pfayatendile isi ikale uchuwa.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Yeye komalitsa tsing'ondo tsili mna isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">kobena tsiminde, na imigoha koibena pfihande pfili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">imituka ya chuma koilakatsa na ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />Mwinyamale tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">na mmanye ghendo ka nene na Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">nitsakwinulighwa kuna iwanu iwali mna tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">nitsakwinulighwa mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />IMNDEWA yana ingupfu kahamwe na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Imulungu wa Yakobu yuyo yatumtsumila.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu ka mfalume wa isi tsose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Mwemwe muwanu wose, mtoweleni ghamakofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">na mumdeng'elele Imulungu kwa kumtowela imilutsi na lukenze.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani, ka wakupfukighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">yuyo iyali mfalume mkulu, iyoitawala isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Kotwapfila tuwahume iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">na koweka hasi ha ghamaghulu ghetu.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Katusaghulila isi aino iwe yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">isi iyeghodela Yakobu iyanoghelighwe naye.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Imulungu kagheluka uchanya na ilukenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">na litsi tsa tsimalati tsihulikika IMNDEWA hayagheluke.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Mwimbileni Imulungu, mwimbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">mwimbileni mfalume wetu, mwimbe.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Kwaapfila Imulungu yuyo mfalume wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">mwimbileni tsiwila tsa ukumtunya.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Imulungu kotawala tsiisi tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">Imulungu kokala mna ichighoda chelile cha ufalume.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Iwakulu wa tsiisi wetingana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">wawe chinu chimwe na iwanu wa Imulungu wa Abrahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwaapfila yeye kana ngupfu kubita iwafalume wose iwali muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">Yeye kenulighwa ng'ani ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s">Sayuni ghumji ghwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />IMNDEWA kamkulu, na yuyo iyobamighwa kutunyighwa ng'ani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">mna ghumji ghwa Imulungu wetu, mna chidunda chake ichelile.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Ichidunda cha Sayuni chinogha ghendo kwa utali wake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">ghugho ghumji ghwa mfalume mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">iwanu wose wali muisi woghudeng'elela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">nacho cheghala ghendo na ipfidunda pfa Safoni.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Imulungu kamghati mwa tsingome tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">ketenda mwenyegho yamanyike ka yeye yuyo wa ukumtsumila.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Kwaapfila wafalume tsawetingana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">waghenda hamwe kughutowa ghumji agho,<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Lekeni hawaghonile ghumij, wakangawala,<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Baho wengilighwa na chidedemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">na wona usungu kulonga ipinga iyakweleka,<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />kuwabenabena ka tsimeli ng'ulu tsa Tarishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">pfatsibenighwa na inyahemu ya mashaliki.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Ka apfila pfatuhulike, pfipfo pfatwonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">kuna ghumji ghwa IMNDEWA, yana tsingupfu tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">ona, kuna ghumji ghwa Imulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">Imulungu katsoghwika ghwime matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Ghwe Imulungu, mghati mwa ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">tutongelela apfila ghweghwe pfauli na uluso mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Kama pfalili litaghwa lyako, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">pfipfo na ukutunyighwa kwako kupfika mbaka kwaitsighile isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghumema ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Ichidunda cha Sayuni chitsodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">iwanu wa Yuda watsodeng'a, kwa ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Mwange mghati mwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">na mghutsunguluke ghumji, mpete iminala yake,<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />mghapfikitse mmoyo ghamaboma ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">mwange mtsilole tsingome tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">mtse mdahe kuwapetela ilweleko ilukutsa.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Mana Imulungu ayuno yuyo Imulungu wetu matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">Yeye yuyo yatsotulongotsa mbaka hatutsakufa.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s">Ukwihuwila tsimali koghala ubotsi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Mghahulike aghano, mwemwe muwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">mtegheletse mwemwe mwose imkala muisi,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />iwabala, pfipfila na iwadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">wana tsimali, pfipfila na iwahingwa,<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />ghumlomo ghwangu ghutsolonga mbuli tsa hekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">ghumoyo ghwangu ghutsolonga ukumanya.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Nitsotegha lighutwi lyangu nihulikitse ing'ungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">na aku notowa ching'weng'we nitsolonga ing'ungo ayo ilongatse.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Hebali nighapfuke ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya haghatsakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">aho ighehile gha aduwi tsangu haghonitsunguluka,<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />awala iwehuwila tsimali tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">na awala iweghodela utajili wao mkulu?<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Haduhu munu iyodaha kuukombola ugima wa ndughu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">wala iyodaha kumliha chinu Imulungu ili ndughu yake ayo yakale mgima,<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />kwaapfila ukuliha ugima wa imunu bei yake ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">kuduhu chinu chochose cha ukuliha ichikwenela,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />ili yeye yakale mgima matsuwa ghose, yaleke kwingila mkabuli.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Wose watsakona kumbe wana ihekima nawo wakufwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">pfipfila iwabotsi na iwalihela tsimbutsi nawo wohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">na wowalekela wanu wangi utajili wawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Ghamakabuli ghawo ghatsakuwa tsing'anda tsawo tsa ghamatsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">ghatsakuwa tsing'anda tsawo pfeleko pfose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">awo iwakemile imighunda kwa ghamataghwa ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Imunu hata yawe mkulu pfihi, ng'atsohepa ukufa baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">yeye keghala na iwanyama iwohupa.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Aghano ghagho ighowalawila iwabotsi, iwanu iwehuwila iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">na awala iwatsowawinza hambele, iwoghatoghola ghamalonga ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Wawo ka ng'olo wekighwa wafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">lifwa litsowadima ako kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">iwanu wana haki watsowatawala chila haukucha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">tsing'uli tsawo tsitsakolela kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">kutali ghendo na ghamang'anda ghawo ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Lekeni Imulungu katsonikombola ghendo kulawa kuna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">yeye katsonilapfa kulawa ako.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Uleke kupfuka imunu yang'awa tajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">hata ka ing'anda yake ing'ongetseka ukunogha,<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Kwaapfila ng'atsosola chinu chochose baye ahala hayakufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">na tsimali tsake ng'atsitsohulumka naye baye kukabuli.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Hata ka hayakalile mgima tsakebona kabweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na hata ka iwanu tsawamtunya kwa ukupata tsimali,<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />ayo katsoghenda kwawali iwahenga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">ako ng'atsakwona keli baye ghumwanga.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Munu wowose iyali mkulu aku kahela tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">ayo keghala ghendo na wanyama iwakufa.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s">Tumlapfile Imulungu nambiko tsa mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Imulungu, IMNDEWA Imulungu, kalonga, na kawakema iwanu wali muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kwanzila halilawila litsuwa mbaka halikuswela.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Kulawa Sayuni, hanu hake ihanoghile ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">Imulungu kolawa kolangatsa.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Imulungu wetu kakutsa na ng'akutsa chinyele nyele baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">ghumoto ighulambita ghomlongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">na inyahemu yomtsunguluka chila ubali.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Kokema kulanga kuli kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">na kokema muisi, yawahighe iwanu wake.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Kolonga, “Nikemeleni hamwe iwanu wangu iwotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">iwekile laghano na nene kwa ukulapfa tsinambiko.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Na kulanga kutangatsa apfila yeye pfayali wa ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">kwaapfila Imulungu imwenyegho yuyo mlamtsi,<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />“Hulikeni, mwemwe muwanu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">na nene nitsolonga, ghwe Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">na nitsakuwa mkalangama kwa ighehile ghamtendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">nene yuyo Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Sikukembela baye kwa tsinambiko tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">na sikukembela baye kwa tsinambiko tsako tsa ukulakatsighwa itsili hambele hangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Sibama ng'ombe mmale baye kulawa mkaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">wala mene kulawa mna ipfikwama pfako,<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />kwa apfila chila mnyama wa kumuhulo wangu nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">hata na wang'ombe iwali mna ipfidunda elufu imwe wose wangu nene.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Nommanya ghendo chila chideghe wa mpfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">na pfiumbe wose iwali mmighunda wose wangu nene.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Ka ning'awile na nzala tsasimlongelani mwemwe baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwaapfila isi yose yangu nene, na pfose ipfili mumo pfangu nene.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Pfihi nene nakuja nyama ya ng'ombe mmale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">Au nene nakunwa idamu ya imene yamnilapfila?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Mlapfile Imulungu nambiko tsa mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">na ulihe tsinatsili tsako kwa yeye Iyali kuchanya ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Unikeme nene mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">nene nitsokukombola na ghweghwe kutsonitunya.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Lekeni kwa imunu yehile, Imulungu kolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">angu ghweghwe una choni mbaka ughakekeme keme ghamalaghitso ghangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">Apfi ghweghwe una choni mbaka ulilonge longe lilaghano lyangu umlomo mwako?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kulema ukwing'ighwa ghamahala ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">na kughasa kuchisogho ghamalonga ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Haumwonile imhitsi ghweghwe kwilongotsa naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">naghwe kuwa chinu chimwe na iwaghoni.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Kughuleka ghumlomo gwako ghulonge ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">na ilulimi lwako lolonga ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Kukala hasi komdeta ndughu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">na imwana wa mamo wako kumbangitsila hela.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Haung'ali kotenda aghano, na nene ninyamala tulu ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">naghwe kupfikitsa ka nene nighala na ghweghwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Lekeni lelo nene nitsokukembela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">na ghose nogheka mwatsi aku kolola kwa tsinenge tsako.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Lelo tangeni alino, mwemwe yamumsemwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">hela nitsowadeghadegha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">na ng'ahatsakuwa na munu wowose iyodaha kuwakombola baye.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Ayula iyolapfa tsinambiko tsa mighede yuyo iyonitunya nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">na ayula iyokala bila ukutenda ghehile, nene nitsomlangusa ukombotsi wa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba tsinzambi tsileghusighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Umbonele libatsi, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwamluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">ughaleghuse ghamatotso ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna batsi kulu.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Unyopfughe ghendo na ukwiha kwangu kwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">na unitende nyele kwa tsinzambi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Kwaapfila nene nighamanya ghamatotso ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">na inzambi yangu ya hambele hangu matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Nene nikutendela nzambi ghweghwe uliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">na nitenda ighehile hambele ha tsinenge tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">apfo ghweghwe kolengesa haulonga nene nitotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">na kolamla ghoya hauihigha.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Ona nene nitenda ghehile tangiya hanyoneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">nina nzambi tangiya hanikalile muinda mwa mamo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Lola! Ghweghwe kobama igholongesa igholawa mghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">apfo unifunde ihekima yako mmoyo mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Unyopfughe tsinzambi tsangu kwa mirtsani ya hisopo, nani nitsakuwa nyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">unyopfughe, na nitsakuwa mtselu chwee kubita iseluji.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Unitende nideng'elele na nisekelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">impate yauihondile hondile nayo ideng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Uupfise uhanga wako uleke ukutsilola tsinzambi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">na ghamatotso ghangu ghose ughabaghuse.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Ghwe Imulungu, uniumbile moyo ghwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">wike iloho ya sambisambi na itogholeka mghati mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Uleke kunyasa kulawa hauli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">wala Iloho yako yelile uleke kuniboka.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Umbuyitsile ukudeng'elela ikulawa mna ukombotsi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">itende iloho yangu ikutoghole ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Apfo na nene nitsowafunda tsinzila tsako awala iwototsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">na iwana tsinzambi watsokuyila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Unikombole na litotso lya ukuwakoma iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">Ghwe Imulungu, Imulungu wa ukombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">na ilulimi lwangu lutsakwimba ihaki yako kwa kukemelela.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Ghwe MNDEWA, uyasame imilomo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">na ghumlomo ghwangu ghutsokutunya ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Mana ghweghwe ng'unoghelwa na tsinambiko baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">ka konoghelwa natso nene ning'akulapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">wala ng'udeng'ela baye tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Tsinambiko tsa Imulungu iyo iloho ihondeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">ghumoyo ighuhondeke na ghwa ukwihulumsa, ghwe Imulungu, ng'ughubetsa baye.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Ughutendele ghanoghile ghumji ghwa Sayuni, kwa uluso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uitsenge imibanda ya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Baho hautsonoghelwa na tsinambiko tsa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">na tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na tsa kulatsighwa mnyama mgimamgima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">kuya iwanu watsokulapfila wang'ombe wamale mna imatsabahu yako.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s">Ukuhigha kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Ghweghwe imunu yuna ingupfu, hebali wighodela ighehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Ambe uluso mkulu wa Imulungu wabaho matsuwa ghose!<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Ilulimi lwako lwopanga ukuhinyahinya kuliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">ilulimi lwako pfaluli ka chiwembe ichitema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">ghweghwe yubugha wayagho.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Kokunda ighehile kubita ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">na kokunda ukughutsuka kubita ukulongesa.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Kokunda tsimbuli tsose itsiwalagha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">ghwe lulimi luna ung'enye.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Lekeni Imulungu katsokudeghadegha mna ghamatsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">katsokunyakula yakudeghedeghe kulawa mna ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">na katsokung'ola ghendo kulawa mna isi ya iwali wagima.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Nawo iwanu wana ihaki hawatsakona alyo, watsopfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">watsomseka na watsolonga apfino,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Loleni ighamlawile imunu ayuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">yeye yang'amtendile baye Imulungu yawe hanu hake ha ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">lekeni tsakehuwila tsimali tsake tsili nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">tsimali tsayapatile kwa ukuwalagha iwanu.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Lekeni nene neghala na ghumbiki ghwa mtseituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">ighumela ghoya mna ing'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">nehuwila Imulungu yana uluso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">iyotukunda matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Nitsolonga mighede kuna ghweghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">kwa aghala ghautendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">na nitsehuwila litaghwa lyako, kwaapfila linogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">nitsokutunya hambele ha iwanu wako iwotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s">Imunu ing'ayompfuka Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Imunu mbotsi kolonga mmoyo mwake, “Kuduhu Mlungu”.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Wahinyika ghendo, na wotenda ighehile ighodesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">haduhu hata yumwe iyotenda ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Imulungu kowalola iwanu kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">yalole ka kuna munu yumwe iyakengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">iyombama Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Chila munu kahundukila kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">wose ghendo wola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">haduhu hata yumwe iyotenda ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">ona, haduhu ghendo hata yumwe.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Angu awala iwotenda ighehile wahela mbutsi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Awala iwowaja iwanu wangu ka wakuja chighate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">nawo ng'awomkema Imulungu baye.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Baho wengingilighwa na wogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">aku kuduhu chinu cha ukuwatenda wone wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">Imulungu kaipwililisa impate ya awala iwakutsingilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">namwe muwaghela chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwaapfila Imulungu kawalema.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Nobama munu yumwe kulawa Sayuni yatse yaikombole Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">aho Imulungu hayatsowatenda iwanu wake wabwede keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">iwanu wa Yakobo watsosekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">na iwanu wa Isiraeli nawo watsodeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukingighwe na maaduwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, kwa litaghwa lyako unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">na kwa tsingupfu tsako unilamlile.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Ghwe Imulungu uhulike chanilomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">uhulikitse ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Kwaapfila iwagheni wanyinukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wanu iwalihela libatsi wonibama wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">awala ing'awomwika baye Imulungu yawe hambele hawo.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Lola! Imulungu yuyo iyonyapfila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">IMNDEWA yuyo iyokindilitsa ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Leka Imulungu yawoyitsile aduwi tsangu ighehile ghawabamile kunendela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">naghwe uwahinye ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">kwaapfila ghweghwe kotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Nitsokulapfila nambiko kwa ukubama nimwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">Ghwe MNDEWA nitsolonga mighede kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">mana ukutenda apfo pfinogha.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Kwaapfila kunikombola kulawa kuna ghamaghayo ghangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">na nene mbona kwa nenge tsangu apfila pfauwahumile aduwi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa imunu iyabunzighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Unihulikitse ukulomba kwangu, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">wala uleke kubetsa chanikulomba.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Unihulikitse na unyidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">nene nyipfa ukulila na ukusing'inika,<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />kwaapfila maaduwi tsangu wonitenda nipfuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">nobunzighwa na wanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">mana wawo iwanu wehile wongalila ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">wonighudubukila na wonyihila.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghumema usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">na nene ningilighwa na wogha wa ukufa<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Wogha na ukudedema kunitsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">ichidedemo chinikumba.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Mbaka nilonga, “Ning'awile na mabawa ka njiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">ning'aghuluke ng'ende kutali nikabwihile.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Ning'aghendile kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">nikakale kunyika.<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Ning'asumke ng'ende hanu ha ukwipfisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">ng'ale kutali na inyahemu na libeho iliduma.”<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, upfulughe chawolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">kwaapfila mbona pfulughu na litsogho mna ghumji.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Misi na chilo pfotsunguluka mna imibanda ya ghumji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">pfoghala ighehile na maghayo mghati mwake.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Ukuhinyika kwa mghati mwa ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">tsuluma na ughutsu pfimema mna tsinzila tsake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">wala ng'apflawa baye,<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Ka aduwi yangu yuyo iyandighile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nene ning'adudumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">ka iyonyihila yuyo iyanyinukile yanitowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nene ning'epfisile yaleke kumbona.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Lekeni kumbe ghweghwe ghendo uli miyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">mbwigha wangu ghendo na yatwimanyile ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Yatung'ali tukala hamwe na kulonga ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">na tung'ali twilongotsa na ghumtingano kughenda kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Ukufa kuwatsile kwa ukwidukitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">na wahulumkile kutsimu wang'ali wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwaapfila ighehile ghammakaye mwawo na mna wawo.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Lekeni nene nitsomkema Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">naye IMNDEWA katsonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Nemihe, nemitondo, na nemisi nitsololoma kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">naye katsohulika litsi lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Yeye katsoukombola ghendo ugima wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">hata ka maaduwi tsangu iwetowa na nene wawengi.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Imulungu iyotawala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">yeye ing'ayoghalambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">katsohulika na katsowadununza maaduwi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kwaapfila ng'awompfuka Imulungu baye.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Kagholosa ghamoko ghake, yawatowe sale tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">kaleka kulikinda lilaghano lyake.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Ghayalongile kwa ghumlomo ghwake ghotelebuka kulonga siagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">lekeni mmoyo mwake tsamna ng'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">ghamalonga ghake ghotelebuka kubita ghamapfuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">lekeni ghotema ka lipanga litemesa.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Mtwike IMNDEWA ghumtsigho ghwako, naye katsokwapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">yeye ng'atsomleka baye yana ihaki yaghwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Lekeni ghweghwe, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">kutsowahulumsa mbaka kuna lipondo lya lifwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">iwanu awo iwomwagha tsidamu na iwaghutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">ng'awatsodaha kukala wagima kwa nusu ya ghamatsuwa ghawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">lekeni nene, nitsehuwila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukwihuwila Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Umbonele libatsi Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwaapfila iwanu woniwinzilitsa wangoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">misi ngima maaduwi tsangu wonidununza.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Misi yose maaduwi tsangu wonikoleletsa wanimetse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">kwaapfila iwetowa na nene kwa ichidandali chawo wawengi.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Ahala hanikwingilighwa na wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">nene nitsokulolela ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Imulungu katsonyapfila nilitunye lilonga lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">nene nehuwila Imulungu, apfo sitsopfuka baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Angu munu yana ilukuli ilukufa yatsonitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Misi ngima wopfulaghitsa aghala ghanilonga nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">matsuwa ghose wawo wopanga kundagha nene.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Wetingana hamwe wepfisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wokololetsa ghamatsayo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">aku wobama ugima wangu wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Angu watsohepa kwa ighehile aghano ghawatendile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">Ghwe Imulungu, uwaghwise iwanu awano ahala haughudubuka.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Ghweghwe kukumanya ukulila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">ugheke ghamasotsi ghangu mna isupa yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">pfihi ghose ng'ughandike baye mna ichitabu chako?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Apfo aduwi tsangu watsobwela kuchughu mna litsuwa alila hanitsokukema unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">kwa alino nene nitsomanya ghendo ka Imulungu kahamwe na nene.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />IMNDEWA katsonyapfila nilitunye lilonga lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">nene nehuwila Imulungu apfo notunya achila chayalongile.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Nihuwila Imulungu, sipfuka chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Angu imunu yatsonitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Tsinatsili tsanikwikile tsose nitsotsitenda, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">nitsokulapfila nambiko tsa mighede,<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />kwaapfila kunikombola ndeke ukufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">na kughatenda ghamaghulu ghangu ghaleke ukwikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">nyange hambele hako, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">mna ghumwanga ghwa ugima.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Umbonele libatsi, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">umbonele libatsi kwaapfila nene nokutsumila ghweghwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kuna ichimbeho cha ghamabawa ghako nene notsumila niwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">mbaka ghamaghayo aghano ghamale.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Nomkema Imulungu Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Imulungu iyonitendela ghose ghanibama.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Yeye katsonyapfila kulawa kuko kulanga na katsonikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">katsomkembela ayula iyoniwinzilitsa yangoghe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Imulungu katsonilangusa apfila pfayali mluso na pfayotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Nene na haghatighati ha wasimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">niwasa haghatighati ha iwanyama wana inzala ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">iwanu wana ghamatsino ka migoha na mishale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">na milimi yawo ka mapanga ighotemesa.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Winulighwe Ghwe Imulungu, kuchanya kulanga ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">na utunitso wako wenele mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Wategha ghumtegho wayonze imighulu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">na nene ninamila hasi kwa ukughanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">wanihimbila lipondo mna inzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">lekeni waghwila amwo wawo iwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghusindamala, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">ghumoyo ghwangu ghusindamala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nitsakwimba, na kukudeng'elela ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Lamka, ghwe ghumoyo ghwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Lamka ghwe chinubi na zeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">nitsolamka lupfilipfili.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, nitsolonga mighede kuna iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">nitsokwimbila ghwehwe kuna iwanu wa isi tsingi.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Kwaapfila uluso wako mkulu upfika mbaka kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">na ukutogholeka kwako kopfika mbaka kuna ghamabingu.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Winulighwe Ghwe Imulungu, kuchanya kulanga ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">na utunitso wako wenele mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yawatowe wana tsinzambi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Angu mwemwe muwakulu hamlonga pfihi mwolongesa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Apfi mowalamla ghoya iwanu?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Baye! Mna imimoyo yenu mwobama ukutenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">na ghamoko ghenu ghakwenetsa ughobo mna isi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Iwanu wehile wakwagha kulawa hawakoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">nawo wolonga ughutsu tangiya hawang'ali wa munda mwa mamo tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Isumu yawo yeghala na isumu ya inzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">kama moma chitsiwi iyodiwa ghamaghutwi,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />Yeye ng'ohulikitsa baye litsi lya iwaghanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">hata imghanga iyadahile ng'ani ukudomba.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Ghwe Imulungu, ughabene ghamatsino ghawo ighali mna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">ghamatsino gha iwana wa isimba ughabene, Ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Wahupe ka matsi gha ng'ululuso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">hawokwegha wase upinde wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">imishale yawo iwe butu.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Wawe ka kopfa iyolubuka akuno koghenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">na wawe ka imwana iyafilile munda, ng'ana yone litsuwa baye.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Ng'ana ipfiya pfenu pfitoghote baye, pfamkwambika kwa tsingodi tsa imihonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">pfiwe pfibisi au pfipfa, yeye katsopfighulusa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Wana ihaki watsodeng'elela hawatsakona iwehile wolihighwa ghawatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">imighulu yawo itsopfabika mna idamu ya iwanu awo iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Na iwanu wose watsolonga, “Ona ghendo, iwanu wana ihaki watsogwekighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">ona ghendo, hana Mulungu iyohigha iwanu muisi.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukingighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Unikombole na maaduwi tsangu, Ghwe Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unikinge na awala iwonyinukila wesonge na nene.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Unikombole na awala iwotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">na unikombole kulawa kuna iwanu iwomwagha tsidamu.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Lola, ghwe IMNDEWA, pfawonipfisila wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">iwanu wakali wetingana hamwe wesonge na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">aku nene nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">wala sitendile nzambi yoyose baye.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Sitendile chinu chihile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">lekeni wawo wotsumila kunitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Winuke, utse ulole na unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Na ghweghwe, ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Imulungu yana ingupfu, Imulungu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">winuke ukawatowe iwanu awo wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">uleke kuwonela libatsi awala iwakwika mitsengwe ya ukutenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Nemihe wakuya wokemba kama yumbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">woghenda aku wotsunguluka tsunguluka mna ghumji.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Lola! Maligho ghaliyeka igholawa mna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">ghawolonga ghogana ka lipanga litemesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">na welongela apfino, “Iyotuhulika nani?”<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Lekeni ghweghwe IMNDEWA, kowaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">kowabetsa iwanu awo wa isi tsose.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Nitsokubeta ghweghwe yuli ingupfu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">kwaapfila ghweghwe yuyo Imulungu yanikutsumila.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Imulungu wangu iyonikunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">yeye Imulungu katsonilongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">katsonitenda niwalole aduwi tsangu pfawotowighwa.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Uleke kuwakomela lumwe, hela iwanu wangu watsesemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">lekeni kwa tsingupfu tsako uwatende wange akuno na akuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">na uwaghwise hasi, Ghwe MNDEWA, yuli ingao yetu.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Inzambi yamna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">na yamna ghamalonga gha imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">waleke wonzeke mna ichidandali chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">kwaapfila wolighita, na wolonga ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />Kwa imaya yauli nayo uwamalitse ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">kwa kughudubuka kwako watende wahupe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">na waleke kwoneka ghendo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">na iwanu wamanye ka Imulungu yuyo iyowatawala iwanu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">mbaka kwaitsighila isi.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Na hamihe wakuya wokemba kama wambwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">akuno wotsunguluka tsunguluka mna ghumji.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Wakwanga kwanga wobama ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">na ka ng'aweghutile baye wokemba ka wambwa.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Lekeni nene nitsakwimbila tsingupfu tsako pfatsili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">chila nemitondo nitsakwimba kwa kudeng'elela apfila pfauli mluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa ingome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">na nokutsumila ghweghwe mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Ghwe yuli tsingupfu tsangu, nitsakwimba nikutunye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">mana ghweghwe kwaingome yangu, Imlungu wa uluso wangu.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukombolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, kutwasa, kwaapfila kutughudubukila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">na kutuleka tutowighwe, apfo lelo utuyitse kuna ghweghwe!<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Kuitenda isi idedeme na kuighola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">udiwe tsilwatu tsake iwe ngima keli, kwaapfila yodedema.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Kuwatenda iwanu wako wone ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">twotsenzeuka ka wanu iwanwile imbwali.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Kuwenulila ibendela iwanu awala iwokupfuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">ili wetinganileghe aho hawohepa imishale kung'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Utukombole na utwapfile kwa ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">ili iwanu yuwakunda wakombolighwe.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Imulungu kalonga kulawa hanu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Nitsoighola Shekemu aku nodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">na nitsowagholela iwanu wangu ichiwala cha Sukoti.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Isi ya Gileadi ya kwangu, na isi ya Manase pfipfila ya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">na isi ya Efuraimu yiyo ikofia yangu ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">na isi ya Yuda yiyo ing'weku yangu ya ukutawala.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Isi ya Moabu yiyo inongo yangu ya ukunawila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">nitsakwasa imikwabatsa yangu mna isi ya Edomu, iwe chitango ka yangu nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">na nene nitsokemelela ka niihuma isi ya Ufilisti.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Angu nani yatsonighala mbaka kuna ghumji ghutsungulusighwe ubanda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Nani yatsonilongotsa mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Pfihi si ghweghwe baye Imulungu, yutwasile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Na sambi ng'ughenda hamwe baye na maasikali wetu?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Utse utwapfile tuwatowe maaduwi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">kwaapfila ukwapfighwa na imunu si chinu ghendo baye.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Tung'awa hamwe na Imlungu tutsotenda makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">naye katsowabajugha maaduwi tsetu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukukingighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, uhulike ichililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">uhulikitse ghanilomba.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Kulawa kwaitsighile isi nene nokukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">akuno ghumoyo ghwangu ghotsilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">unilongotse kuna libambalawe lili kuchanya ng'ani kunibita nene.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe yuyo yanikutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">ghweghwe kwa ngome ina ingupfu inikinga na maaduwi.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Ndeke nikakale mna lihema lyako matsuwa ghase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">nitsumile hana ichimbeho cha ghamabawa ghako.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">kuhulika tsinatsili tsangu tsanyikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">kungaya aghala ghawakwing'ighwa awala iwolipfuka litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Mwongetsele mfalume matsuwa gha ukukala mgima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">na miyaka yake iyongetseke mna ipfeleko pfose.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Yatawale matsuwa ghose hambele hako, ghwe Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">uluso wako na ukutogholeka kwako pfimkinge.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Apfo lelo nitsolimbila litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">na nitsoliha tsinatsili tsangu chila tsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo iyonikinga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghombeta Imulungu yaliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">ukombotsi wangu wolawa kuna yeye.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Yeye yaliyeka yuyo yali libambalawe lyangu, na ukombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">na ingome yangu, sitsohighisika ghendo baye.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Angu mtsonitowa nene mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Mbaka tsuwachi mwemwe mwobama kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">nene yanili ka ubanda winamile hasi, na ka ubanda ubama kubomoka?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Wapanga ghendo kunighwisa hasi, kulawa hanu hangu hanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">wawo wodeng'ela ung'enye, na wobariki kwa imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">lekeni mghati mwa imimoyo yawo wolighita.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghombeta Imulungu yaliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">mana nene nehuwila kuna yeye.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Yeye yaliyeka yuyo yali bambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">na ukombotsi wangu, na ingome yangu, sitsohighisika baye.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Ukombotsi wangu na iheshima yangu ya kuna Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">Libambalawe lya tsingupfu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">Likimbililo lyangu lyakuna Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Mwihuwile yeye matsuwa ghose, mwemwe iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">ghaghubuleni ighali mna imimoyo yenu hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Imulungu yuyo yali kimbililo lyetu.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Iwanu weghala ghendo na imuhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wose, iwakulu kwa wadodo, si wakwihuwila baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">ung'awalinga mna iminzani wose wabewe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wabewe ghendo kubita imuhe.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Mleke kwihuwila ukutsulumu wala ukwighodela tsimali tsa ukuboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">tsimali tsing'ongetseka uleke kutsitongelela mna ghumoyo ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Imlungu kalonga mala lumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">na aghano nighahulika mala mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">kuwa tsingupfu tsakwake yeye Imulungu,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />na uluso wakuna ghweghwe, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">mana ghweghwe, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">komliha chila munu kwa ukulola isang'ano yake iyatendile.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s">Ukumbama Imulungu mmoyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nitsokubama kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">ghumoyo ghwangu ghwokwonela ng'ilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">na ilukuli lwangu lwokulolela ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nokwonela ng'ilu mna isi isakale na ilalile ilihela matsi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Pfipfo pfanikwonile hanu hako helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">nitsona tsingupfu tsako na utunitso wako.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Mana uluso wako unogha kubita ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">na nene nitsokutunya kwa imilomo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Apfo nitsokutunya ghweghwe mna ghamatsuwa ghanikala mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">nitsakwinula ghamoko ghangu nilombe kubitila litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghwitseghuta ka ndiya pfijo pfinonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">na ghumlomo ghwangu ghutsokwimbila ghweghwe aku nodeng'elela na notowa lukenze.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Haniwasa mchinanda mwangu nene nokukumbuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">chilo chose nene nokutongelela ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />Mana ghweghwe yuyo yunyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">mna ichimbeho cha tsimbawa tsako nitsodeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Nene nimwenyegho nokunanahila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghonikindilitsa.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Lekeni awala iwoubama ugima wangu wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">watsohulumka kuhisi kwawokala iwanu iwafile.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Iwanu awo watsokomighwa kwa ghamapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">na ng'uli tsawo tsitsakuwa chijo cha wambwa wa kumuhulo.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Lekeni mfalume katsomdeng'elela Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">katseghoda chila munu yatselaha kuna yeye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">kwaapfila imilomo ya iwanu waghutsu itsodiwighwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukingighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Uhulike litsi lyangu, ghwe Imulungu, haniloloma kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">Ukinge ugima wangu ahala maaduwi tsangu hawonighuma wogha.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Unipfise kutali na imitsengwe ya chipfiso yawonyikila iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">kutali na matsogho gha iwotenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Awala iwonola tsindimi tsawo kulonga mapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">na ghamalonga ghawo ghoghala usungu ka mishale.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Kulawa hanu hawepfisile womwasila imunu yalihela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">bila kupfuka womwasila kwa kwidukitsa.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Chila munu komghuma ghumoyo miyaghe yatende ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">welongela pfawatsoipfisa imitegho yawo, “Yatsoyona nani?”<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Wakwika imitsengwe ya ukutenda ighehile, wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">“Lihile lyatubamile ukutenda likala ghoya.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">apfo alyo lipfisika mghati mwa chila munu, na mmoyo mwake.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Lekeni Imulungu katsowatowa kwa mishale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">na katsowalagha kwa ukwidukitsa.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Katsowahinya kwa aghala ghawalongile kwa imilimi yawo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">na iwanu wose iwatsowona watsohighisa ghamatwi ghawo,<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />na iwanu wose watsopfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">watsoitangatsa isang'ano ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na kuifikitsa ing'onde yake.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Mleke imunu yana ihaki yamdeng'elele IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">naye katsotsumila kuna yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">na wose wana ghumoyo ighunoghile weghode.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Iwanu wokubeta ghweghwe wakutunye ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">kuna ghweghwe tsinatsili tsetu tutsotsilapfa.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Gweghwe yuhulika ukulomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">iwanu wose watsokutsila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Tsinzambi hatsiwile mtsigho mkulu kuna twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">ghweghwe kutsileghusa tsinzambi atso.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Kamota ng'ani imunu ayula yumsaghula ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">na ayula yumseghetsa habehi, yakale hana ipfibwalu pfako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">na twetwe twitseghuta aghala ighanoghile gha ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">ighali hanu helile ha ing'anda yako.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Kwa makulu ghaututendele ighoghuma wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ghweghwe kutwidika na kutukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">chila chiumbe ichili mna isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">na ichili mna ibahali ili kutali, pfose pfokulolela ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Ghweghwe yuumbile ipfidunda kwa tsingupfu tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">aku ghumwenyegho kwipfatsa tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Yutenda ibahali ikale tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">na ghamawimbi ghake ghenyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">na yumalitsa ghamtsogho gha iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Iwanu iwokala kutali ghendo wokangawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kwa aghala makulu ghautendile ighoghuma wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">ghweghwe kowatenda iwanu wose wadeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kwanzila akula kwalilawila litsuwa mbaka kwalikuswela.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Ghweghwe koyangila isi na koighalila imvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">kotenda lidongo liwe na mnyeke na limele ipfijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">na ipfikolongo pfako pfimema ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">ili iwanu wako wapfune ipfijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">apfi pfipfo pfautendile isi.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Koghamwaghila ghamatuta ghake matsi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">hanu henuke ghweghwe kohabughula hawe chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">kolitenda lidongo liwe na mnyeke kwa mawagha gha imvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na koitenda imimeya yake itsuke.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Ghumwaka ghose ghumema tsibalaka tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">na haubita ghweghwe kolaghatsa ipfinonile.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Pfolaghalila kuna ghumghina ghwa kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">na ipfidunda pfodeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Kuna ghumghina kumema wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">ipfiwala pfimema ghamapfuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">chila chinu chili mumo chakwimba na ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Mdeng'eleleni Imulungu kwa kumtowela lukenze, isi yose!<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Mwimbileni litaghwa lyake pfalili kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">na mmwing'e utunitso wa tsisifa tsake.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Mlongeleni Imulungu, “Ghamatendo ghako ghokangawatsa ng'ani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Tsingupfu tsako ng'ulu sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">apfo maaduwi tsako wokutsila aku woghudema.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Isi yose yokwinamila ghweghwe na yokutunya kwa ukukwimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wolimbila litaghwa lyako pfalili kulu.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Mtse mlole ghayatendile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">ghoghuma wogha aghala ghayawatendele iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Kaitenda ibahali iwe hanu hanyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">iwanu waloka ghumto kwa ghamaghulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">kuko twetwe tumdeng'elelela,<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Yeye kotawala matsuwa ghose kwa tsingupfu tsake ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">tsinenge tsake tsolola mna tsiisi tsose tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">ili awala iwomlema waleke kumwinukila.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Mtunyeni Imulungu wetu, mwemwe muwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">na litsi lya ukutunya kwake kuhulikike,<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Yeye iyatwikile tuwe wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">wala ng'ailekile baye imighulu yetu iteletse.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kutughetsa, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kutughetsa ghendo ka pfaighetsighwa ifetsa mmoto.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Kutuleka twonzighwe mlwapfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">na imighongo yetu kuitwika mitsigho mitito.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Kuwaleka iwanu watukalile mwitwi mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">tubita mna ghumoto, na mna ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">lekeni sambi kutughala kuna isi imemile ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Nitsakutsa kuna ing'anda yako na nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">nitsoliha tsinatsili tsangu tsanyikile,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />atsila tsanongile kwa lulimi lwangu ka nitsolapfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">atsila ghendo tsanilongile kwa ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">ahala hanikalile namna ghamaghayo.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Nitsokulapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa wanyama iwanonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">hamwe na nambiko tsa ng'unzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">pfipfila nitsokulapfila na wang'ombe na wamene.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Mtse mhulikitse, mwemwe mwose yamumpfuka Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">na nene nitsowapetelani aghala ghayanitendele.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Nimlilila yeye kwa ghumlomo ghwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">na ilulimi lwangu lung'ali lumtunya yeye hanimlilile.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Ka ning'aghapfisile ighehile mmoyo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">IMNDEWA yang'alekile kunihulikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Lekeni Imulungu kanihulika ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">kahulika litsi lya ukulomba kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Yatunyighwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwaapfila ng'alemile baye ukulomba kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">wala ng'alekile baye kunitendela uluso.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Imulungu na yatutendele uluso, na yatubaliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">yatumwemwesele ghumwanga ghwa uhanga wake,<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />ili inzila yake imanyike mna isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">na ukombotsi wake umanyike kuna tsiisi tsose tsa iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Ghwe Imulungu, iwanu na wakutunye ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">iwanu wose ghendo wakutunye ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Iwanu wose wali mna tsiisi wasekelele na wembe kwa ukudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwaapfila ghweghwe kowalamla iwanu kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">naghwe kowalongotsa iwanu wose iwali mna chila isi.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Ghwe Imulungu, iwanu na wakutunye ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">iwanu wose ghendo wakutunye ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Isi yolapfa ghamatsao ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">naye Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, katsotubaliki twetwe.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Imulungu katsotubaliki twetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">wanu wose watsompfuka yeye mbaka kwaitsighila isi.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukuhuma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Na yenuke Imulungu, na maaduwi tsake wapwililike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">na awala iwomwihila watsume hambele hake.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Kama apfila liyosi pfalighulusighwa na libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">nawo uwaghuluse pfipfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">ka apfila inta pfailumbuka mna ghumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">pfipfo nawo iwehile wahupe kulawa hambele ha Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Lekeni iwanu wana ihaki wadeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">na wasekelele hambele ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">walekeni wasekelele ghendo na watowe lukenze na milutsi.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Mwimbileni Imulungu, mlitunye litaghwa lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">mwinuleni yeye iyoghuluka mna ghamabingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">litaghwa lyake kokemighwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">na mdeng'elele hambele hake.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Imulungu iyokala hanu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">yeye ka aba kwa awala iwalihela aba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">na imlamtsi wawo iwaghane.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Imulungu koweng'a ikaye iwanu awala iwokala wayekayeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">kowalekelela iwanu iwohighwe mchifungo kowatenda webwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">lekeni iwanu iwombiduka awo wokala mna isi isakale.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Ghwe Imulungu, hauwalongolele iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">na haubitile kunyika,<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />isi ihighisika, na kulanga kughala mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">hambele ha Imulungu, Imulungu wa chidunda Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">na hambele ha Imulungu, Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Kuighalila isi mvula ng'ulu, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">na isi yako ikalile ilala kuitenda iwe na mnyeke keli.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Iwanu wako wakala amwo muisi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">kwa uluso wako mkulu, ghwe Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">kuweng'a ipfijo iwahingwa.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />IMNDEWA kalapfa laghitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">nawo wamapinga wengi walyenetsa lilaghitso alyo.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Wafalume na maasikali wawo wotsuma akuno na akuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">na ipinga iyali ukaye koghola ipfinu ipfighoghighwe kung'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Hata ka watsowasa mna ipfikwama, mwemwe mtsakuwa ka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">ghamabawa gha injiwa ighabakighwe ishaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">na imighala yake ibakighwa nzahabu imeletseka.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />IMNDEWA iyana ingupfu hayawapwililise iwafalume muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">tsaiwa ka ibalafu pfailaghala kuna chidunda cha Salumoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Ghwe chidunda cha Imulungu, ghwe chidunda cha Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">Ghwe chidunda china ipfidando pfingi, ghwe chidunda cha Bashani!<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Hebali mchilola kwa kuchonela gele, mwemwe pfidando pfa ipfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">ichidunda chayasaghule Imulungu yakale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Na ako IMNDEWA katsokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />IMNDEWA kolawa Sinai kakutsa hanu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">aku kelongotsa na imituka yake ya ukukweghighwa ili maelufu kwa maelufu,<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Ghweghwe kugheluka kuchanya, kughogha mateka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">awo kuwasola wawe nzawadi yako kulawa mna iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">hata na iwanu iwokaidi, ukale nawo, Ghwe MNDEWA Imlungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa ukombotsi wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">iyotudutila imitsigho yetu chila tsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Imulungu wetu yuyo Imulungu iyokombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu yuyo yaliyeka iyokombola kulawa kuna ukufa.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Imulungu katsoghabatsula ghendo ghamatwi gha maaduwi tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">lilotsi lina tsinywele lya imunu iyolumbilitsa ukutotsa.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />IMNDEWA kalonga kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">“Nitsowoyitsa, nitsowoyitsa kulawa kuna ibahali ighendese hasi.”<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />Ili upfabike ghumghulu ghwako mna idamu ya aduwi tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">Na tsindimi tsa wambwa wako tsipate ichijo kuna wawo.<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Iwanu waghwona ghumwandamo ghwako, Ghwe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">ghumwandamo ghwa Imlungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">mfalume wangu, kughenda hanu hake ihaenzeluke.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Iwakwimba wila tsawalongola, na kuchughu kwawo tsawakala iwotowa ipfinanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">aku welongotsa na iwali iwang'ali wotowa ghamatari.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Mtunyeni Imlungu mna imitingano mikulu ya iwanu, mtunyeni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">kulawa mna imbwibwi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Lyabaho likabila lya Benjamini, likabila dodo, lyowalongotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">kuya iwakulu wa Yuda na ghamakingili ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">nawo wowinzighwa na iwakulu wa Zabuloni, na iwakulu wa Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Imulungu wako kalaghitsa uwe na tsingupfu tsako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">wonese tsingupfu tsako, ghwe Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">ghweghwe yutusang'anile twetwe,<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />kulawa kuna lihekalu lyako ako Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">wafalume watsokughalila tsinzawadi.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Uwakembele wanyama iwali mna libagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">kingili lya wamvulati haghati ha wambughuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">iwobayugha ipfihande pfa pfetsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Yeye kawapwililisa iwanu iwodeng'elela ukwitowa tsing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Wasenga watsakutsa kulawa Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Kushi katsogholosa himahima ghamoko ghake yamlombe Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Mwemwe tsifalume tsili muisi, mwimbileni Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">Mwimbileni kwa ukumtunya IMNDEWA<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />Yeye iyodina kulanga kuli uchanya ng'ani tangiya ghumwande ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">lola! Kolapfa litsi lyake, litsi lina ingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Dalamkeni ukulonga tsingupfu tsa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">ukulu wake wa mchanya mwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">na tsingupfu tsake tsa mna ghamabingu.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Ghwe Mlungu kwa wa kupfukighwa, kulawa hanu hako helile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Imulungu wa Isiraeli koweng'a tsingupfu na uwetso iwanu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">ubalikighwe, ghwe Mlungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Unikombole, ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:1">kwaapfila ghamatsi ghanipfika msingo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Nitsama mghati mwa likododo ilighendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">na haduhu hanu ha ukwika ghumghulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">nipfika hana ghamatsi ighaghendese ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">ghamatsi ighamemile ghunikukulusa.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Nene nyipfa ghendo wa ukukulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">mbaka ilumelo lwangu lunyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Tsinenge tsangu tsiyauka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">kwa ukumbeta Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Awala iwonyihila hela wawengi kubita tsimvili tsa litwi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">wana ngupfu sideke awo iwobama kunidumla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">nawo wonighutsukila hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">woninanahitsa mbuyitse ichinu sichisolile baye.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Ghwe Imulungu, ghweghwe koumanya ubotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">na ghamatotso ghangu ng'aghapfisike baye kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Leka kundeka niwaghele chinyala awala iwokubeta ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">Ghwe IMNDEWA yuna ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">Awala iwokubama ghweghwe waleke kubetsighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">kwaajili yangu nene Ghwe Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Kwaapfila nene nolighighwa kwa ajili yako ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">ichinyala chighubika uhanga wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Nene namgheni kwa ndughu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">na mgheni ghendo hata kwa iwana wa mamo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Igele ya ukuikunda ing'anda yako yonilakatsa mghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">na ghamaligho ghawokuligha ghweghwe ghanighwila nene.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Hanililile na kufunga ukuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">wawo wanibetsa.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />hanipfalile lighunila nilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">wawo waniseka.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Awala iwokala hana lilango wonideta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">awala iwapatike imbwali wonyimbila wila.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Lekeni nene nokulomba ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">nitogholele achila chanilomba mna ghumda ghwaubama, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">unyidike kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna uluso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">kwaapfila ukombotsi wako wotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Unikombole kwa kunilapfa mna likododo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">na uleke kunileka nitsame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">nikombolighwe na awala iwonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">na ndawe mna ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Leka kundeka ghamatsi ighamemile ghanikululuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">wala uleke kundeka ghamatsi ghaghendese hasi ghanimetse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">wala uleke kundeka lipondo lifumbe ghumlomo ghwake mchanya mwa litwi lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Unyidike, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwaapfila ghweghwe uluso wako unogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">uhunduke kuna nene kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna batsi kulu.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Wala uleke kunipfisa ichihanga chako nene inili imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">unyidike sambi baha kwaapfila nene noghaya.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Utsnitsile habehi, unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">unikombole kwaapfila maaduwi tsangu wawengi,<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Ghweghwe komanya apfila pfanilighighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">komanya pfanipata chinyala na pfanihumbulighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">Aduwi tsangu wose ghweghwe kuwamanya.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Ghamaligho ghanibena ghumoyo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">mbaka nitenyuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ndolela yatse munu wa kumbonela libatsi, lekeni haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ndolela yatse munu wa ukunikanza, lekeni sonile munu baye.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Wanyikila sumu mna ichijo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">na haniwile na ing'ilu wawo wangaya isiki ning'we.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Imetsa ya pfijo ikighwe hambele hawo iwe mtegho kuna wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">na iwe mwambi hata kwa sale tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Tsinenge tsawo tsiwe na chisi waleke kwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">na ipfighudi pfawo pfighudemi matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Uwamwaghile ukali wa ukughudubuka kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">na ghumoto ighukwaka ghwa imaya yako ghuwalambite.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Tsindalo tsawo tsiwe na ukiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">kuleke kuwa na munu wowose iyokala mna ghamahema ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Mana awala wauwatowile ghweghwe wawo woweng'a maghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">Na wowalongalonga awala wauwalaghile ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Uwongetsele ighehile mna ighehile ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">na uleke kuwaleka wengile mna ihaki yako.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Na wafutighwe ghendo mna ichitabu cha ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">na waleke kwandikigwa hamwe na iwanu wana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Lekeni nene namna ghamaghayo na ukulumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">ghwe Imulungu unnikombole na unyinule.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Nitsolitunya litaghwa lya Imulungu kwa ukwimba wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">na nitsomtunya kwa ukumlongela mighede.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Na alyo litsakuwa linogha kwa IMNDEWA kubita ukumlapfila ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">au ukumlapfila indama yana tsimembe na tsikwato.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Iwanu wahole watsakona agho na watsodeng'elela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">mwemwe yamumbama Imulungu imimoyo yenu na ikale na ugima.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Mana IMNDEWA kowahulikitsa iwahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">na iwanu wake wohighwe ng'owatsowabetsa baye.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Lilanga na isi na pfimtunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">na tsibahali na chila chinu ichighenda mghati mwawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Mana Imulungu katsoikombola Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na katsoitsenga keli imiji ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na iwanu watsokala amwo na itsakuwa yawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Na iwana iwelekighwa wa iwatumighwa wake watsoihala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">na awala iwolikunda litaghwa lyake watsokala mghati mwake.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, usumke utse unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">ghwe MNDEWA, usumke utse unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Wone chinyala, nawahumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">awala iwoubama ugima wangu wanikome.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">woyitsighwe kuchughu na wone ichinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">awala wose iwakona pfinogha nene nilaghighwe.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Na wahunduke kuchughu kwa ichinyala chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">awala iwolonga, “Doko, doko!”<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Lekeni wasekelele na wadeng'elele awala wose iwokubama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">na awala iwoukunda ukombotsi wako waghendelele ukulonga, “Imulungu Mkulu”.<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Na nene na mhingwa na nahela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ghwe Imulungu, usumke utse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ghweghwe yuyo wa ukunyapfila, na yuli mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ghwe MNDEWA, uleke kukawa.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukingighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Nikutsumila ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">leka kundeka mbone chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Unihonetse na unikombole kwaapfila ghweghwe kotenda ighali gha haki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">uwambe lighutwi lyako unihulikitse, na unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Ghweghwe uwe bambalawe lyangu lya ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">nene nitsumilileghe baho niwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">ghweghwe kulapfa laghitso nene nikombolighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa bambalawe lyangu na ingome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nikombole kulawa kuna ghamoko gha iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">na kulawa kuna ghamoko gha iwotenda ighehile na iwanu iwakatili.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Kwaapfila nene nehuwila ghweghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">nene nikulolela ghweghwe tangia usongolo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Nikwaghamila ghweghwe tangia hanyoneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">ghweghwe yuyo yunilapfile kulawa munda mwa mamo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">nene nitsokutunya ghweghwe matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Nene nakwoneka chihulo kwa iwanu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">lekeni nene nokutsumila ghweghwe yuli na ngupfu.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Ghumlomo ghwangu ghumema mbuli tsa kukutunya ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">na nitsoutangatsa utunitso wako misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Uleke kunyasa hanilala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">uleke kundeka tsingupfu tsangu hatsihunguka.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Kwaapfila maaduwi tsangu wonideta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">na awala iwoupfisila ugima wangu welongela hamwe,<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />wolonga, “Imulungu kamleka, muwinzeni mumghoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">kwaapfila kuduhu munu wa kumkombola.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Ghwe Imulungu, uleke kukala kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">ghwe Imulungu wangu, usumke utse unyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Awala iwonibangitsila hela wahupe, na wone chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">awala iwobama ukunilagha wahumbuke.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Lekeni nene nitsoghendelela ukukubeta ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">na nitsakongetsa keli na keli ukukutunya ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Ghumlomo ghwangu ghutsosima ghamatendo gha ihaki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">ghutsosima ukombotsi wako misi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">kwaapfila mengi kubita pfatsimanya tsimbutsi tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Nitsakutsa nighalonge aghala makulu ghautendile, Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nitsolonga ka ghweghwe yuliyeka yuyo yutenda ighali gha haki.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Ghwe Imulungu, kunifunda nene tangiya usongolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">na mbaka leloli nene noghalonga ghamatendo ghako ighokangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Hata ning'awa mnzehe yana tsimvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">ghwe Imulungu, uleke kundeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mbaka nitangatse tsingupfu tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">na ukudaha kwako kuna ipfeleko ipfikutsa.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Aghala ghahaki ghautendile ghopfika kuchanya kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">ghweghwe kutenda ipfinu pfikulu ghendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">ghwe Imulungu, angu nani iyali kama ghweghwe?<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Hata ka kunitenda mbone maghayo na madununziko mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">lekeni kutsombuyitsila ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">na kutsonighelusa keli kulawa kuhisi ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Lelo unyongetsele ukulu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">uye unikanze ghumoyo.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Na nene nitsokutunya kwa kutowa ichinanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">kwaapfila ghweghwe Imulungu wangu kotogholeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">nitsokwimbila ghweghwe kwa kutowa ichinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">ghweghwe yuliyeka welile mna Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Imilomo yangu itsakwimba kwa kusekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">hanikwimba nikutunye ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">nene ghendo ayula yunikombole.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Ilulimi lwangu lutsolonga misi ngima aghala gha haki ghautendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwa apfila awala iwabamile ukundagha wahumbuka na wona chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlombela mfalume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, mwing'e mfalume ghamalamtsi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">na umfunde imwana wa mfalume yahigheghe ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Yeye katsowalamla ghoya iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">awala iwahingwa iwonelighwe ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Ipfidunda pfikulu pfitsowaghalila iwanu ukubweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">na ipfidunda pfidodo pfitsakonesa ihaki yako.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Katsowamila iwahingwa iwokala mna iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">katsowakombola iwana wa iwanu mbughilambughila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">na katsomhondahonda chila imunu iyowalagha.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Iwanu watsokupfuka matsuwa ghose ka pfalikwalika litsuwa mna ghamatsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">na ka ghumwetsi pfaghulangatsa mna ipfeleko pfose.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Katsohulumka kama mvula itowela imitsani ighudighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">ka mawagha gha imvula igholaghala mchanya mwa isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Iwanu watende ighali ghahaki mna ghamatsuwa ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">na iwanu watsobweda ng'ani mbaka ghumwetsi haghutsotsigha.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Yatawale kulawa bahali mbaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">na kulawa kuna ghumto mbaka kwaitsighila isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Ghamakabila ighokala kuna inyika watsomwinamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">na maaduwi tsake watsolambita litimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Wafalume wa Tarishishi na ipfisiwa watsomliha kodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">iwafalume wa Sheba na Seba watsomghalila tsinzawadi.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Nawo wafalume wose watsomwinamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">na iwanu iwali mna tsiisi tsose watsomsang'anila.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Kwaapfila katsomkombola imunu mhingwa iyomlilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">na imunu iyonelighwe iyalihela wa ukumwapfila.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Katsowonela libatsi iwanu nyondenyonde na iwalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">na katsoukombola ugima wa iwanu iwoghanzika.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Katsowakombola kulawa kuna ukwonelighwa na ukutendighwa pfihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">kwaapfila idamu yawo ina bei ng'ulu hambele ha ichihanga chake.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Mfalume yakale matsuwa mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na yabokele inzahabu kulawa Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na iwanu wamlombele kwa Imulungu matsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">iwanu wamtunyeghe yeye misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Nakuwe na pfijo pfingi muisi, pfimele mpfidando mwa ipfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Ghamatunda ghake ghawe kama Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">na iwanu wenele mna ghumji kama pfaikwenela imitsani ya isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Litaghwa lyake nalikale matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">lighendelele kukala mna ghamatsuwa ghose halikwalika litsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">na iwanu wa tsiisi tsose watsobweda kubitila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">nawo watsomkema mbalikighwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, Imulungu wa Isiraeli;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">yeye yaliyeka iyotenda ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Na litunyighwe litaghwa lyake kulu matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">na utunitso wake umeme mna isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ona pfipfo, pfipfo ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Ghamalombi gha Daudi mwana wa Yese ghamalila ahano.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="s">Haki ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Imulungu kanogha ghendo kwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">kwa awala wana imimoyo yelile.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Lekeni nene, chidogho ghendo ghamaghulu ghangu ghateletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">ghamatsayo ghangu chidogho ghaseghele hanu haghemile,<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Kwaapfila tsaniwonela gele iweghoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">hambonile iwehile apfila pfawobweda.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Kwa apfila wawo hawakufa ng'awodununzika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">tsing'uli tsawo tsidegheta na tsina ngupfu.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Ghamaghayo ghawoghaya iwanu, wawo ng'awoghaya baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">na ng'awoghanzika baye ka wanu wangi pfawoghanzika.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Apfo ichidandali chiwa mkufi mna tsisingo tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">wepfalitsa gwanda lya ughobo mna ilukuli lwao.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Iminenge yawo yolawilila kwaapfila ineneha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">imimoyo yawo yopfikitsa ukutenda ighehile ghaliyeka.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Wowaseka wayawo, na wolonga ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">wotamba na wolonga apfila pfawatsodununza iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Kwa imilomo yawo woligha kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">na kwa imilimi yawo weghodela ghawatendile muisi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Apfo iwanu watsowahundukila na kuwahulikitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">nawo wodutighwa na ghamatsi agho ighamemile.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Nawo wolonga, “Imulungu yatsomanyatse?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Yeye Yali kuchanya ng'ani yatsodahatse kutanga?”<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Lola! Apfino pfipfo pfawali iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">matsuwa ghose wawo wobwedelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">na utajili wawo woghendelela kwongetseka.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Angu ghendo nitenda ng'onde ya hela hanighwikile ghumoyo ghwangu ghwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">na hanighaghomile ghamoko ghangu ghaleke ukutenda nzambi?<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Kwaapfila misi yose nene nighanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">na chila mitondo nene nitowighwa.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Ning'alongile, “Nitsolonga apfino”,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">ning'awile nowabiduka iwana wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Hanibamile nighamanye agho ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">ng'aiwile pfibewe baye nene kughamanya.<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />Mbaka hanighendile hanu helile ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">baho nimanya aghala ighatsowalawila iwanu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Ghweghwe kutsoweka ghendo hana uteletsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">kowaghwisa hasi na watsohupa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Lola apfila pfawatsohinyighwa kwa ukwidukitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">wogha utsowengila na watsomalitsika ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Ka indoto pfaili imunu hayolamka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">ghwe IMNDEWA haukwinuka uwatende wahupe pfipfo.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Mana ghumoyo ghwangu haghwonile usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">na chinu chihoma mghati mwangu,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />Nikala henzehenze na mbotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">na niwa kama mnyama hela hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Na nene matsuwa ghose nahamwe naghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">ghweghwe koghukinda ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Konilongotsa kwa ukunifunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">kuya kutsonibokela kuna utunitso.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Nani yanili naye ako kulanga? Ng'ambe ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Wala mna isi kuduhu chinu ichininoghela kubita ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Ilukuli lwangu na ghumoyo ghwangu pfohunguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">lekeni Imlungu kalibambalawe lya ghumoyo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">na lifungu lyangu matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Mana awala iwokala kutali na ghweghwe watsohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">naghwe kutsomhinya chila munu iyokuleka ghweghwe,<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Lekeni kuna nene pfinogha niwe habehi na Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">IMNDEWA yuyo kimbililo lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">na nene nitsoghalonga ghose ghayatendile.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s">Ukudomboketsela lihekalu libomolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Hebali, Ghwe Imulungu, kutwasa matsuwa ghose ghendo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Hebali imaya yako itwakila twetwe ituli ka wang'olo wa ghumghina ghwako?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Uwakumbuke iwanu wa ghumtingano ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">wauwasaghule wawe wako tangiya ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">likabila lyaulikombole liwe lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">uchikumbuke chidunda cha Sayuni, ahala ghweghwe haukalile.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Uhenulile ghamatsayo ghako hanu ihahinyike ng'ani ha ghamahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">wone chila chinu chihile aduwi chayatendile hanu helile.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Aduwi tsako waduma haghatighati ha hanu hako hausaghule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">wemitsa tsibendela tsawo kwa ukutuhuma.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Woneka ka wanu iwakwinula tsihoya wagane imibiki ya kumuhulo.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Kuya wabenabena imilango ya ing'anda ya Imulungu ikighwe unzolingo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">kwa tsihoya na tsinyundo.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Wahalakatsa kwa moto hanu hako helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">hanu halikala litaghwa lyako wahatenda hehe.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Mmimoyo mwawo walonga, “Leka tuwahinye ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">Na chila hanu muisi hawetinganagha iwanu wamtambikile Imulungu wahalakatsa.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Ipfitango pfetu ng'atupfona keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">wala sambi ng'ahana nabii baye hamwe na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">wala haduhu hata munu yumwe mna twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">iyomanya aghano ghatsoghendelela mbaka tsuwachi.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Ghwe Mlungu, iwotuhinya watsokubetsa mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Angu aduwi katsoliligha litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Hebali ukuyitsa kuchughu ghumoko ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Ugholose ghumuko ghwako uwahinye ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Naghwe, ghwe Mlungu, kwa mfalume wangu tangia ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">koghala ukombotsi muisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Ghweghwe kwa tsingupfu tsako kuighola ibahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">kughahonda ghamatwi gha wanyangumi iwali mna ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Ghweghwe kughahonda ghamatwi gha Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">kuweng'a inyama yawo iwanu iwokala kuna inyika waje.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Ghweghwe yuyo wikile tsimbwibwi na ipfikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">na ghweghwe kuinyalitsa imito imemile ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Imisi yakwako na ichilo nacho chakwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">ghweghwe kwika ghumwetsi hanu hake na litsuwa hanu hake.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Kwika tsimbaka tsose tsa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">ichiyangatsi na ichipfeghetsi ghweghwe yuyo yupfitengenetse.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ukumbuke apfila maaduwi tsako pfawakubetsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">na iwanu wabotsi pfawalilighile litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Uleke kumwing'a mnyama mkali ugima wa injiwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">Ugima wa iwanu wako uleke kuusemwa matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Ukumbuke lilaghano lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">mana chila hanu hana ichisi muisi hamema ghehile.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Uleke kuwaleka iwonelighwe waghelighwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">waleke iwahingwa na iwali hela pfinu walityunye litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Winuke, Ghwe Mlungu, wiyamile ghumwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">Ukumbuke imunu mbotsi pfayokuligha misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Uleke kwisemwa ukukemelela kwa maaduwi tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">na litsogho lya awala iwokubela, pfawoghendelela ukudalamka.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu iyohigha</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Twolonga mighede, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">twolonga mighede kwa litaghwa lyako pfalili habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">iwanu wosimulila aghala ighokangangawatsa ghautendile.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Ghweghwe kulonga, “Nene nina matsuwa ghanyikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">na mna ghamatsuwa agho nene nitsohigha ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Isi haighisika na chila chinu ichikala amwo ching'ahighisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">nene yuyo yanitsotsikindilisa tsingutso tsake.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Nowalongela iwanu iweghoda waleke ukwighoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">na awala iwehile nowalongela waleke kutamba.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Mleke kuwa na chidandali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">wala mleke kulonga kwa ukwighoda”<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Kuduhu munu iyolawa mashaliki, wala maghalibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">wala kunyika iyakutsa kumwinula imunu.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Lekeni Imulungu yuyo iyohigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">komhulumsa ayuno, na komwinula ayuno.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Mana mna ghumoko ghwa IMNDEWA mna ichikombe ichimemile idipfai ya imaya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">yohefuka lihopfu, na ihanganyighwa na ipfikoletso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">naye koimwagha, na iwanu iwehile iwali muisi mwose woinwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">mbaka yomala.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Lekeni nene nitsotangatsa ghamatendo ghake matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">nene nitsomtunya kwa ukwimwimbila Imulungu wa Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Na tsimembe tsose tsa iwanu wehile nitsotsikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">lekeni tsimembe tsa iwanu wana ihaki tsitsakwinulighwa mchanya.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kohuma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Imulungu komanyika mna isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">na litaghwa lyake kulu mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Lihema lyake lya ako Salemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">na kokala ako Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Ako kuko kwayabenile imishale imeleseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">tsingawo, imimaghe na tsisilaha tsa ing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Ghweghwe Imulungu, kometameta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">komeletseka kubita ipfidunda ipfimemile wanyama wa kubagho,<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Maasikali wana ingupfu wawasa aku wabokighwa ipfinu pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">wawasa fofofo ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">kuduhu hata yumwe iyenule keli ghumoko ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Ghwe Imulungu wa Yakobu, haukembele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">iwafalasi na iwadina falasi wose wawasa nongo ndito.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Ghweghwe yuliyeka yupfukighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">angu nani iyodaha ukwima hambele hako haughudubuka?<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Kutangatsa kulawa kulanga apfila pfautsowahigha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">na isi yose ipfuka, inyamala tulu ghendo,<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />ahala hawinuke uhighe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">na kuwakombola iwanu wose iwonelighwe iwali musi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Ukughudubukila kwako, kotsokutunya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">awala walekighwe wagima ghweghwe haughudubuka watsokutendela tsisona.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Mwike tsinatsili na mtsilapfe kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">iwanu wose iwali mna tsiisi tsa habehi wamghalile tsinzawadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">kwaapfila yeye yuyo wa ukupfukighwa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Yeye kotsihulumsa tsiloho tsa iwatawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">na wakupfukighwa na wafalume wose wali muisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s">Ukukanzighwa mna ghamaghayo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Litsi lyangu lyomlilila Imulungu, yanyapfile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">ona, nomlilila Imulungu yanihulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">naye katsonihulikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Haning'ali nighanzika nene nimbama IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">nigholosa ghumoko ghwangu nechilo bila kwipfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">lekeni tsandema ukukanzighwa.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Hanimkumbuka Imulungu, nene noghutilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">na hanilonganika, iloho yangu yotsilika.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Ghweghwe kunitenda nitsodole tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">nighanzika ghendo mbaka sidahile kulonga chinu baye.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Nipfikitsa ghamatsuwa ighabitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">imiyaka ibitile ya ghumwande.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Nechilo nikumbuka wila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">ghumoyo ghwangu ghutongelela, na iloho yangu ighutsa,<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Pfihi IMNDEWA kotsowalema iwanu wake matsuwa ghose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Angu ng'atsowatendela keli baye uluso wake?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Pfihi uluso wake umala kwa matsuwa ghose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Angu ghayalongile nagho ghahupa mna ipfeleko pfose?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Pfihi Imulungu kesemwa ukuwa na libatsi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Pfihi kaghudubuka mbaka kalema kutwonela libatsi?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Kuya nene nilonga, “Achino chicho ichinitama mmoyo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Nighukumbuka ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwa yeye Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Nitsoghakumbuka ghamatendo makulu gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">ona, nitsoghakumbuka aghala gha ukukangawatsa ghautendile ghumwande.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Nitsopfikitsa tsisang'ano tsako tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">pfipfila nitsopfikitsa aghala makulu ghautendile.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Ghwe Imulungu, tsinzila tsako tsose tsela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">angu mulungu yuhi iyali mkulu ka Imulungu wetu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Ghwegwe kwa Imulungu iyotenda ighokangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">ghweghwe kuwalangusa iwanu iwali mna tsiisi apfila pfauli na tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Kwa ghumoko ghwako ghuna ingupfu kuwakombola iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">awala iwatsukulu wa Yakobo na Yosefu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Ghamatsi tsaghakwona, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">Ghamatsi tsaghakwona ghweghwe, tsaghapfuka ghendo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mbaka ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi, nagho tsaghadedema.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Ghamabingu ghamwagha ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">na Imulungu kaduma kulanga, na ilumwesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">na imishale yako yasighwa chila hanu.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Litsi lya ukuduma kwako lilawa mna ichipfulapfumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">ghumwanga ghwa ilumwesa ghupulika mna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">nayo isi idedema na ihighisika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Inzila yako ibita mna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">na tsakubita mna ghamatsi ighaghendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">hata kama ghamatsayo ghako haubitile ng'aghoneke baye.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Kuwalongotsa iwanu wako kulonga kingili lya imifugho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">aku pfilongotsi wao tsa Musa na Haruni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu na iwanu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Hulikitseni, mwemwe iwanu wangu, aghala ghaniwafunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">mtegheletse ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Nitsofumbula ghumlomo ghwangu kwa ng'ungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">nitsolonga ipfitendawili pfa tangiya ghumwande,<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />apfila pfatuhulike na kupfimanya, pfawatupetele iwahenga wetu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Tutsowalongela iwanu wetu bila chipfiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">na tutsowalongela lweleko lungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">ghamatendo gha ukutunyighwa gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">na tsingupfu tsake, na ghamatendo gha ukukangawatsa ghayatendile.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Yeye keka imiko kwa Yakobu, na keka ghamalaghitso kwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">ghayawalaghitse iwahenga wetu wawafunde iwana wawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />ili ilweleko ilukutsa waghamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">awala iwatsakwoneka hambele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">kuya nawo wenuke wawapetele iwana wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Nawo watsomtenda Imulungu yawe wa ukwihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">waleke kughasemwa aghala ghayatendile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">lekeni walangitse kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Kuya waleke kwighala na iwahenga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">iwakalile lweleko luna iwanu wasughu na iwombiduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">iwanu wana imimoyo mikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">nawo ng'awamtoghole baye Imulungu mna imimoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Iwanu wa Efuraimu, iwakindile tsisilaha tsawo tsa upinde na mishale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">woya kuchughu mna litsuwa lya ing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Ng'awalikindile baye lilaghano lya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">walema ukukala ka pfaghobama ghamalaghitso ghake.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Nawo waghasemwa aghala ghayatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">na ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa pfayawonese.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Katenda ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa hambele ha iwahenga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">mna isi ya Misiri, kuna imighunda ya Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Kaighola ibahali na kawalosa iwanu kumwambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">kaghemitsa ghamatsi kulonga ubanda.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Kawalongotsa kwa libingu nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">na chilo chose kwa ghumwanga ghwa ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Katula ghamabambalawe kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">kawanwesa ghamatsi mengi ka matsi ighaghendese igholawa hasi.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Naye kalapfa ipfikolongo kulawa mna libambalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">na katenda ghamatsi ghahulumke kama mto.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Lekeni waghendelela ukumtendela tsinzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">wamlema kunyika Yeye Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Wamghetsa Imlungu mmimoyo mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">kwa kubama ichijo kwa libasu lyawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Kuya wamlonga Imlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">“Phihi Imulungu kodaha kutwing'a chijo tuje kunyika?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Lola, yeye katowa libambalawe ghamatsi ghalawa mengi kulonga mito.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">Pfihi pfipfila kodaha kutwing'a ichijo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">Au pfihi katsoweng'a nyama iwanu wake?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />IMNDEWA hayahulike agho kaghudubuka ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">Moto ghuwakila iwanu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">pfipfila kawonela maya ng'ani Waisiraeli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />kwa apfila ng'awamtoghole Imulungu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">wala kwihuwila ukombotsi wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Hata apfo kaghalaghitsa ghamabingu ighali kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">na imilango ili kulanga kaipfughula,<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />naye kawahulumsila imana ka mvula waje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">kaweng'a ghumtama kulawa kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Chila munu kaja ichijo chawajile wamalaika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">kawaghalila ichijo bwelele.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Kalitenda libeho ililawa mashaliki lidume kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">na kwa tsingupfu tsake kalitenda libeho ililawa Kusini lidume.<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Kawamwaghila inyama kama timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">pfideghe iwoghuluka wengi kulonga msanga ghwa ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Kawatenda waghwe mna indalo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">kutsunguluka ghamahema ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Nawo waja mbaka waleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">mana kaweng'a achila chawonele libasu.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Hawakalile ng'ana wamalitse baye achila chawasulukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">ichijo haching'ali cha umlumo mwawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />imaya ya Imlungu iwakila moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">naye kawakoma iwakalile na ngupfu mna wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">na iwasongolo wawo kawenamitsa.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Hamwe na aghano ghose waghendelela kutenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">nawo ng'awatoghole baye ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Apfo kaghatenda ghamatsuwa ghawo ghahupe kulonga muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">na kaitenda imiyaka yawo ihupe kwa ukuwaghalila maghayo gha ukwidukitsa.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Chila hayawakomile, baho hawambamile na kumuyila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">nawo wambama Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghwose.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Wakumbuka ka Imulungu tsa yuyo libambalawe lyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">na ka Imulungu Iyali Kuchanya ng'ani yuyo mkombotsi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Lekeni wambugha kwa imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">na kwa milimi yawo wamlongela ughutsu,<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />imimoyo yawo ng'awayikile ghoya baye kuna yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">wala lilaghano lyake ng'awalikindise baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Hata apfo, yeye kawonela libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">kawaleghusila ghamatotso ghawo, ng'awahinyile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">lekeni kaghendelela kududumila ukughudubuka kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">wala ng'aikoletse imaya yake yose baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Naye kakumbuka ka wawo wakala wa wanu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">weghala na libeho ilibita, wala ng'alikuya keli baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Wamlemile mala ngapi akula kunyika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">Na wamghela usungu akula kunyika.<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Nawo woya kuchughu wamghetsa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">wamghela usungu Iyelile wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Wala ng'awaghukumbuke baye ghumoko ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">mna litsuwa hayawakombole kulawa kwa iwanu iwawahinyile,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />ahala hayonese ipfihulo pfake akula Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">na ahala hayatendile ipfinu pfake pfa ukukangawatsa akula kuna iluwala lwa Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Kaghalusa imito yawo iwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">wala ng'awadahile baye ukunwa ghamatsi gha ipfikolongo pfawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Kawaghalila mghati mwawo wang'onzi wengi iwawadesile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na wapfibutwa iwawahinyile.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Kaweng'a wanzighe imimeya yawo, waja ghamapfuno ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na wahinya imighunda yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Kaihinya imitsabibu yawo kwa imvula ya ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">na ihinya mitini yawo kwa ichipfeghetsi.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Kawaleka wang'ombe wawo walaghighwe na imvula ya ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">na ilumwesa lukoma imifugho yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Kaileka imaya yake ng'ulu iwakile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">kawaghudubukila, kawaghela usungu, na kawatenda waghaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">kuya kawaghalila kingili lya malaika liwadununze.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Kaighala mnzila imaya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">wala tsiloho tsawo ng'atsileghusile lifwa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">ila katsileka tsitowighwe na utamu wa tauni.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Kamkoma chila mwana mmale chaudele wa iwanu wa Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">iwana iwoneke mna lihema lya Hamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">aba tsawo hawang'ali wasongolo.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Naye kawalongotsa iwanu wake kulonga ng'olo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">kawalongotsa kunyika ka kingili lya mifugho.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Kawalongotsa tseghamba, wala ng'awapfukile chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">lekeni maaduwi tsawo, ibahali iwaghubikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Kawaghala mbaka kuna isi yake iyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">kuna ichidunda chayabokile kwa ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Kawawinga iwanu wa tsiisi hambele hawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na katsighola isi tsawo kwa Waisiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na kagheka ghamakabila gha Isiraeli ghakale mna ghamahema ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Lekeni wamghetsa na wambiduka Imulungu Yali Kuchanya Ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">Wala ghamalaghitso ghake ng'awaghatoghole baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Ila wahunduka kuchughu na watenda ighehile kama iwahenga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">nawo watsenzeuka kulonga upinde uli hela ngupfu.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Wamtenda yaghudubuke kwa tsimatsabahu tsawo tsa ukutambikila milungu ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">na wamtenda yone gele kwa ipfinyago pfawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Imulungu hayonile agho kaghudubuka ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">naye kamlemesa ghendo Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Kalileka lihema lya Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">lihema lyatsengile yakale na iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Katsileka tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">na utunitso wake ughelighwe mna ghamoko gha maaduwi tsake.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Kawalapfa iwanu wake watowighwe na lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">na kawaghudubukila iwanu wake imwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Ghumoto ghuwalakatsa iwasongolo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">na iwali wawo nng'awambilighwe baye tsiwila tsaukukwelighwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Iwatambika wawo wakomighwa kwa lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">wala pfitsuka wawo ng'awadomboketse baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Baho IMNDEWA kalamka kama munu iyalawile mna tsinongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">kulonga munu iyana tsingupfu pfayotsinduka kulawa mna ukupatika imbwali.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Naye kawadimla aduwi tsake woya kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">kawaghela ichinyala ing'achihupa baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Kalilema lihema lya Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">wala likabila lya Efuraimu ng'alisaghule baye.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Lekeni kalisaghula likabila lya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">ichidunda cha Sayuni chayochikunda.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Baho katsenga ing'anda ng'ulu ya Imulungu ka chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">kalimisa likale kama idunia pfaikala matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Kuya kamsaghula Daudi, imtumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">kamlapfa kulawa kuna ipfikwama pfa wang'olo,<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />kulawa kuna ukudima wang'olo kamghala yadime iwanu wake wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">iwanu iwali wake ghendo wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Naye kawadima kwa ghumoyo ghwake ighunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">na kawalongotsa kwa ukudaha kwa ghamoko ghake.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s">Ukulombela isi haighaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, iwanu wa tsiisi, waiboka isi yako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">waitenda ing'anda ya Imulungu ihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">na waghutenda ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghuwe mahame.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Waweng'a wapfideghe wa kulanga tsing'uli tsa iwatumighwa wako iwe chijo chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">inyama ya iwanu wako iwatogholighwa waweng'a wanyama wa kubagho waje.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Waimwagha idamu yawo ka womwagha ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">mna Yerusalemu yose, wala kuduhu munu wa kuwatsika.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Hambele ha iwali habehi natwe tupfatsighwa ichinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">na awala iwotutsunguluka wotunanga na kutuseka.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Mbaka tsuwachi, Ghwe IMNDEWA, kutsoghendelela kutughudubukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala? Pfihi imaya yako itsakwaka kama moto?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Uwamwaghile imaya yako ghamataifa ing'aghokumanya ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">na tsifalume ing'atsilikema litaghwa lyako,<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />kwaapfila wamkoma Yakobu, na watsihinya ghendo tsikaye tsake.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Uleke kughakumbuka ighehile gha iwahenga wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">usumke utse utwonele libatsi lyako, kwaapfila tudununzighiwa ng'ani<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Utwapfile ghwe Imulungu wa ukombotsi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa ajili ya utunitso wa litaghwa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">Utukombole, na utuleghusile tsinzambi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa ajili ya litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Hebali ghamataifa ghatse ghalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Yali kwani Imulungu wawo?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Leka tsinenge tsetu tsone pfauwaliha ichisasi ghamataifa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">kwa idamu ya iwatumighwa wako iwamwaghile.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Icililo cha iwanu iwohighwe chipfike hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">ghumoko ghwako ghuna tsingupfu ghuwakombole awala iwahighighwe ukufa.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Na wali behi na twetwe uwalihe mmambagha mwawo mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">kwa ghamaligho ghawakulighile ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Na twetwe iwanu wako, yatuli wang'olo wa ghumghina ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">Tutsokulongela mighede matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">kulawa lweleko mbaka lweleko tutsolonga tsisifa tsako.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s">Ukuiombela isi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Utegheletse, Ghwe Mdimi wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">ghweghwe yumlongotsa Yosefu ka kingili lya ng'olo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">ghweghwe yukala mchanya mwa iwapfiumbe wana ghamabawa iwakemighwe makelubi, ulangatse,<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />hambele ha Efuraimu, na Benjamini, na Manase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">utsilamse tsingupfu tsako utse utukombole.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Ghwe Mulungu, utubweletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">utumwemwesele ichihanga chako, na twetwe tutsokomboka.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wa ghamakingili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">kutsoghudubukila ukulomba kwa iwanu wako mbaka tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Ghweghwe kuweng'a ghamatsosi ghawe ichijo chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">kuwanwesa ghamasotsi ighamemile mna libakuli.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Ghweghwe kututenda tubetsighwe na iwanu iwali habehi na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">na aduwi tsetu wotuseka.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Ghwe Imulungu wa tsingupfu tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">utulangatsile ichihanga chako ili tukombolighwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Twetwe twighala na ghumbiki ghwa mnzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">yautulapfile kuna isi ya Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">na kuwawinga iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">na kughuhanda mna tsiisi atso.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Kughuhalila ghukule ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">naghwo ghwota mitsitsi na ghwenela mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Ipfidunda pfighubikighwa na ichimbeho chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">na ghamaputila ghake ghaghubika imibiki mikulu ya imikataluba.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Naghwo ghwenetsa ghamaputila ghake mbaka kuna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">na ipfitumba pfake mbaka kuna ghumto.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Hebali lelo ubomole imibanda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">mbaka awala wose iwobita mnzila wobawa ghamatunda ghake?<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Wangubi wa kubagho woghuhinya, na ipfiumbe pfa kunyika pfoghuja.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Ghwe Imulungu yuna tsingupfu, hunduka uye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">ulolese kulawa kulanga wone, na ughulolese ghumnzabibu aghuno,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />ghwaughughombeke ghumwenyegho kwa ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">agho ghugho imwana yumtendile ghumwenyegho yawe na ngupfu.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Ghumzabibu ghwako ghukanighwa na ghulakatsighwa na ghumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">haughudubuka na kuwakembela wawo wohupa.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Ghumoko ghwako ghumkinge imunu ayula iyokala ubali wako wa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">imwana yumsaghule yawe wako ghumwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Na twetwe ng'atutsokuleka baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">utwing'e ugima, na twetwe tutsolitunya litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu yuna tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">utulangatsile ichihanga chako, natwe tukombolighwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ichihungo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Mwimbileni Imulungu kwa ukudeng'elela, yeye iyali tsingupfu tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">mtoweleni lukenze Imulungu wa Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Mwanze ukwimba, mtowe tsingoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">mtowe malati, na ichinanda.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Kemeleleni kwa ukutowa tsimembe tsa ng'olo ahala ghumwetsi haghulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">na ahala ghumwetsi haghukwenela, mna litsuwa lya ichihungo chetu.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Kwaapfila alyo laghitso kwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">na ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu wa Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Tsakaweng'a iwanu wa Isiraeli laghitso alyino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">hayaghendile kuitowa isi ya Misiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">ako tuhulika ilugha ing'atuimanyile baye,<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Niwatula imitsigho mitito kulawa mna ghamayegha ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">ghamoko ghawo ghaleka ukughala keli imitsigho.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Haung'ali koghanzika ghweghwe tsakunikema, nani nikukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nikwidika kwa ukuduma kulawa mna ghamawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nikughetsa ahala hana ghamatsi gha Meriba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Hulikitseni mwemwe iwanu wangu, mnileke niwakanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">Ghwe Isiraeli, ng'apfu ung'anitegheletse!<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Mleke kuwa na mulungu mgheni mna mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">wala mleke kumwinamila mulungu yungi.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">yaniwalapfile kulawa isi ya Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">mwasame ghumlomo ghwenu na nene nitsowang'itsa.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />Lekeni iwanu wangu ng'awahulikitse baye litsi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">na Isiraeli ng'awanibamile ghendo baye.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Apfo niwaleka waghendelele kuwa wasughu mna imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">na waghendelela ukutenda aghala ghawobama iwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Ng'apfu iwanu wangu wang'anihulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">ka Isiraeli wang'awinzile tsinzila tsangu,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />ning'asumke kuwatowa maaduwi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">na ghumoko ghwangu ghung'awatowile awala iwowadununza.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Na awala iwomuhila IMNDEWA wang'atowile ghamagoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">ukughaya kwao kung'awile kwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Lekeni mwemwe Waisiraeli ning'aweng'ile ingano inoghle ghendo mje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">na ukwi iulawa kuna libambalawe.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo mtawala mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Imulungu kakwima mna ghumtingano ghwa imilungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">koihigha imilungu itingane hamwe.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />“Mtsoghendelela kuhigha bila haki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">na kuwahighila iwanu iwehile mbaka tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Muwalamlile ghoya iwahingwa na iwachuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">mtendeleni ihaki imunu yonelighwe na imhingwa.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Muwakombole iwanu iwali nyondenyonde na iwalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">wakomboleni kulawa mna ghamoko gha iwanu iwehile.”<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Lekeni wawo ng'awomanya baye, wala ng'awotanga baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">wakwanga mna ichisi, imisingi yose ya iduniya yohighisika.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Nene nilonga, “Mwemwe mwa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">na mwemwe mwose mwa iwana wa Iyali kuchanya Ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Lekeni hata apfo, mtsakufa ka pfaili kwa iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">na mtsakughwa ka pfayakughwa mkulu wowose ayula.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Winike, Ghwe Imulungu, uihighe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwaapfila iwanu iwali mna tsiisi tsose wakwako ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s">Ukwalombela ghehile maaduwi wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, uleke kwinyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">wala uleke kukala tulu, bila ukutenda chinu ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Kwaapfila maaduwi tsako wotenda tsogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">na awala iwokuhila wenula ghamatwi ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Wopanga ukuwatendela ighehile iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">na welongela pfawobama kuwatendela iwanu wako wauwakunda.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Walonga, “Mtse, na tuwamalitse ghendo iwanu wa isi ya Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">mbaka litaghwa lya Isiraeli lileke ukukumbukighwa keli.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Kwaapfila welaghana kwa ghumoyo ghumwe ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">iwanu awano wokwikila laghano lihile ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Iwanu wa ghamahema gha Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">na Waishimaeli, na Moabu, na Wahagari,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebali, na Amoni, na Amaleki, Filisti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">na iwokala mna ghumji ghwa Tiro.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Pfipfila iwanu wa Ashuru nawo wawa chinu chimwe nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">wowapfila lweleko lwa Lutu.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Uwatende ka apfila pfauwatendile Wamidiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">ka apfila pfautendile Sisera na Yabini, hana ichikolongo cha Kishoni.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />Awala iwahupile akula Endori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">iwawile samadi mchanya mwa lidongo.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Uwatende iwakulu wawo wawe ka Orebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">na ka Zeebu, na iwatawala wawo wawe ka Zeba na Zalumuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />iwalongile, “Leka tuiboke iwe yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">isi ya Imulungu ina ghumghina ghwa ukudimila.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, uwatende ka timbwisi mna ichipfulapfumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">ka ng'umvi ighulusighwa na libeho.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Ka apfila ghumoto pfaghusoma ghumhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">na ka lilambi lya ghumoto pfalikatsa ipfidunda,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />uwawinge pfipfo kwa inyahemu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na uwatende wadedeme kwa libeho lyako iliduma.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Pfitende ipfihanga pfawo pfiwe na chinyala ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">ili iwanu walibame litaghwa lyako, Ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Wone chinyala, na wahumbuke matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">wahumbuke na wahupe ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Waleke wamanye kuwa ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">yukemighwa IMNDEWA, kwayeka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">Yuli Kuchanya Ng'ani, mchanya mwa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s">Ukumwemwetela ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Lola pfahanoghile hanu haukala ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:1">ghwe MNDEWA yuna ingupfu!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Nene nosulukila ng'ani nikale mna ipfibwalu pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">mbaka notsilika ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">Ghumoyo ghwangu na ilukuli lwangu pfomdeng'elela Imulungu iyali na ugima.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Hata isolwe naye kapata kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">na isangalala ketsengela chibali chake mna imatsabahu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">keka ghamakinda ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Ghwe MNDEWA yuna tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">mfalume wangu, na Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Wabweda awala iwokala mna ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">iwokwimbila ghweghwe chila tsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyopata tsingupfu tsake kulawa kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">na tsinzila tsing'ulu tsa ihaki tsa mna ghumoyo ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Awo hawobita mna libonde linyalile lya Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">wolitenda lilapfe tsimbwibwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">pfipfila tsimvula tsa ukuhandila tsolimemetsa ipfitsimbu.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Wakongetseka kulawa ngupfu imwe mbaka ngupfu ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">na chila munu katsolawila Sayuni, hayali Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu yuna ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">hulika liombi lyangu, hulikitsa ghwe Imulungu wa Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Ulole ingao yetu, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">na uulolese uhanga wa imunu wako yumbakile ghamapfuta.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Kwaapfila tsuwa limwe mna ipfibwalu pfa ing'anda yako linogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kubita matsuwa elufu imwe hanu hangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">Nene nisaghula ukwima hamlango mng'anda mwa Imlungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kubita ukukala mna ghamahema gha iwanu iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Kwa apfila IMNDEWA Imulungu yuyo iyali litsuwa na ingawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">IMNDEWA koweng'a iwanu uluso na ukutunyighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">ng'owema chinu chinoghile baye awala iwakwanga aku wahela matotso.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Ghwe MNDEWA yuna tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">kabweda imunu wowose iyehuwila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s">Ukuilombela isi ibwede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Kuyonesa isi uluso wako, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">kumuyitsila Yakobu ingekewa yake.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />kuwaleghusila iwanu wako ghamatotso ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">kutsighubika tsinzambi tsawo tsose.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Kuleka kuwaghudubukila keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">kuhunduka na kuileka imaya yako ng'ulu.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Utuyitse, Ghwe Imulungu wa ukombotsi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">na uleke kughendelela ukutughudubukila.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Pfihi kutsotughudubukila matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Angu imaya yako itsoghendelela mbaka mna ipfeleko pfose?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Pfihi, ng'ukuya baye utwing'e keli ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">ili iwanu wako wakudeng'elele ghweghwe?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Ghwe MNDEWA, utulanguse uluso wako ing'autsigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">na utwing'e ukombotsi wako.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Nitsohulikitsa chochose chayatsolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">kwaapfila katsolonga na iwanu wake mbuli tsa ukukala tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">na kuna iwanu wake iwotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">nawo waleke ukutenda keli pfinu pfa ubotsi.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Ona yeye kahabehi ghendo kuwakombola awala iwompfuka yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">na utunitso wake utsokala mna isi yetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Aho uluso wake mkulu na ukutogholeka kwake pfitsetingana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">baho ighanoghile na ukukala tseghamba pfakuwa chinu chimwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Ukutogholeka kutsakota muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">na ihaki itsosungulila kulawa kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Ona! IMNDEWA katsotwing'a ichinu ichinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">na isi yetu itsomela pfijo pfingi.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Haki itsoghenda hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">nayo itsotengenetsa inzila ya ghamaghulu ghake.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s">Ukulokmba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Uwambe lighutwi lyako unitegheletse, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">unyidike, kwaapfila nene namhingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">na imunu iyalihela chinu.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Uukinge ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">kwaapfila nene na wa ukutogholeka kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">lelo unikombole nene mtumighwa wako iyehuwila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Unitendele uluso, Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">kwaapfila nene nokulilila ghweghwe misi yose.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Unitende nene imtumighwa nideng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">kwaapfila noghenula kuna ghweghwe aghala ghanilomba kwa iloho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe IMNDEWA kunogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">na koleghusa tsinzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">na kumema uluso mkuu kwa awala iwokukema ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Hulikitsa chanilomba, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">utegheletse apfila pfanikulomba kwa ukulila.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Mna litsuwa lya ukughanzika kwangu nitsokukema ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwaaapfila ghweghwe kutsonyidika.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Mna imilungu yose kuduhu hata mulungu yumwe iyali ka ghweghwe, Ghwe IMNNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">na kuduhu iyodaha kutenda ighali makulu ka ghautendile ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Iwanu wose iwali mna tsiisi yuwaumbile watsokutsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">nawo watsokwinamila hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">ghwe IMNDEWA, nawo watsolitunya litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwamkulu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">naghwe kotenda ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">ghweghwe uliyeka yuyo Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Unifunze inzila yako, ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">na nene nitsoghenda mna inzila yako ilongesa.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Nitsokutunya ghweghwe, ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">na nitsolitunya litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Uluso wako mkulu ng'ani kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">kunikombola kulawa hasi kutsimu.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Ghwe Imulungu, iwanu iwana ichidandali wanyinukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">kingili lya iwanu walihela libatsi wobama wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">wawo ng'awokupfikitsa ghweghwe baye.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Lekeni Ghwe MNDEWA, kwa Imulungu yuna libatsi na uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">ng'ukona maya hima baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">ghweghwe kwamluso na kotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Hunduka, umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">umwing'e tsingupfu tsako imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">na umkombole imwana wa mtumighwa wako pinga.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Umbonese ichitango ka ghweghwe kunogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">awala iwonyihila wachone na wone chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kwaapfila ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA, kunyapfila, na kunikanza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s">Ukuitunya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Ghumsingi ghwa ghumji ghwa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:1">ghwa mna ipfidunda ipfelile.<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />IMNDEWA koghukunda ghamalango gha ghumji ghwa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">kubita hanu hangi hose ha Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Ghwe ghumji ghwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:3">iwanu wolonga pfinu pfinoghile pfa ghumji ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Nitsowakumbuka Rahabu na Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">mna awala iwanimanyile nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">Ufilisti na Tiro hamwe na Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">na nene nitsolonga, “Ayuno kelekighwa Sayuni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">Ahala! Filisti, na Tiro, na Ethiopia, itsolongighwa, “Ayu naye koneka bahala.”<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Na kwa ghumji ghwa Sayuni itsolongighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">“Imunu ayuno na imunu ayula woneka mumo,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">naye Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani katsoghungamitsa.<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />IMNDEWA hayatsowapeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">na hayatsowandika iwanu mchitabu katsakwandika apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">“Ayuno koneka mumo!”<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Na iwakwimba, na awala iwobigha, watsolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Tsimbwibwi tsangu tsose tsa mghati mwako, ghwe Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlilila Imulungu yakwapfile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wa ukombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">misi na chilo nikemelela hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Ukulomba kwangu kupfike hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">uwambe lighutwi lyako unihulikitse ichililo changu.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Mana ghumoyo ghwangu ghwipfa na ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">nene nahabehi na ukufa.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Nipetighwa hamwe na iwanu iwohulumkila kuna lipondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">niwa ka imunu iyali hela wa ukumwapfila.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Nisemwighwa hamwe na iwafile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">kulonga awala iwachinjighwe iwali mna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">ing'uwakumbuka keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">iwabaghulighwe wakale kutali ghendo na ghumoko ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Ghweghwe kunyika hasi ghendo ha lipondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">hanu ihaghendese na hana ichisi.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Imaya yako iwa mtsigho mtsito kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">naghwe kunighubikitsa na ghamawimbi ghako ghose.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Kuwatenda mbwigha tsangu wakale kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">na kunitenda nyoneke nowadesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">nihindighwa mghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">wala sidaha baye kupulusuka.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Inenge yangu ipfonda kwa apfila pfanighanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">nikukema ghweghwe chila tsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Ghwe MNDEWA, nene nikugholosela ghamoko ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Angu, pfihi ipfihulo kutsowatendela iwanu iwafile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Au, awo iwafile watsakwinuka wakutunye ghweghwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Pfihi uluso wa lilaghano lyako utsolongighwa kuna likabuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">Au ukutogholeka kwako kutsolongighwa kuna ukuhunyika?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Pfihulo pfako pfitsomanyika mna ichisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">Ighanoghile ghako ghatsomanyika kuna isi isemwighwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Lekeni nene nokulilila unyapfile, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">chila mitondo nakutsa hambele hako kukulomba.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Hebali unyasa, ghwe MNDEWA?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">Na hebali unipfisa ichihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Nene kulawa usongolo wangu nighanzika ghendo habehi na ukufwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">kwa ipfinu pfako pfinitenda nipfuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">nene nitenyuka ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Kunighudubukila ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">na ipfinu pfako pfinitenda nipfuke, na pfinihinya ghendo,<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />pfinitsunguluka kulonga matsi ighamemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">pfinitsingila chila hanu.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Ghweghwe kuwatenda mbwigha tsangu na wayangu wakale kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">na sambi ichisi chiwa sale yangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kuimbila isi ighaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Nitsakwimba uluso wa lilaghano lya IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">kwa ghumlomo ghwangu nitsotangatsa apfila ghweghwe pfautogholeka mna ipfeleko pfose.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Kwaapfila nilonga, “Uluso wako mkulu utsakwima matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">hata kulanga kwenyegho komanya ka ghweghwe kotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Nyika laghano na ayula yanimsaghule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">nilaha kwa Daudi, imtumighwa wangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />Ipfeleko pfako nitsopfitenda pfikale matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">na ichighoda cha ufalume wako nitsochitenda chime ghoya mna ipfeleko pfose.”<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Na lilanga litsotunya ipfihulo pfako, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">na ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwelile nagho ghutsakwimba apfila pfautogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Angu kulanga tsa kuna nani iyeghala na IMNDEWA,?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Yuhi iyeghala na IMNDEWA mna pfiumbe iwali kulanga?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Imulungu kopfukughwa ng'ani mna libalatsa lya iwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">yeye ka wa ukupfukighwa kubita wose iwomtsunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu yuna tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">nani yana tsingupfu kama ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Ghwe MNDEWA, na ukutogholeka kwako kwokutsunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Ghweghwe kotawala ahala ibahali haitikuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">ghamawimbi ghake haghakwinuka, ghweghwe koghahotsa.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Ghweghwe kulihonda litsoka likemighwe Rahabu na kulikoma kama imunu iyasubutulighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">kwa ghumoko ghwako ghuna tsingupfu kuwapwililisa maaduwi tsako.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Kulanga kwako ghweghwe, lidongo pfipfila lya kwako ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">isi na pfose ipfimumo kupfiumba ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Kaskazini na kusini kutsiumba ghweghwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">Tabori na Herimoni wodeng'elela litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Ghweghwe kuna ghumoko ghuna tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">ghumoko ghwako ghuna uwetso, ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghwinulighwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Ichighoda cha ufalume wako chohigha kwa haki na ukulamla ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">uluso wako mkulu na ukutogholeka pfitsolongola hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Ghwe MNDEWA, wabweda iwanu awala iwadahile ukwimba na kutowa lukenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">iwakwanga mna ghumwanga ighukwoneka haukala ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Wolideng'elela litaghwa lyako misi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">nawo wakwinuligwa mna ihaki yako.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Kwaapfila wawo weghodela ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">kwa uluso wako tsingupfu tsawo tsakongetseka.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA yuyo yutukinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">na imfalume wetu kakuna Yeye Iyelile wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kelaghana na Daudi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Kuya kulonga mna ghamaono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">kuwalongela iwatumighwa wako iwotogholeka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">ka nimwapfila imunu iyana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">nimwinula imunu iyasaghulighwe kulawa mna iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Nimwona Daudi, imtumighwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">nimbaka ghamapfuta ghangu ighelile.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Ghumoko ghwangu ghutsomkindilitsa matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">na ghumoko ghwangu ghutsomghela ingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Aduwi ng'atsodaha kumbugha baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">wala iwanu iwehile ng'awatsodaha baye kumdununza.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Lekeni nene nitsowahonda ghendo maaduwi tsake hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">na awala iwomwihila nitsowatowa.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Nene nitsakuwa munu wa kutogholeka na mluso kuna yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">na kwa lilaghano lyangu katsohuma ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Na nene nitsakwika ghumoko ghwake mchanya mwa ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">na ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo mchanya mwa imito.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Naye katsonikema, “Ghweghwe kwa Aba wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">Mlungu wangu, na bambalawe ilinikombola.”<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Na nene nitsomtenda yawe mwana chaudele wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">yawe mkulu ng'ani kubita iwafalume wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Nene nitsomtendela uluso matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">na lilaghano lyangu kuna yeye litsakwima ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Ipfeleko pfake nitsopfika pfikale matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">na ichighoda chake cha ufalume chitsoghendelela ukukala matsuwa mengi kama lilanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />Na kama iwanaghe watsoleka ukukinda imiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">na kuleka ukwanga mna ghamalamtsi ghangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />Wang'aleka kutegheletsa ghamalaghitso ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">na kuleka kukinda tsiamri tsangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />nene nitsoweng'a atsabu kwa ghamatotso ghawo kwa kuwafapula na tsimbalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">na nitsowaghalila matamu kwa tsinzambi tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Lekeni nene sitsoleka baye kumtendela uluso Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">wala sitsoleka ukutogholeka kwangu kuwe ughutsu bayer.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Sitsolibiduka baye lilaghano lyangu na yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">wala sitsoleka ukumtendela achila chanilongile.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Mna ukwela kwangu nilaha mala lumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">Daudi sitsomghutsukila chinu baye.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Ipfeleko pfake pfitsokalagha matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">na ichighoda chake cha ufalume chitsakuwa kama litsuwa hambele hangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Chitsakwima kama ghumwetsi matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">na mkalangama iyotogholeka mna ghamabingu.<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukudombotsela ukughoghighwa kwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Lekeni ghweghwe kumlema na kumbetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">kumghudubukila imunu wako yumbakile ghamapfuta.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Kulibela lilaghano lyawikile na imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">litaji lyake kulitenda lihe kwa ukulyasa mna lidongo.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Imibanda yose ya ghumji ghwake kuibomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">na tsingome tsake tsose kutsibena kutsitenda mahame.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Wose iwobita mnzila wamboka tsimali tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">naye kawa munu wa kusekighwa na awala iwomtsunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Ghweghwe kughwinula ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwa awala iwomwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">kuwatenda maaduwi tsake wose wadeng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Pfipfila kutenda lipanga lyake liwe dughi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">na ng'umtendile yahume baye kuna ing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Kuumalitsa ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">na ichighoda chake cha ufalume kuchighwisa hasi.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Ghamatsuwa gha usongolo wake kughahungutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">na kumghela chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukombolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Ghwe MNDEWA kwitsepfisa mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Kwitsepfisa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Imaya yako itsakwaka kama ghumoto?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Ukumbuke imiyaka ya ugima wangu pfaili midodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">iwanu si chinu ghendo baye, imane uwaumbile choni!<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Munu wachi iyodaha kukala mgima yaleke ukufa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Yuhi iyodaha kuukombola ugima wake na tsingupfu tsa kutsimu?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Ghwe IMNDEWA uli kwani uluso wako mkulu wa mwanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">waumlahile Daudi kwa ukutogholeka kwako?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Ghwe IMNDEWA umkumbuke imtumighwa wako pfayolighighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">na apfila pfanidudumila ahala iwanu wose hawoninanga,<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />ghamaligho ghawalighile maaduwi tsako, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">hawamnangile imbakighwa mapfuta wako chila hayobita.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Utunyighwe, Ghwe MNDEWA, matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala. Ona, pfipfo ghendo!.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="s">Musa imunu wa Imulungu kolomba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ghweghwe kwa hanu hetu ha ukukala kwa pfeleko pfose.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Tangiya ipfidunda ng'ana pfiwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">wala ng'una uiumbe isi na ipfili mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">ghweghwe kwa Mlungu tangiya matsuwa ghose ighabitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">mbaka matsuwa ghose ighakutsa.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Kowoyitsa iwanu kuna litimbwisi, ahala haulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">“Mwemwe muwanu, muye kuna litimbwisi.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Mana miyaka elufu imwe, hambele ha tsinenge tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">yeghala na litsuwa libitile lya digholo, na kama ukuwasilila kwa chilo chimwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Kowadumlila kutali iwanu, hawowasa fofofo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">nawo weghala ghendo na imitsani imela hamitondo,<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />nemitondo yotula kuya yokula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">na haipfika nemihe yoholola na yonyala.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe ung'aghudubuka twetwe tohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">na imaya yako yotughudemesa.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Ghweghwe kugheka ghamatotso ghetu hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">na tsinzambi tsetu itsipfisike tsamwatsi mna ghumwanga ghwa uhanga wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Mana ghamatsuwa ghetu ghose ghobita mna imaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">na imiyaka yetu toimalitsa mna ukughuta.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Ghamatsuwa ghetu gha ukukala wagima miyaka sabini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">na ana tuna ngupfu miyaka semanini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">lekeni imiyaka ayo yose imema maghayo na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">nayo yobita himahima, natwe twohupa.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Angu ahala haughudubuka iyomanya tsingupfu tsako nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Kwaapfila ukulu wa imaya yako welinga na apfila pfatubamighwa tukupfuke.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Utufunde ukughapeta ghoya ghamatsuwa ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">ili tudahe kuwa na ghumoyo ghuna ihekima.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ubwele! Utsokawa mbaka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Wonele libatsi iwatumighwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Hamitondo utumemetse uluso wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">ili tukwimbile na kukudeng'elela ghweghwe mna ghamatsuwa ghetu ghose.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Lelo utwing'e miyaka mingi ya ukudeng'elela ka pfautwing'ile imiyaka mingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">ya ghamaghayo na ukudununzika.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Ghamatendo ghako ghoneke kwa iwatumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">na iwana wetu uwalanguse ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Uluso wa IMNDEWA, Imlungu wetu uwe na twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">na utsimitse ghoya tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ona, tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghetu utsimitse ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo iyotukinga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Yeye iyokala hanu ha ugima ha ayula Yali Kuchanya Ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">iyobwihila hana ichimbeho cha Imulungu Iyana Ngupfu.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />Nitsomlongela IMNDEWA, “Ghweghwe kwa kimbililo lyangu na ingome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">Imlungu wangu yanikuhuwila.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Kwaapfila Yeye katsokukombola na ghumtegho ghwa mlumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">na mna utamu ukoma.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Katsokughubika na imighala yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">na ghweghwe kutsotsumila hasi ha ghamabawa ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">Ukutogholeka kwake kutsakuwa ingao na ingome yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Ng'utsopfuka ghendo baye wogha wa kuchilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">wala ghumshale ighukwasighwa nemisi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />wala utamu ukwenela mchisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">wala ukuhinyika ikulawila hamisi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Wanu elufu imwe wodaha ukufa habehi naghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">na wanu wangi elufu kumi ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">hata apfo utamu awo ng'autsokusoghelela baye ukulaghe,<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />ila kwa tsinenge tsako ghendo kutsolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">na kutsakona iwehile pfawatsolihighwa ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Kwaapfila Ghwe MNDEWA, kwa kimbililo lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">Kumtenda Yali Kuchanya Ng'ani yawe hanu hako ha ukukala.<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />Kuduhu chinu chihile ichitsokupata ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">wala utamu ukwenela ng'autsodaha baye kulisoghelela lihema lyako.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Mana Yeye katsowalaghitsa wamalaika wake wakukinge mna tsinzila tsako tsose.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Mna ghamoko ghawo watsokusola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">uleke ukwikwala ghumghulu ghwako mna libwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Kutsowabajugha isimba na inzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">na kutsowahonda ghendo na ghamaghulu imwana wa isimba na litsoka.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />“Kwaapfila konikunda nene nitsomkombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">nitsomwika hanu henulighwe kwa apfila kalimanya litaghwa lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Yeye katsonikema, na nene nitsomwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nitsakuwa hamwe naye mna ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nitsomkombola na nitsomtunya.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Nitsomtenda yakale mgima kwa matsuwa mengi, kuya nitsomkombola.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">na nitsomlangusa ukombotsi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Pfinogha ghendo kulonga mighede kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">na ukulimbila litaghwa lyako, ghweghwe Yuli Kuchanya Ng'ani,<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Pfinogha ghendo kutangatsa uluso wako chila hamitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">na kutangatsa apfila pfautogholeka chila nechilo,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />aku notowa malati lina nyutsi kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">na notowa ching'weng'we, na chinubi.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Ghwe MNDEWA, aghala ghautendile ghonitenda nene nideng'elele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nitsakwimba kwa ukusekelela kwa aghala ghautendile kwa ghamoko ghako.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Ghwe MNDEWA, aghala ghautendile makulu ng'ani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">na ghaupfika pfipfila makulu ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Imunu yalihela tsimbutsi ng'oghatanga baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">wala imunu mbotsi aghano ng'odaha kughamanya baye.<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />Iwanu iwehile wodaha kukula ka mitsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">iwotenda ighehile wodaha kubweda mna chila chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">lekeni wotsighila kuna ukuhinyighwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Lekeni ghweghwe MNDEWA, kutsakwinulighwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Ghwe MNDEWA, lola maaduwi tsako awano hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">maaduwi tsako awo watsokomighwa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">na awala wose iwotenda ighehile watsopwililika.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Lekeni ghweghwe kungaya ingupfu ka ya mbogho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">aku kunighidila ghamapfuta ighanoghile mchanya mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Tsinenge tsangu tsona apfila maaduwi tsangu pfawaghwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">na maghutwi ghangu ghahulika apfila iwanu iwehile pfawotsoghaya.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Imunu yana ihaki katsomela kama mbiki ghwa mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">katsakwenela kama mkataluba ghwa Lebanoni,<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />na awala iwahandighwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA watsakwenela mna ipfibwalu pfa Imlungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Watsakweleka ghamatunda mbaka hawakuwa wanzehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">watsoneneha na kudegheta,<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />watangatse ka IMNDEWA, kana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">yeye yuyo libambalawe lyangu, na mghati mwake mduhu tsuluma.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo mfalume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />IMNDEWA kotawala, kepfalitsa utunitso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">IMNDEWA kepfalitsa utunitso, kuya keyoha imwenyegho itsingupfu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Kaimisa ghoya isi, nayo ng'aitsohighisika baye.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Ichighoda cha ufalume wako chimitsighwa ghoya tangiya ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">na ghweghwe kwabaho hata ng'ana ghamatsuwa ghanze baye.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Ghwe MNDEWA, imito yoduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">imito yolapfa litsi lyake kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">na imito ilapfa imidumo yake.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />IMNDEWA kamkulu ako kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kamkulu ghendo kubita ghamatsi ighoduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kubita ghamawimbi gha ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Ghwe MNDEWA, ghamalaghitso ghako ghotogholeka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">na ing'anda yako yela mna matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kohigha iwanu wose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ghweghwe kwa Imulungu yuwoyitsila iwanu ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">Ghweghwe kwa Imulungu yuwoyitsila iwanu ighehile ghawatendile, ulawe wilanguse.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Wime wima, Ghwe Mlamtsi wa iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">uwoyitsile ghehile ghawo iwanu wana ichidandali ka pfaibamighwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Ghwe MNDEWA, mbaka tsuwachi ghendo?,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">Mbaka tsuwachi iwanu wehile watseghoda?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Wawo wolonga kwa ukwitamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">iwanu wehile wolonga kwa ukwighoda.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Ghwe MNDEWA, wawo wowahonda iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">wowadununza ghendo awala iwali wakwako.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Wowakoma pfitsuka, na iwagheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">na wowakoma iwana iwalihela aba tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Kuya wolonga, “IMNDEWA ng'atsakona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">wala Imulungu wa Yakobo ng'atsomanya chinu baye.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Mtange mwemwe imlihela tsimbutsi ghendo, imkala mna iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">Angu tsuwachi mtsopata tsimbutsi mwemwe yamli wabotsi?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Angu ayula iyahumbile ghamaghutwi ghetu, ng'ohulika baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Apfi ayula iyaumbile tsinenge, ng'akona baye?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Pfihi iyotsitowa tsiisi, pfihi ng'odaha baye kutsikembela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Iyowafunda iwanu ukumanya, pfihi imwenyegho ng'omanya baye?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />IMNDEWA koghamanya ghawopfikitsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">nagho si chinu ghendo baye.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyomwatsibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">Ghwe MNDEWA, ayula yumlangulitsa ghamalaghitso ghako,<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />ili mna litsuwa lya ghamaghayo yeye yakale tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">mbaka iwehile hawohimbilighwa lipondo.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Kwa apfila IMNDEWA ng'atsowaleka baye iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">wala ng'atsowasemwa baye awala iwali wakwake.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Kwaapfila ghamalamtsi ghatsolapfighwa keli kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">na wose wana imimoyo inoghile watsoghawinza.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Nani yatsakwinuka yeme na nene hanitingana na iwanu iwehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Nani yatsonyapfila ahala hanitingana na awala iwotenda ighehile?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Tsa kama IMNDEWA ng'anyapfile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">nene ning'aghendile kuna isi ya iwanu iwafile.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Ahala hanilongile, “Ghumghulu ghwangu ghuteletsa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">uluso wako mkulu Ghwe MNDEWA, unyimitsa.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />ahala hanikwalangula ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">ghweghwe kongaya ndeng'elo na konikanza.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Pfihi walamutsi iwotsulumu wodaha kukala hamwe naghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">Wawo iwotunga ghamalaghitso ighowadununza iwanu?<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Welaghana wawakome wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">na kulamla waimwaghe idamu ya iwanu iwalihela matotso.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Lekeni IMNDEWA nene kawa ingome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">na Imulungu wangu yuyo libambalawe lyangu lya ukwipfisa.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Naye kawoyitsila iwenyegho ighehile ghawanitendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">na kwa ajili ya agho ighehile ghawo kawamalitsa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">ona IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, kawamalitsa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Mtse tumwimbile IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">tumdeng'ele iyali libambalawe lya ukombotsi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Tughende hambele hake aku twolonga mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">na kumwimbila wila wa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Kwa apfila IMNDEWA ka Imulungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">na ka mfalume mkulu kubita imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Hanu haghendese ghendo hasi ha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">yeye kahakindilisa kwa ghamoko ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">na ipfidando pfose pfa ipfidunda pfake yeye.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Ibahali yake yeye, na yeye yuyo iyaiumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">na yeye yuyo iyaumbile isi isakale kwa ghamoko ghake.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Mtse tumwinamile, tumtambikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">mtse tumtowele ghamagoti hambele ha IMNDEWA, Maumba wetu!<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Kwaapfila yeye yuyo Imulungu wetu, natwe twa iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">twa ng'olo iwodimighwa hana ghumghina ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Lelo tegheletseni apfino pfayolonga.<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />“Mleke kuitenda imimoyo yenu iwe misughu, ka apfila akula Meriba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">na ka akula Masa kunyika,<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />ahala iwahenga wenu hawanighetsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">wanighetsa hata ka tsawaghona aghala makulu ghanitendile.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Kwa miyaka alubaini nene nidesighwa na ilweleko alula, nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">‘Iwanu awano wagha ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">ng'awotsimanya ghendo baye tsinzila tsangu.’<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Baho nighudubuka ng'ani, nilaha nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Ng'awatsakwingila baye hanu hangu ha ukubwihila.’”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo mfalume na mlamtsi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">mwimbileni IMNDEWA isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA, mlitunye litaghwa lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">mtangatse ukombotsi wake chila haukucha.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Wapeteleni iwanu wa tsiisi utunitso wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">na walongeleni iwanu wose ghamatendo ghake ighokangawatsa,<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamkulu na wa kutunyighwa ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">yeye kobamighwa yapfukighwe kubita imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Kwaapfila imilungu yose ya iwanu si chinu ghendo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">lekeni IMNDEWA yeye iyaumbile lilanga.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Ukulu na ukutunitso pfa hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">tsingupfu na ukunogha pfa mna ing'anda yake iyelile.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Mwing'eni IMNDEWA, iwanu wa tsikolo tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">mwing'eni IMNDEWA utunitso na tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Mwing'eni IMNDEWA utunitso wa litaghwa lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">mghale tsinambiko mwingile mna ipfibwalu pfake.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Mwinamileni IMNDEWA kwaapfila yeye kela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">mghudeme hambele hake mwe muwanu wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Longeni kuna iwanu wa tsiisi, “IMNDEWA yuyo iyotawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">isi kaimisa ghoya nayo ng'aihighisika baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Katsowahigha iwanu kwa haki.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Leka kulanga kudeng'elele, na isi nayo ideng'e,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">leka ibahali idume hamwe na pfose pfili mghati mwake.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Imighunda na ideng'elele, na pfose ipfili mmighunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">nayo imibiki yose ya kumhulo itsakwimba kwa ukudeng'elela,<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />hambele ha IMNDEWA, iyakutsa, ona kakutsa yaighige isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Katsotsihigha tsiisi kwa haki ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">na kwa ukutogheleka kwake katsowahigha iwanu wa tsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu mtawala mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />IMNDEWA kotawala, ghwe isi deng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">namwe ipfisiwa pfingi mdeng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Ghamabingu na ichisi totolo pfomtsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">ichighoda chake cha ufalume chikighwa mna ghumsingi ghwa haki na ukulamla ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Ghumoto ghomlongolela hayoghenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">nagho ghowalakatsa maaduwi tsake ubali wose.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Ilumwesa lwake lwoimwemwesela isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">nayo isi yakona na yoghudema.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Ipfidunda pfolubuka kulonga nta hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">hambele ha IMNDEWA wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Kulanga kotangatsa ihaki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">na iwanu wose wakona utunitso wake.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Walekeni waghelighwe chinyala awala wose iwotambikila ipfinyagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">awala iweghodela ipfinyagho ipfili si chinu ghendo baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">Mwemwe imilungu yose, mwinamileni yeye IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Ghwe MNDEWA, iwanu wa Sayuni wahulika nawo wosekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">nawo wanu wa Yuda wodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">kwaapfila kwa ghamalamtsi ghako kolamla ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe MNDEWA, kwa wa kuchanya ng'ani kubita isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">kwinulighwa kubita imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Mwemwe yamumkunda IMNDEWA, mghahile ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">yeye koulinda ugima wa iwanu wake iwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">kowakombola kulawa mna ghamoko gha iwanu iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Ghumwanga ghomlangatsila imunu yana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">na imunu yana ghumoyo ighunoghile katsodendeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Mdeng'eleni IMNDEWA, mwe muwanu yamna ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">na mlonge mighede kwaapfila yeye kela.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo mtawala wa isi yose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwa apfila katenda pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwa ghumoko ghwake ghuna ingupfu, na ghumoko ghwake ighwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">ghumtenda yahume.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />IMNDEWA kautenda ukombotsi wake umanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">kaitenda ihaki yake yoneke hambele ha iwanu wa tsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Kaukumbuka uluso wa lilaghano lyake na ukutogholeka kwake kwa ing'anda ya Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">chila imembe ya isi yona ukombotsi wa Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Isi yose imdeng'elele IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">imwimbileni kwa ukudeng'elela na kwa ukutowa lukenze.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Mwimbileni IMNDEWA kwa chinubi, na ilukenze,<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />kwa ghamatalumbeta na tsimalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">mwimbe kwa litsi kulu hambele ha mfalume, IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Leka ibahali idume, na ipfinu pfose ipfili mghati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">isi na pfose ipfili mumo,<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />imito itowe ghamakofi, na ipfidunda pfimbe kwa ukudeng'elela,<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />hambele ha IMNDEWA, kwaapfila kakutsa yaihighe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">katsoihigha isi kwa ihaki, na katsowahigha iwanu kwa ukugholosa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo mtawala mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />IMNDEWA kotawala, iwanu wali mna tsiisi woghudema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">kakala mchanya mwa pfilumbe iwakemighwe ghamakelubi, na isi yose yohighisika.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />IMNDEWA kamkulu ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">naye kenulighwa mchanya mwa iwanu iwali mna tsiisi tsose.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Leka wose walimbile litaghwa lyake kulu na lya ukupfukighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">kwaaapfila yeye yuyo iyelile.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Imfalume kana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">naye konoghelwa ukutenda ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">ghweghwe kulangusa ihaki mna Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">ghweghwe ghendo yughalile ghamalamtsi na ihaki mna isi ya Yakobu.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">na mmwinamile hana ichighoda cha ukwikila ghamaghulu ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">yeye yuyo iyelile.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Musa na Haruni wakala watambika wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">na Samweli kakala yumwe wa awala iwalikemile litaghwa lyake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Wamkema IMNDEWA, naye kawedika.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Kalonga nawo mna ingutso ya libingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">waghakinda ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yaweng'ile.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, ghweghwe kuwedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">kuna wawo ghweghwe tsa Imulungu yuwaleghusile tsinzambi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">hata kama kuwatowa kwa ghamatotso ghawo ghawatendile.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">na mmwinamile kuna ichidunda chake ichelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu, yeye kela.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukutunya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Mdeng'eleleni IMNDEWA kwa kukemelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:1">mwemwe iwanu wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Mtambikileni IMNDEWA kwa kusekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">mtse hambele hake aku mwakwimba wila tsa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Mmanye kuwa IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">yeye iyatuumbile, na twetwe wakwake yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">twetwe twa wanu wake na twa wang'olo iyowadima kuna ghumghina ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Mwingile mna ghamalango ghake aku mwolonga mighede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">na mbite akuno mwodeng'elela mna ipfibwalu pfake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mlonge mighede na mlitunye litaghwa lyake.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Kwaapfila yeye kanogha, yeye IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">naye kotogholeka kulawa lweleko mbaka lweleko.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s">Laghano lya mfalume</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Nitsowimbila uluso wako mkulu na nitsoimbila ihaki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">Ghwe IMNDEWA nitsokwimbila.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Nitsakwalangitsa nikale aku nahela matotso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Lelo utsakutsa tsuwachi kuna nene?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Nene nitsoghenda kuna ing'anda yangu aku nina moyo ghunogha.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Hambele ha tsinenge tsangu sitsakwika chinu chihile nichilolese baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Ghamatendo gha iwanu wehile noghehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">nene sitsoghawinza baye.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Ghumoyo ghuhile ng'aghutsokala nani baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">na nene sitsobama ukutenda chinu chihile baye.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Ayula iyomdeta miyaghe hachisogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">ayo nitsomhinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">na iyana tsinenge tsa chidandali na ghumoyo ighwighoda sitsomdudumila baye.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Ila tsinenge tsangu tsitsowalolesa iwanu iwotogholeka muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">awo wakale na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">ayula iyoghenda mna inzila ing'aina matotso ayo yuyo iyatsonitumikila.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Imunu mghutsu ng'atsokala mng'anda mwangu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">na imunu iyobugha ng'atsakwima hambele hangu baye.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Chila haukucha nitsowahinya iwanu wose wa isi iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">niwatende wahupe kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">awala wose ghendo iwotenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba mna ghamaghayo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Uhulike ghanilomba, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">ichililo changu cha ukukulomba unyapfile chikupfikile.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Uleke kunipfisa uhanga wako mna litsuwa lya ukughaya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">uteghe lighutwi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">hanikukema usumke unyidike.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghangu ghomala ka liyosi pfalighuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">na imipate yangu yakwaka kulonga tanuli.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghulaghighwa na ghuholola kulonga mitsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">mbaka nisemwa hata ukuja ichijo changu.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Nene noghutilila mbaka nisoka ng'ani,<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Neghala na ichimulu wa kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">na kama ichimulu yokala mna ghamahame.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Kuchilo nowasa meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">kulonga chideghe mchuwa mchanya mwa ichiswili.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Misi yose aduwi tsangu woninanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">awala iwonibetsa welaha litaghwa lyangu.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Kwapfila ndiya lipfu ka chijo, na nihanganya chanikung'wa na ghamasotsi,<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />kwa imaya yako na ukughudubuka kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">kwaapfila ghweghwe kunisola na kunyasa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ghamatsuwa ghangu gheghala na ichimbeho cha nemihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">nopfonda kulonga mitsani.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Lekeni ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA, kokala mchighoda chako cha ufalume matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">na ipfeleko pfose ipfikutsa pfitsokukumbuka<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Ghwegwe ghumwenyegho kutsakwinuka uyonele libatsi Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwaapfila aghuno ghugho msimu ghwa ukwonesa libatsi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwaapfila ghumsimu ighwikighwe ghupfika.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Kwa apfila iwatumighwa wako woghadeng'ela ghamabwe ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">na litimbwisi lyake wolising'inikila.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi watsolipfuka litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">na wafalume wose wa isi watsoupfuka utunitso wako,<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />IMNDEWA hayatsotsenga keli Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">na kulawila mna utunitso wake,<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />hayatsoghahulika ghamalombi gha imunu iyalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">ng'atsoghabetsa baye ghamalombi agho.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Leka alino lyandikighwe mna ichitabu liwe lya ipfeleko ipfikutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">iwanu awala ing'awana waumbighwe watse wamtunye IMNDEWA,<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />kwaapfila kalolesa hasi kulawa hanu hake helile ako kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">ona, kulawa kulanga IMNDEWA kailolesa isi,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />yahulike iwohighwe pfawodomboketsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">yawalekelele awala iwahighighwe ukufa.<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Apfo iwanu watsolitangatsa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">na utunitso wake umanyike ako Yerusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />Aho iwanu wa tsiisi hawatsetingana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">na tsifalume tsitsetingana tsimtumikile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Katsihungutsa tsingupfu tsangu mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">na ghamatsuwa ghangu pfipfila kaghahungutsa.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Apfo nene nolonga, “Ghwe Mlungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">uleke kunisola haning'ali msongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">imiyaka yako yolawa lweleko lumwe mbaka lweleko lungi.”<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Aho mwanduso ghweghwe yuyo yawikile imisingi ya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">naghwe kulumba kulanga kwa sang'ano tsa ghamoko ghako.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Apfo pfitsohupa, lekeni ghweghwe kutsoghendelela ukukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">ona ghendo, apfo pfose pfitsolala kulonga magwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">naghwe kutsotsasa ka pfautsula lighwanda na kulyasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">napfo pfitsohupa.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Lekeni ghweghwe kwa Yuyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">na imiyaka yako ng'aitsohupa baye.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Iwana wa iwatumighwa wako watsokala wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">na iwatsakwelekighwa nawo watsakwing'ighwa ngupfu hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s">Uluso wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Leka nene nimtunye IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">na apfila pfose ipfili mghati mwangu pfilitunye litaghwa lyake ilyelile.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Nene nimtunye IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">wala nileke kuusemwa uluso wake wose,<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />yeye iyonileghusila ghamatotso ghangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">na iyonihonetsa ghamatamu ghose.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Yeye yuyo iyoukombola ugima wangu kulawa kuna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">na iyonipfatsa litaji lya uluso wake na libatsi,<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />iyonyongetsela ighanoghile mna ugima wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">iyonitenda niwe msongolo keli na niwe na ngupfu ka magengele.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyotenda gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">na koweng'a ihaki awala wose iwodununzighwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Katenda tsinzila tsake tsimanyike kwa Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">na ghamatendo ghake kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />IMNDEWA kana libatsi na uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">ng'osumka kona maya baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">na kamema uluso wa lilaghano lyake.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Ng'atsoghendelela baye kukembela matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">wala ng'oghudubuka baye matsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Ng'atutendele baye kwa ukulola tsinzambi tsetu pfatsili baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">wala ng'atulihile baye kwa ukulola ukwiha kwetu,<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Ka apfila kulanga pfakuli kutali ng'ani na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">pfipfo pfauli mkulu uluso wake kwa awala iwompfuka.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Ka mashariki pfaili kutali kulawa magharibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">pfipfo pfayatsasile kutali na twetwe tsinzambi tsetu.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Ka apfila aba pfayowonela libatsi iwanaghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayowonela libatsi iwanu wake,<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />kwa apfila yeye katumanya pfatuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">na kokumbuka ka twetwe twatimbwisi hela.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Ghamatsuwa gha imunu gheghala na imitsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">kokula ka luwa lya kumghunda,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />kuya libeho lyolighulusa litsani alyo, nalyo lyohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">na hanu halikalile ng'ahatsomanyika keli baye.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Lekeni uluso mkulu wa IMNDEWA wokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">kwa awala wose iwompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">na ihaki yake kwa iwana wa iwana awo,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />awala iwolikinda lilaghano lyake, na awala iwokumbuka ghamalaghitso ghake na ukughatenda.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />IMNDEWA kachimisa ghoya ichighoda chake cha ufalume kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">na ufalume wake wotawala ipfinu pfose.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA, mwemwe wamalaika wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">mwemwe yamna tsingupfu, yamlikinda lilonga lyake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">na ukutegheletsa litsi ya lilonga lyake.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA lijeshi lya malaika wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">mwemwe iwatumighwa wake wamtenda achila chayobama.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA, tsisang'ano tsake tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">mumtunye chila hanu hayotawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">leka nene nimtunye IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s">Mumtunye muumba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Leka nene nimtunye IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Ghwe IMNDEWA Mlungu wangu, kwa mkulu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">kwipfalitsa ukulu na itunitso.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Kwighubika ghumwanga ka bwende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">kogholosa kulanga ka lihema,<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />na kwika tsingutso tsa ligholofa lyako mchanya mwa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">yutenda ghamabingu kuwa mtuka ghwako ghwa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">na koghuluka mchanya mwa ghamabawa gha libeho.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Yeye kowatenda wamalaika wake wawe beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">na iwatumighwa wake wawe lambi lya ghumoto.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Kayimisa isi ime ghoya mna imisingi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">ili ileke kuhighisika ghendo matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Ghweghwe kuighubika isi kwa ibahali kulonga bwende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">nagho ghamatsi ghaghubika ghendo ipfidunda pfose.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Ghweghwe kughakembela ghamatsi nagho ghatsuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">naghwe haudumile kulanga, ghasumka ghoka,<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />ghadina ipfidunda, ghahulumka kuna ghamabonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">mbaka hanu ahala haubamile ghakale.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Naghwe kwika ghumbaka ghaleke kughuloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">ghaleke kuya keli kuighubika isi.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Ghweghwe yuyo yutenda tsimbwibwi tsilawe mna ghamakonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">na tsibite haghati ha ipfidunda.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Atso tsoweng'a ghamatsi gha ukung'wa iwanyama wa kwibagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">na tsomalitsa tsing'ilu tsa wapfihongwe wa kumhulo.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Wapfideghe wa kulanga wotsenga ipfibali pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">na wakwimba wila mna ghamaputila gha imibiki.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Ghweghwe koitowela imvula ipfidunda kulawa kuchanya kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">nayo isi yomema ipfinu pfinoghile pfaumbile.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Kotenda libagho lyote liwe mghina ghwa ukuja iwanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">na imimeya yawohanda iwanu wapate ichijo,<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />na idipfai isangalamsa ghumoyo ghwa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">ghamapfuta gha ukubakala ipfihanga pfidedemke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na chighate ichiwanoghelesa iwanu imimoyo.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Imibiki ya IMNDEWA, yobokela mvula nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">ona, imikataluba ya Lebanoni yauihandile.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Amwo wapfideghe wotsenga ipfibali pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">na ikolongo kakwika ikaye yake mna imisonobali.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Kuna ipfidunda pfitali kuko kwawali wamene wa kumhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">na tsilwatu tsa ghamabambalawe mumo wabalaghaja mwawotsumila.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Kaghuumba ghumwetsi ghwonese imisimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">na litsuwa lyomanya pfalitsakuswa.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Koghala ichisi, ichilo chakwingila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">baho chila mnyama wa kumhulo kolawa kakwanga,<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />iwana wa isimba woduma wobama waghoghe mnyama wa ukuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">na wobama ichijo chawo kulawa kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Litsuwa halilawa, wakuya mna tsimango tsawo wowasa.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Baho naye imunu koghenda kuna ing'onde yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">na kuna isang'ano yake mbaka hamihe.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Lola, pfatsili nyingi tsisang'ano tsako, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">ghose kughatenda kwa hekima, isi imema ipfiumbe pfako.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Ibahali ya akula, ng'ulu na ipfika kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">imema pfiumbe ing'apfidahika baye ukupetighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">ipfiumbe pfina ugima, pfidodo na pfikulu.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Amwo mna tsimeli tsakwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">na Lewiyatani, yumuumbile yadawale mmo.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Awo wose wokubeta ghweghwe uweng'e ichijo chawo hawochibama.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Hauweng'a, wawo wochika hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">haupfumbula ghumoko ghwako wawo weghuta ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Haupfisa uhanga wako, wawo wakwingila wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">haulapfa iloho yawo, wawo wakufwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">nawo wakuya mna litimbwisi lyawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Haughala iloho yako, wawo woumbighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">naghwe koutenda uhanga wa isi uwe wasambi.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Utunitso wa IMNDEWA na ukale matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">IMNDEWA yatsideng'elele tsisang'ano tsake.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Yeye koilolesa isi nayo yodedema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">kopfidonza ipfidunda napfo pfodusuka liyosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Nitsomwimbila IMNDEWA mna ghamatsuwa gha ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">nitsakwimba wila tsa ukumtunya Imlungu wangu matsuwa ghose hanikala mgima.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Ukutongelela kwangu nakumnoghele yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">nene nomdeng'elela IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Iwotenda tsinzambi wahupe muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">na iwehile waleke kuwa baho keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">leka nene nimtunye IMNDEWA! Mtunye IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu na iwanu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Mlongeleni IMNDEWA mighede, mlikeme litaghwa lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">muwapetele iwanu waghamanye ghamatendo ghake.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Mwimbileni yeye, mmwimbile tsiwila tsa kumtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">mghalonge ghamatendo ghake ghose gha ukukangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Mwighodele litaghwa lyake lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">na imimoyo ya awala iwompfuka IMNDEWA ideng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Mbameni IMNDEWA na tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">mghendelele kuubama uhanga wake.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Mghakumbuke ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghayatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">ipfihulo pfake na ghamalamtsi gha ghumlomo ghwake,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />mwemwe watsukulu wa Abrahamu, imtumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">mwemwe muwana wa Yakobu, muwanu wake yamsaghulighwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Yeye yuyo IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">Imlungu wetu, ghamalamtsi ghake ghamna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Kolikumbuka lilaghano lyake matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">kotenda aghala ghayalaghitse kwa ipfeleko elufu,<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />lyayekile na Abrahamu, na ukwilaha kwayelahile kwa Isaka,<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />na kalikomangitsa kwa Yakobu liwe malaghitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">na kwa Isiraeli liwe laghano lya matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />ahala hayalongile, “Nitsokwing'a ghweghwe isi ya Kanaani iwe yako.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Mna matsuwa agho tsamna wanu chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">chidogho ghendo na wagheni.<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />Nawo tsawang'ali wotangatanga kulawa isi imwe mbaka isi ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">kulawa ufalume umwe mbaka ufalume ungi,<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />lekeni Imulungu ng'awalekile baye munu wowose yawadununze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">na kwa ajili yao kawakembela hata wafalume,<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />kalonga, “Mleke kuwadonza iwanu wangu yaniwabakile mapfuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">wala mleke kuwalagha manabii wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Naye kaghala inzala muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">kapfihinya ipfijo pfawo pfose.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Kawalongotsela munu yaghendile hambele hawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yosefu iyautsighwe kama mtumwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Ako iwanu wamwoha ghamaghulu ghake kwa iminyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">na isingo yake wayoha kwa chuma,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />mbaka aghala ghayalongole ukulonga haghatimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">apfo lilonga lya IMNDEWA litogholeka kubitila yeye.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Imulungu kaghala mfalume, naye kamlekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">ona, mtawala wa iwanu kamlekelela,<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />kamwika yawe mkulu wa ing'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">na yawe mtawala wa ipfinu pfake pfose,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />yawohe iwakulu wa ufalume wake ka pfayobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na yawafunde ihekima iwanzehe wake.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Kuya Isiraeli katsa Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakobu kawa mgheni mna isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />IMNDEWA kawatenda iwanu wake weleke iwana wengi ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">na kawatenda wawe na ngupfu kubita maaduwi tsawo,<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />naye kaitenda imimoyo ya Wamisiri iwehile iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">wawatendele pfihile iwatumighwa wake.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Kuya kamtuma Musa imtumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">kamtuma hamwe na Haruni, iyamsaghule.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Walangusa pfitango pfikulu mghati mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">na watenda pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa kuna isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Kaghala ichisi, nayo isi iwa na chisi totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">kwaapfila tsa walema ukughatoghola ghamalonga ghake.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Kaghalusa ghamatsi ghawo ghawa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">kawatenda wasomba wawo wafe.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Isi yawo imema wapfibutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">mbaka mna ipfiheleto pfa wafalume wawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Imulungu kalonga, na baho walawila wang'onzi wengi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">na wamani walawila mna isi yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Katsitenda tsimvula tsawo tsiwe mvula tsa ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">na ghumoto ghuna ghamalambi ghwaka mna isi yawo,<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />kaihinya iminzabibu yawo, na imitini yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">na kaibenabena imibiki ya isi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Yeye kalonga, na baho walawila wanzighe, na balangulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">wengi ng'ani ing'awodaha ukupeteka baye,<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />waja imimeya yose ya isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">na waja ghamatsao gha lidongo lyawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Kuya kamkoma chila mwana chaudele mna isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">iwana iwoneke aba tsawo hawang'ali wasongolo.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />naye kawalapfa kulawa aku wana ifetsa na inzahabu nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">wala ng'ahana munu hata yumwe mna ghamakabila ghake iyekwalile.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Wamisiri wadeng'elela Waisiraeli hawokile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwaapfila Wamisiri wang'ali wowapfuka Waisiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Katandatsa libingu liwaghubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">na ghumoto ghuwalangatsile nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Walomba, naye kawaghalila wang'wale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">na kaweng'a ichighate cha kulanga waje weghute.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Katula libambalawe, ghamatsi ghalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">ghaluta kunyika ka mto.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Kwaapfila tsakalikumbuka lilaghano lyake lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">lyayekile na mtumighwa wake Aburahamu,<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Apfo kawalapfa iwanu wake kuna isi kwa ukudengelela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">iwanu wake iyawasaghule wemba na watowa lukenze.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Kaweng'a tsiisi tsa iwanu wangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">nawo waboka ipfinu pfawasang'anile iwanu wangi,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />ili iwanu wakinde imiko yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">na waghakinde malaghitso ghake. IMNDEWA yatunyighwe!<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s">Uluso wa Imulungu kwa iwanu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />IMNDEWA yatunyighwe! Mlongeleni IMNDEWA mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">kwaapfila yeye kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">uluso wake mkulu wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Nani iyodaha ukughalonga ghamatendo makulu gha IMNDEWA?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Yuhi iyodaha ukumtunya pfaibamighwa?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Wabweda awala iwokinda ighagholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">awala iwoghendelela ukutenda ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Unikumbuke Ghwe MNDEWA, ahala hauwatendela ighanoghile iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">utse unyapfile ahala hauwakombola,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />nidahe kwona apfila pfawobweda iwanu wako yauwasaghule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">ili nideng'elele ka iwanu wa isi yako pfawodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na nikutunye hamwe na iwanu wako.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Twetwe tutenda nzambi, hamwe na iwahenga wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">tutosa na tutenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Iwahenga wetu ako Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">ng'awatlangitse baye ghamatendo ghako gha ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">wala ng'awaghakumbuke baye uluso wako mkulu wauwatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">lekeni wakubiduka ghweghwe hana ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Hata apfo kawakombola ka pfayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">ili yatende tsingupfu tsake tsimanyike.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Kaikembela ibahali ya Shamu nayo inyala ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">naye kawabititsa amwo kulunga wobita mna inyika.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Kawakombola kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">na kawakombola mna ghumoko ghwa maaduwi tsawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Ghamatsi ghawaghubika aduwi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">na ng'ahonile hata munu yumwe baye.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Baho waghatoghola ghamalonga ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">wamwimbila tsiwila tsa ukumtunya.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Lekeni bila kukawa waghasemwa aghala ghayawatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">wala ng'awabetile baye achila chayalongile Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Wona basu kulu akula kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">na kuko wamghetsa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Apfo kaweng'a achila chawabamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">lekeni kawaghalila utamu wa kuwatenda wasoke.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Kuna indalo wamwonela gele Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">na Haruni, imunu iyelile wa IMNDEWA,<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />baho lidongo lipfughuka limmetsa Datani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">na limghubika Abiramu hamwe na likingili lyake,<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />ghumoto ghuwalakatsa awala iwelongotse nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">lilambi lyake liwalambita awanu awo iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Ako Horebu watengenetsa indama wa nzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">kuya wachinamila ichinyagho acho cha inzahabu cha ukulubula.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Baho waleka ukumwinamila Imulungu yana utunitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">wanza ukutambikila ichinyagho cha imnyama iyakuja imitsani.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Wamsemwa Imulungu, iyawakombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">iyatendile makulu akula Misiri,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />na yatendile pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa kuna isi ya Hamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">na ghamatendo gha ukukangawatsa kuna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Imulungu tsakalonga yang'awakomile ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">lekeni Musa imunu wake iyamsaghule tsakengilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">kaihotsa imaya yake, yaleke ukuwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Kuya wailema isi aila inoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">ng'awalitoghole baye achila chayalongile.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Walonganika mna ghamahema ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">wala ng'awahulikitse baye litsi lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Apfo Imulungu kenula ghumoko ghwake kelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">ka yang'awakomile kunyika,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />na iwana wawo yang'awasile kuna tsiisi tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">na katsowapwililisa mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Kuya welunga wamtambikile mulungu Baali wa Peori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">waja tsinambiko itsitambikilighwe imitsimu.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke kwa ghamatendo ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">na baho utamu wa tauni uwaghwila.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Lekeni Finehasi kenuka kema haghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">na utamu aula umala.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Kwa alino yeye koneka ka imunu yana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">kulawa pfeleko mbaka pfeleko matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Hana ghamatsi gha Meriba wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">na kwa alyo wamhonza Musa,<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />kwaapfila tsawamtenda Musa yone usungu mna iloho yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">apfo ghumlomo ghwake ghulonga mbuli tsa ubotsi.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Ng'awawakomile baye iwanu wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse,<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />lekeni wehanganya iwenyegho na iwanu wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">na wefunda ghamatendo ghawo,<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />wapfitambikila ipfinyagho pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">napfo pfiwa mitegho kuna wawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Nawo wawalapfa iwana wawo na neghe tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa kwa imitsimu.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Wamwagha idamu ya iwana wawo na neghe tsawo iwalihela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">awo iwawalapfile wawe nambiko kwa ipfinyagho pfa isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">na idamu yawo iitenda isi ihe.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Wetenda iwenyegho wehe kwa tsisang'ano tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">na kwa ghamatendo ghawo woneka watenda ughoni kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawonela maya iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">naye kawehila ng'ani awala iwali wake.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Kawatenda iwanu wa isi tsingi wawahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">nawo iwawehile wawatawala.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Aduwi tsawo wawaonea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">na wawatenda wawatumikile.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />IMNDEWA kawakombola iwanu wake mala nyingi.,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">lekeni wawo wambiduka yeye mna imipango yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">nawo waghendelela ghendo na ighehile ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kawona apfila pfawang'ali wodununzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">na kahulika ichililo chawo ahala hawamlilile yawapfile.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Baho kalikumbuka lilaghano lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">na kwa uluso wake mkulu ng'ani kahotsa imaya yake.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Kawatenda aduwi tsawo wose iwawaghoghile wawonele libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Tukombole, ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">utubweletse kulawa kuna tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">ili tulilongele mighede litaghwa lyako ilyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na twighode mna utunitso wako.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imlungu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">tangiya matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa mbaka matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Na iwanu wose walonge, “Ona pfipfo!” IMNDEWA yatunyighwe!<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="s">Mumtunye Imulungu iyanoghile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Mlongeleni IMNDEWA mighede, kwaapfila yeye kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">na uluso wake mkulu wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Leka awala iwakombolighwe na IMNDEWA walonge apfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">awala iyawakombole kulawa kuna ghumoko ghwa maaduwi,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />awala iyawabweletse kulawa isi tsingi, kulawa mashariki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa magharibi, kulawa kaskazini, na kulawa kusini.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Wamwenga watangatanga kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">ng'awonile inzila ya ukuwaghala kuna mji ghwa ukukala baye.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Wona inzala, na wona ing'ilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">nawo wang'ali wotsilika.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Baho hawang'ali woghanzika, wamlilila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">naye kawakombola kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Kawalongotsa mna inzila igholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">waghenda mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa ukukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Waleke wamlongele IMNDEWA mighede, kwa uluso wake mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">na kwa ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghayawatendele iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Kwaapfila yeye kohotsa ilumelo luna ing'ilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na imunu yana inzala kommemetsa ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Awala iwakalile mna ichisi, na mna ichisi totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wohighwa mna ghamaghayo na iminyololo ya ichuma,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />mana waghalema ghamalonga gha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">na waghabetsa ghamalaghitso gha Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Tsawepfa ghendo kwa ukusang'ana ng'onde ng'omu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">apfo waghwa hasi na ng'ahakalile na munu wa ukuwapfila baye.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Hawang'ali woghanzika wamlilila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">naye kawakombola na ghamaghayo ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Kawalapfa kulawa kuna ichisi na mna ichisi totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">na tsipingu tsawo katsibenabena.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Waleke wamlongele IMNDEWA mighede, kwa uluso wake mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">na kwa ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghayawatendele iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Kwaapfila yeye koghabomola na koghapfughula ghamalango gha shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">na koghabebena ghamakufuli gha ichuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Iwanu wamwenga wawa wabotsi kwaapfila tsawatenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">waghaya kwaapfila tsawatenda ighehile.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Wapfihila ipfijo pfose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">wakala chidogho wafe.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Hawang'ali woghaya wamlilila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">naye kawakombola na ghamaghayo ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Kwa lilonga lyake, kawahonetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">naye kawatenda waleke ukukomighwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Leka wamlongele IMNDEWA mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">kwa uluso wake mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">na kwa ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghayawatendele iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Wamlapfile tsinambiko tsa mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">waghalonge ghamatendo ghake kwa ukwimba wila wa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Awala iwaghendile kwa tsimeli mna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">na awala iwatendile tsisang'ano mna ghamatsi mengi,<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />awo watsona tsisang'ano tsa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">na ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa kuna ghamatsi ighaghendese.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Yeye kalaghitsa, na baho inyahemu iduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">katenda ghamawimbi ghahefuke mna ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Wenuka kuchanya kulanga, kuya woya hasi ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">kwa alino lihile ililawile iwanu iwali mna tsimeli watenyuka ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Watsenzeuka na waghudema kulonga iwanu iwapatike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ukumanya kwawo kwose kumala.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Nawo hawang'ali woghaya, wamlilila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">naye kawakombola kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Kaitenda inyahemu inyamale tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">na ghamawimbi gha ibahali ghenyamala tulu.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Baho ghamawimbi haghanyamale wadeng'elelela ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">naye kawalongotsa mbaka kuna ibandali yawabamile ukughenda.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Leka wamlongele IMNDEWA mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">kwa uluso wake mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">na kwa ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghayawatendele iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Na wamwinule yeye mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">na wamtunye mna libalatsa lya iwanzehe.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Yeye kaighalusa imito iwa nyika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">na tsimbwibwi tsa ghamatsi tsiwa dongo lisakale.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Isi ikweleka ghamatunda iwa isi ya mkele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwaapfila iwanu iwang'ali wokala amwo tsawatenda ghehile.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Yeye katenda inyika iwa matsimbu gha ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">na isi isakale iwa mbwibwi tsa ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />na kawatenda iwanu wana inzala wakale aho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">nawo wetengenetsela mji ghwa ukukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Walima imighunda, na wahanda iminzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">nayo yeleka ghamatunda ketseketse.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Naye kawabariki wongetseka ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">na imifugho yawo ighendelela ukongetseka.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Kuya wahunguka wawa chidogho, na wawa nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">kwaapfila tsawaonelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">tsawadununzighwa na waghelighwa usungu,<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Kawatenda wahumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">na kawatenda wangewange mna inyika ilihela nzila.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Lekeni iwanu iwali hela chinu kawenula kawalapfa mna ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">na katsongetsa tsikaye tsawo ka mipfugho.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Iwanu wana imimoyo inoghile watsoghona aghano nawo watsodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">na iwanu wose wehile watsodiwa imilomo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Imunu iya ihekima yaghapfikitse aghano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">lekani iwanu wapfikitse uluso mkulu wa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukingighwe na maaduwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Ghwe Imulungu, ghumoyo ghwangu ghwa ghoya ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">nitsakwimba, nitsokutunya ghweghwe yauli utunitso wangu.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Lamka, ghwe chinanda na ichinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">na nene nitsoilamsa nemitondo tondo.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Nitsokulongela mighede Ghwe MNDEWA mghati mwa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">nitsokutunya ghweghwe kuna iwanu wa tsiisi,<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Uluso wako mkulu wopfika mbaka kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">na ukutogholeka kwako kopfika mbaka kuna libingu.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Winulighwe ako kuchanya kulanga, Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">na utunitso wako wenele muisi yose,<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />utukombole kwa ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo, na utwapfile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">ili iwanu wako yuwakunda wakombolighwe.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Imulungu kalonga kulawa hanu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">“Nitsoighola Shekemu kwa ukuhuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">na nitsolinga ichiwala cha Sukoti.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Isi ya Gileadi ya kwangu, na isi ya Manase pfipfila ya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">na isi ya Efuraimu yiyo ikofia yangu ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">na isi ya Yuda yiyo ing'weku yangu ya ukutawala.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Isi ya Moabu yiyo inongo yangu ya ukunawila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">nitsakwasa imikwabatsa yangu mna isi ya Edomu, iwe chitango ka yangu nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">na nene nitsokemelela ka niihuma isi ya Ufilisti.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Angu nani yatsonighala mbaka kuna ghumji ghutsungulusighwe ubanda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Nani yatsonighala mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Pfihi si ghweghwe baye, Imulungu yutwasile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Na sambi ng'ughenda hamwe baye na maasikali wetu baye,<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Utse utwapfile tuwatowe maaduwim tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">kwaapfila ukwapfilighwa na imunu si chinu baye.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Tung'awa hamwe na Imulungu tutsotenda makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">naye katsowabajugha maaduwi tsetu.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s">Ukulonganika kwa imunu iyoghaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Ghwe Imulungu yanikutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">uleke kwinyamala tulu ghendo,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />kwaapfila imunu yehile na imunu iyobugha wanyasamila imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">na wonilonga tsimbuli tsa ughutsu,<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Wonitsunguluka aku wonilonga pfihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">nawo wetowa hela na nene.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Hata ka tsaniwakunda wawo wonitendela maghomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">na nene nowalombela,<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Nene tsanimtendela ighanoghile, lekeni yeye koniliha ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">nene tsanimkunda lekeni yeye konyihila.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Apfo mlaghitse munu yehile yampinge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">na munu iyana lighomba naye yeme kuna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />hayohighighwa yoneke katotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">na achila chayalombile choneke nzambi.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Ghamatsuwa ghake ghahunguke ghawe chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">na ulongotsi wake usolighwe na munu yungi.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Iwanaghe wawe wachuwa, na imwehe wake yawe chitsuka.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Iwanaghe wangewange akuno wolombalomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">kutali ghendo na ghamahame ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Imunu iyomdai yasole ipfinu pfose pfayali napfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">na iwagheni wamboke tsimali tsake.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Kuleke kuwa na munu wa kumtendela ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">wala munu wa kuwonela libatsi iwanaghe iyawalekile wachuwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Lweleko lwake luhupe ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">na litaghwa lyawo libaghusighwe mna ilweleko ilukutsa.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />IMNDEWA yaghakumbuke ighehile ghawatendile iwahenga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">na inzambi ya mamo wake ileke kuleghusighwa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Tsinzambi tsawo tsighendelele kuwa hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">nawo wasemwighwe ghendo muisi,<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />kwa apfila ng'akumbuke ukutenda ighanoghile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">naye kawadununza mbaka wafa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">iwahingwa, iwalihela chinu na iwaghanzike ghumoyo.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Yeye tsakakunda ukuwalighita iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">nagho ghamalighito ghampata yeye mwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">ng'awabaliki iwanu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">na yeye mwenyegho ng'abalikighwe baye.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Kuna yeye ukulighita, kuwa ka apfila ukupfala lighwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">leka ghamalighito ghampfulumse kama matsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">na ghamwingile mghati ka apfila ghamapfuta pfaghakwingila mna imipate.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Na ghamalighito agho ghawe kama ligwanda lyayopfala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">ghawe ka msipi ghwayopfala mchuno.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />IMNDEWA yawalihe agho awala iwonighalila ghamaghomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">na awala iwonilonga pfihile.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Lekeni Ghwe MNDEWA, Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">unitendele ighanoghile ili litaghwa lyako litunyighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">unikombole kwaapfila uluso wako unogha!<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Nene namhingwa, na nahela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">na nilaghika mbaka mghati mwa ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Nohupa kulonga ichimbeho cha nemihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">nighulusisighwa kama apfila iwanzighe.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Ghamagoti ghangu ghaleghela kwa ajili ya ukufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">nene nisoka na ikalile mipate na ingotsi iliyeka.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Mbaka nene niwa chihulo kuna wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">hawombona wohighisa ghamatwi ghawo.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Lelo nyapfile Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">unikombole kwa ukulola uluso wako pfauli.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Walanguse wamanye ka aino sang'ano ya ghumoko ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">ghweghwe ghwe MNDEWA, yuyo yughatendile aghano.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Wawo wodaha ukulighita, lekeni ghweghwe kobariki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">wawo wenuka na waghelighwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">lekeni nene imtumghwa wako nitsodeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Waleke wanighalile maghomba wone ichinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">na ichinyala chawo chiwaghubike ka ghwanda.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Nene nitsomlongela IMNDEWA mighede kwa ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">na nitsomtunya kuna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wengi,<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />kwa apfila yeye kakwima kuna ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwa iyalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">yamkombole kulawa kwa awala iwomhigha.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA na mfalume wake iyamsaghule</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela mkulu wangu mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Kala ubali wangu wa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">mbaka niwatende awala iwokwihila wawe chinu cha ukwikila ghamaghulu ghako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />IMNDEWA katsoigholosa ing'weku yako ya tsingupfu kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">naghwe kutsowatawala maaduwi tsako.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Iwanu wako watsokutsila kwa ukubama iwenyegho hawitsetowa na maaduwi tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">aku wela na wanogha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">tsingupfu tsa usongolo wako tsitsakongetseka ka litungwe lya lupfilipfili.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />IMNDEWA kelaha, naye ng'odaha kughalambuka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">kalonga, “Ghweghwe kwamtambika kwa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa kama apfila pfayakalile Melikisedeki.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />IMNDEWA kakumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">kowakoma wafalume mna litsuwa lyake lya ukughudubuka.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Yeye kolamla iwanu iwokala mna tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">kotsimemetsa tsing'uli tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">kowahondahonda ipfilongotsi wa iwanu iwali mna isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Katsakunwa ghamatsi gha ichikolongo ichili mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">apfo katsakwinula litwi lyake kwa ukuhuma.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA kotunyighwa kwa ghamatendo ghake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />IMNDEWA yatunyighwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Nitsolonga mighede kwa IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">mna libalatsa na mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwompfuka Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Ghayotenda IMNDEWA makulu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">wose iwoghadeng'elela woghapfikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Isang'ano yake imema iheshima na ifahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">na ihaki yake yokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Kaghatenda ghamatendo ghake gha ukukangawatsa ghakumbukighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">IMNDEWA kamema uluso na libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Yeye koweng'a ichijo awala iwompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">na kolikumbuka lilaghano lyake matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Kawalangusa iwanu wake uwetso wa tsisang'ano tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">ahala hayaweng'ile isi tsa wanu wangi.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ghose ghayotenda kwa ghamoko ghake gholongesa na gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">ghamalaghitso ghake ghose gha ukutogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Nagho ghema ghoya ghendo kwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">ghatendighwa kwa kutogholeka na kwa kugholoka.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Kawaghalila ukombotsi iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">kalaghitsa lilaghano lyake liwe lya matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">litaghwa lyake lyela na lya ukupfukighwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA ghugho ghumwanduso ghwa ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">wose iwokinda ghamalaghitso ghake wakengela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">utunitso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s">Indeng'elo ya imunu iyanoghile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />IMNDEWA yatunyighwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Kabweda imunu ayula iyompfuka IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">ayula iyoghadeng'elela ng'ani ghamalaghitso ghake.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Iwanaghe watsakuwa na ngupfu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">ilweleko lwose lwa iwanu iwompfa Imulungu lutsobweda.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Mkaye mwa imunu iyali apfo mtsakuwa na utajiri na mali nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">na ihaki yake itsokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Ghumwanga ghowalangatsila mchisi awala wana imimoyo inoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">iwaluso, wana libatsi, na wana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Katsobweda imunu ayula iyowatsima iwanu kwa uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">iyotenda ipfinu pfake kwa ihaki,<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />kwaapfila ng'atsohighisika ghendo baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">Imunu yana ihaki katsokumbukighwa matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Ng'atsopfuka baye hayohulika mbuli tsihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">ghumoyo ghwake ghugangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">na ghomlolela IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Kagangamala ghendo mmoyo, wala ng'atsopfuka chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">mbaka yawone maaduwi tsake wotowighwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Yeye kowagholela ipfinu iwanu iwahingwa kwa uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">ihaki yake yokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">naye katsotunyighwa ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Imunu yehile katsoghona agho na katsoghudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">katsoghegheda ghamatsino ghake na kuhupa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">ukulolela kwa iwanu wehile kutsakwagha ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s">Ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />IMNDEWA yatunyighwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">mwemwe watumighwa wa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">litunyeni litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Leka litaghwa lya IMNDEWA libalikighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">kulawa sambi mbaka matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Kulawa kwalilawila litsuwa mbaka kwalikuswela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">litaghwa lya IMNDEWA litunyighwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />IMNDEWA kenulighwa mchanya mwa tsiisi tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">utunitso wake wakuchanya ghendo kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Angu nani iyali ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">iyokala kuchanya ng'ani kulanga,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />iyenama yalole mlanga na muisi?<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Komwinula imhingwa kulawa mna litimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">komwinusa imunu yang'ana chinu kulawa mna lipfu,<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />yamwike yakale hamwe na iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">hamwe na iwakulu wa iwanu wake.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Komtenda ipinga iyali mghumba yone ng'apfu mkaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">komdeng'elesa kwa kumwing'a iwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">IMNDEWA yatunyighwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s">Ghamatendo gha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">iwanu wa Yakobo hawalawile kuna iwanu iwolonga ilugha ingi,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />isi ya Yuda tsaiwa hanu helile ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Isiraeli tsaikala isi yake.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Ibahali yona nayo itsuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">ghamatsi gha ghumto Yoridani ghema ukupfosa, ghabwela kuchughu.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Ipfidunda pfidaluka daluka ka ng'unzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">ipfidunda pfidodo pfidaluka daluka kulonga wana wa ng'olo.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Ghwe ibahali, tsaiwiletsa mbaka utsume?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Ghwe ghumto Yoridani, tsaiwiletsa mbaka ghamatsi gheme ukupfosa, ghabwele kuchughu?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Namwe ipfidunda, heule tsamdaluke daluke ka ng'unzu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Namwe ipfidunda pfidodo, heule tsamdaluke daluke ka wana wa ng'olo?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Ghwe isi, udedeme hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">dedema hambele ha Imulungu wa Yakobo,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />iyatendile libambalawe liwe tsimbu lya ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">na libambalawe likomu liwe mbwibwi ya ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yumwe wa kweli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Si twetwe baye, Ghwe IMNDEWA, si twetwe baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">lekeni litaghwa lyako liliyeka litunyighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kwa ajili ya uluso wa lilaghano lyako na ukutogholeka kwako.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Heule iwanu wa isi tsingi watse walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Imulungu wawo yali kwani?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Imulungu wetu twetwe kakulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">yeye kotenda chochose chayobama ukutenda.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Lekeni milungu yawo pfipfo ipfinyagho pfa fetsa na nzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">ifinighwe kwa ghamoko gha iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Pfina milomo, lekeni ng'apfilonga baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">pfina nenge, lekeni ng'apfikona baye,<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />pfina maghutwi, lekeni ng'apfihulika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">pfina mula lekeni ng'apfinusa baye,<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />pfina ghamoko lekeni ng'apfibamasa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">pfina maghulu, lekeni ng'apfighenda baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">wana mimelo lekeni ng'aikoloma baye.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Wose iwofina ipfinyagho apfo watseghala napfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">pfipfila awala wose iwopfilolela watsakuwa ka ipfinyagho apfo.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Mwemwe muwanu wa Isiraeli mloleleni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">yeye yuyo iyatsowapfila na kuwakinga.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Mwemwe muwanu wa ing'anda ya Haruni, mloleleni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">yeye yuyo iyatsowapfila na kuwakinga.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Mwemwe imumpfuka IMNDEWA, mloleleni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">yeye yuyo iyatsowapfila na iyatsowakinga.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />IMNDEWA katukumbuka naye katsotubaliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">yeye katsowabaliki iwanu wa ing'anda ya Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">pfipfila katsowabaliki iwanu wa ing'anda ya Haruni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />IMNDEWA katsowabaliki iwanu wose iwompfuka yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">katsowabaliki iwakulu na iwadodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />IMNDEWA yawongetse muwe wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">muwe wengi mwemwe na iwatsukulu wenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Mbalikighwe na IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">yeye iyaumbile kulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Kulanga kwakwake yeye IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">lekeni isi kaweng'a iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Iwanu iwafile ng'awaodaha baye kumtunya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">wala awala iwohuhulumka kughenda hanu ihenyamale,<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Lekeni twetwe ituli wagima tutsomtunya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">sambi na matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. IMNDEWA yatunyighwe!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s">Mighede kwa ukukombolighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Nomkunda IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kwaapfila yeye kanihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kahulika litsi lyangu na ukulomba kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Kwaapfila lighutwi lyake lyonitegheletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">nitsomlomba matsuwa ghose ghanikala mgima.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Mitsabi ya lifwa iniboteletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">na usungu wa kutsimu unitsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">ukughaya na ukughanzika kunitsila.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Kuya nilikema litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Ghwe IMNDEWA, nikombole.”<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />IMNDEWA kamluso na kana haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Imulungu wetu kamema libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />IMNDEWA kowakinga iwanu iwali nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">hanighanzike, yeye kanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Leka nilongele nimwenyegho, “Uya hanu hako ha ukubwihila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwaapfila IMNDEWA kakutendela uluso.”<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Mana ghweghwe IMNDEWA, kuukombola ugima wangu na lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">tsinenge tsangu na ghamasotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">na kughutenda ghumghulu ghwangu ghuleke ukwikwala.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Na nene nitsakwanga hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">kuna tsiisi tsa iwanu iwali wagima.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Ng'endelela ukutoghola mbaka ahala hanilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">“Namna ghamaghayo!”<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Na haning'ali mna ghamaghayo nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Chila munu mghutsu.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Angu nitsomuyitsila choni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwa uluso wake wose iyanitendele?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Nitsakwinula ichikombe cha ukombotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">na kulikemelela litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Nitsoliha tsinatsili tsanilahile kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">hambele ha iwanu wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Ukufa kwa iwanu wana ihaki chinu chikulu ghendo hambele ha IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Nokulomba ghweghwe, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">kwaapfila nene na mtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">mtumighwa wako iyali mwana wa mtumighwa wako pinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">ghweghwe kunidohola tsipingu tsangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Nitsokulapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">na kulikema litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Nitsoliha tsinatsili tsanilahile kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">hambele ha iwanu wake wose,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />kuna ipfibwalu pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">mghati mwako, Ghwe Yerusalemu. Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s">Ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Mwemwe tsiisi tsose, mtunyeni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">mwemwe muwanu wose mmwinule yeye.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Mana uluso wake kuna twetwe mkulu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">na ukutogholeka kwa IMNDEWA kokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">IMNDEWA yatunyighwe!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s">Mighede kwa ukuhuma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Mwing'eni mighede IMNDEWA, kwaapfila yeye kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">mana uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Isiraeli nawalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“Uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Iwanu wa ing'anda ya Haruni nawo walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“Uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Na wose iwompfuka IMNDEWA nawo walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Haning'ali namna ghamaghayo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">nene nimkema IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">naye kanyidika na kanyika hanu henelele.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />IMNDEWA kaubali wangu nene, sitsopfuka chinu baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">Angu imunu yatsodaha kunitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />IMNDEWA kaubali wangu, yeye yuyo iyonyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">apfo nitsakona awala iwonyihila pfawatsotohighwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Ng'apfu kutsumila kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">kubita kuwalolela iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Ng'apfu kutsumila kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">kubita kuwalolela iwakulu.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Iwanu wa isi tsose tsawanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">lekeni kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA niwadumlila kutali.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Ona tsawanitsunguluka, wanitsunguluka chila ubali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">lekeni kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA niwadumlila kutali.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Wanitsunguluka kulonga nzukwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">lekeni watsimika ka moto ghwa mihonga pfaghutsimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA niwadumlila kutali.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Tsakunikunughitsa ghendo nighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">lekeni IMNDEWA kanyapfila.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />IMNDEWA yuyo tsingupfu tsangu na ukuhuma kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">na yeye yuyo iyonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Litsi lya ukudeng'elela ukuhuma lyohulikika mna lihema lya iwanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwa IMNDEWA ghotenda makulu.<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Ghumoko ghwa kulume ghwa IMNDEWA ghwinulighwa kuchanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">ghumoko ghwa kulume ghwa IMNDEWA ghwotenda makulu.<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Sitsakufa baye, lekeni nitsakuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">na nitsowapetela iwanu aghala ghayatendile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />IMNDEWA kaniatsibu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">lekeni ng'andekile nife baye.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Nipfughulileni ghamalango gha ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">ningile amwo nilonge mighede kwa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Alino lango lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wanu wana ihaki watsakwingila.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Nolonga mighede ghwe Imulungu kwaapfila kunyinidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">kwaapfila ghweghwe yuyo yunikombola,<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Libwe lyawalemile iwotsenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">sambi liwa libwe kulu lya ghumsingi.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyatendile alino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">nalyo lyokangawatsa mna tsinenge tsetu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Tsuwa lyino lyilo lyayatendile IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">apfo tudeng'elele na tutsekelele.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Tokudedetsa, ghwe IMNDEWA utukombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">tokudedetsa, ghwe IMNDEWA ututende tubwede.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Kabweda ghendo ayula iyakutsa kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Twokubaliki kulawa kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Yeye IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">yeye katumwemwesela ghumwanga gwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">muyohe inambiko ya ichihungo kwa imitsabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">kuna tsimembe tsa imatsabahu.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Ghwegwe kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">na nene nitsolonga mighede kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">nitsokutunya ghwe Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Longeni mighede kwa IMNDEWA, kwaapfila yeye kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Wabweda iwanu iwokala aku wahela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">awala iwokinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Wabweda ghendo awala wose iwokinda imiko yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">awala wose iwombama kwa mimoyo yawo yose,<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />awala ing'awotenda ghendo ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">wawo wakwanga ghendo mna tsinzila tsa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Ghweghwe kutughalila ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">na tuye tobamighwa tughakinde kwa ukwalangitsa.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Nzila tsangu tsing'awile tsinogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">nighakinde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Ning'aghalangula ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">sitsakuwa na chinyala baye.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Nitsokutunya kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">ahala hanifunda nimwenyegho ghamalaghitso ghako ghana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Nene nitsokinda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">uleke kundeka ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Angu imsongolo yodahatse kutsika tsinzila tsake tsele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Ng'ambe kwa ukukinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Nokubama kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">uleke kundeka nyange kutali nighaleke ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Nigheka ghamalaghitso ghako mmoyo mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">hela ndeke kukutendela inzambi.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Ubalikiighwe ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">unifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Kwa milomo yangu nitsakuyila kulonga kwa ukukemelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">ighalawile mna ghumlomo ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Nene nitsodeng'elela ukuwinza ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">ka apfila imunu iyodeng'elela hayakuwa na tsimali nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Notongelela ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">na notsalangitsa tsinzila tsako.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Noideng'elela imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">sighasemwa baye ghamalonga ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukudeng'elela ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Unitendele ghanoghile nene imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">niwe mgima na nighakinde ghamalonga ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Utsifumbule tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">mbone pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa ipfili mna ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Nene na mgheni mna isi aino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">uleke kughapfisa ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghotama kwa ukulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">ghobama ghumanye ghamalaghitso ghako matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Ghweghwe kowamanila wose wana ichidandali, awala iwalighitighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">na awala ing'awokinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />ghamaligho ghao na ukubetsa kwawo kukale kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwaapfila noghakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Hata ka iwakulu wetingana hamwe na wonyikila tsengwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">nene mtumighwa wako noghatongelela ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Ghamalaghitso ghako ghonitenda nene nideng'elele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">nagho ghonilongotsa cha ukutenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Nebulughitsa hasi mtimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">ungaye keli ugima wangu ka apfila pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Tsanikulongela nzila tsangu pfatsili, naghwe tsakunyinidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">lelo nifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Unifunde apfila ghamalaghitso ghako pfaghali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">na nene nitongelele ng'onde tsako tsa ukukangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghwipfa ukwona usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">unyongetse tsingupfu ka apfila pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Nyike kutali na nzila tsa ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">unifunde ghamalaghtso ghako kwa uluso.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Nene nisaghula inzila ilongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">nighwika ghumoyo ghwangu mna ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nene nighananahila ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">uleke kundeka niumbuke.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Noitsumila inzila yako ina ghamalaghitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwaapfila ghweghwe kunyongetsa tsimbutsi tsa ukumanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba umanye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Ghwe IMNDEWA nifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">na nene nitsoghakinda mbaka ghamatsuwa haghatsomala.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Unyapfile nimanye ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">na nighakinde kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Unilongotse mna inzila ya ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwaapfila amwo nene nodeng'elelela.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Ughutende ghumoyo ghwangu ghukinde ghamalamtsi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">ndeke ukusulukila kuwa na tsimali.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Utsighome tsinenge tsangu tsileke kulola pfinu pfa ubotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">unyike nikale mgima mna tsinzila tsako.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Unitendele nene mtumighwa wako aghala ghaulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">ili ghweghwe upfukighwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Chike kutali ichinyala chanipfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwaapfila ghamalaghitso ghako ghanogha.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Lola apfila pfanibama ghendo ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">utende ugima wangu uwe wa sambi kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, uluso wako ing'aumalagha baye unitsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">unikombole ka apfila pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Baho nitsomwidika wowose iyondigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwaapfila nene notoghola ghamalonga ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Unende nene nongeghe ukulongesa kuliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwapfila nene nyika lolelo lyangu mna ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Nene nitsoghakinda malaghitso ghako matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">Ona, nitsokinda ghendo matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Nani nitsakwanga ka imunu iyadoholighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwa apfila nifunditsa ghamalaghitso ghako,<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />na nitsoghalonga malaghitso ghako hambele ha iwafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">wala sitsakwona chinyala baye.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Nitsodeng'elela ng'ani mna ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">agho nene noghakunda.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Na ghamoko ghangu nitsoghenulila ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">na nene nitsotongelela malaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwihuwila malaghitso gha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Ukumbuke achila chaumlongele imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kwaapfila kunitenda nene nihuwile acho chaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Acho chicho ichinikanza mna ghamaghayo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">kwaapfila acho chaulongile chongaya ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Wana ichidandali wanibetsa ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">lekeni nene sighalekile laghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Ning'aghakumbuka ghamalamtsi ghako gha ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">Ghwe MNDEWA, ghonikanza.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Nene noghudubuka ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">hanikona iwanu iwehile woleka ukukinda malaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Nene nakwimba wila wa malaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">chila hanu hanighenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Hachilo nilikumbuka litaghwa lyako, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">na nighakinda malaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Alino lilyo lyanitendagha, kwaapfila nighakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukinda imiko ya IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />IMNDEWA yuyo imali yangu nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">nani nilonga nitsoghakinda malonga ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Niubama uhanga wako kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">unitendele uluso ka pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Nipfikitsa tsinzila tsangu pfatsili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">na nighalongotsa ghamaghulu ghangu mna ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Nisumka wala sikawile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Hata ka iwanu iwehile tsawanyoha imitsabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">lekeni nene sighasemwile baye ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Chilo ghati ghendo nolamka nikulongele mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">kwaapfila malamtsi ghako gha haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Nene na sale yawo kwa awala wose iwokupfuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">na awala wose iwokinda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Isi imema uluso wako mkulu, Ghwe MNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">lelo unifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu pfaghanoghile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Kumtendela ighanoghile nene imtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">ka pfaulongile ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Unifunde niwe na tsimbutsi tsa ukulamla ghoya na ukumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">kwaapfila nene nehuwila ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Hanikalile sina nighanzike baye tsaning'ali nitotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">lekeni sambi nolikinda lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Ghweghwe kunogha na kotenda ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">nifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Wana ichidandali wanighutsukila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">lekeni nene noghakinda ghamalamtsi ghako kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Imimoyo yawo ifa taletale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">lekeni nene noghadeng'elela malaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Tsa pfinogha apfila nene nighanzike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">ili nifunde malaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Ghamalaghitso ghalawile mna ghumlomo ghwako nene ghanoghela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">kubita maelufu gha inzahabu na ifetsa.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA ghoghala ihaki</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Ghamoko ghako ghaniumba na ghanyika apfino pfanili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">ungaye tsimbutsi ili nifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Awala iwokupfuka hawombona wadeng'elele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">kwaapfila nene nihuwila lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Nimanya, Ghwe MNDEWA, kuwa ghamalamtsi ghako gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">na kwa ukutogholeka kwako kunidununza.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Lelo nokulomba, uluso wako mkulu unikanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">ka pfaunongele nene imtumighwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Leka libatsi lyako linitsile, ili niwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwaapfila nene noghadeng'elela maghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Leka wana ichidandali wone chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">kwaapfila wanitendela ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">ila nene nitsotongelela ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Waleke iwokupfuka wambuyile, nawo watsomanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">hamwe na awala iwoumaya ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Nobama ghumoyo ghwangu ghuleke kutotsa mna ghamalamtsi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">ili nene ndeke kughelighwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukombolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Nene notsilika kwa kuubama ukombotsi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">na nololela mna lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Tsinenge tsangu tsipfonda kwa ukulolela achila chaunongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">noghutsa “Ukutsa tsuwachi unikanze?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Kwaapfila niwa kama chikoba cha ngotsi ichipfondile ichilebela mchanya mwa liyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">lekeni ghamalaghitso ghako sighasemwile baye.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Nene imtumighwa wako nitsokubeta mbaka tsuwachii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Awala iwonidununza utsowahigha tsuwachi?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Wana ichidandali wanihimbila ghamapondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">iwanu awala ing'awowinza malamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Malaghitso ghako ghose ghotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">utse unyapfile kwaapfila iwanu wonidununza hela.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Chidogho ghendo wanikome muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">lekeni nene sighalekile baye ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Kwa uluso wako unyike niwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">na nene nitsokinda ghamalamtsi ghaulongile kwa ghumlomo ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Ghwe MNDEWA lilonga lyako lyokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">na likighwa ghoya ako kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Ukutogholeka kwako kokala lweleko mbaka lweleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">ghweghwe kuika isi hanu hake, na baho ima ghoya ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Kwa ghamalamtsi ghako ipfinu apfo pfabaho mbaka leloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwaapfila ipfinu pfose pfokutumikila ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Ka nene tsasighadeng'ele baye ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">nene ning'ahupile ghendo mna ghamaghayo ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Nene sitsoghasemwa ghendo ghamalaghitso ghako matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwaapfila kwa agho kunitenda nikale mgima.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Nene na wakwako, unikombole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwaapfila tsanighakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Iwanu wehile wobetetsa wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">lekeni nene notongelela ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Chila chinu ichenele chitsotsigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">lekeni ghamalaghitso ghako ng'aghatsotsigha baye.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukunda malaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Lola, pfanighakunda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">nene noghapfikitsa misi ngima.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Ghamalaghitso ghako ghonitenda niwe na ihekima kubita maaduwi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">kwaapfila ninagho matsuwa ghose,<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Nene nina mbutsi kubita awala iwanifundile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwaapfila noghafikitsa ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Nene nina mbutsi kubita iwanzehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwaapfila niikinda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Nighaghoma ghamaghulu ghangu ghaleke kwanga mna tsinzila tsihile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">ili nidahe kukinda lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Nene sighalekile baye ghose ghaunifundile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwaapfila ghweghwe ghumwenyegho yuyo yunifundile,<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Ghamalonga ghako ghamta sideke kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">ghamta kubita uki mna ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Imiko yako yongaya nene itsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">apfo chila nzila ihile nene nohihila.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumwanga kulawa kuna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Longa lyako lya tala ilinilongotsa ghamaghulu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">na lya ghumwanga kuna inzila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Nilaha na nilighitsa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">ka nitsoghakinda malamtsi ghako ighali gha haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Nene tsanighaya ng'ani, ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">umbuyitsile ugima wangu ka lilonga lyako pfalilonga.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Ghwe IMNDEWA utoghole apfila pfanikutunya kwa ukubama nimwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">na unifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Ugima wangu noukindilitsa mna ghumoko ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">lekeni sitsoghasemwa baye ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Iwehile tsawaniteghela nyonzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">lekeni silekile baye kuikinda imiko yako,<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Ghamalaghitso ghako ghamali yangu ya ghamatsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">agho ghaghutenda ghumoyo ghwangu ghudeng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghobama ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako mna ghamatsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mna malaghitso gha IMNDEWA mna ugima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Nowehila iwanu wala iwali ndumila kuwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">lekeni nene noneghelwa na ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Ghweghwe kwa hanu hanitsumilila na kwa ngawo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">nene nehuwila lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Mke hana nene mwemwe iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">ili nidahe kughakinda ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Nigangamitse ka apfila pfaulongile, nene nikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">uleke kundeka nihumbuke mna lila lyanihuwila.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Nikindilise na nene nitsakuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">na nene nitsoghendelela kughategheletsa ghamalaghitso ghako<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Kowalema wose iwokala kutali na ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">kwaapfila ghehile ghawopfikatsa gha hela.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Kowona iwanu wehila ka apfila mibangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">apfo nene nonoghelwa na ghamalamutsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Lukuli lwangu lyodedema kwa ukupfuka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">Ghamalamutsi ghako ghonenda ningilwe na wogha.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukughakinda ghamalghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Nitenda ighali ghahaki na ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">apfo uleke kuwaleka iwali na ichidandali wanidununze.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />wike laghano lya ukunitendela nene ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">na uleke kuwaleka iwali na ichidandali wanidununze.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Nenge tsangu tsipfa kukubeta ghweghwe unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">nokubeta utende achila chaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Unitendele nene imtumighwa wako kwa kulola uluso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">na unifunde ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Nene na mtumighwa wako, apfo ungaye tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">nidahe kughamanya ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, matsuwa gha ukutenda chinu ghapfika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwaapfila iwanu waleka kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Kwaapfila nene noneghelwa na ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">kubita inzahabu, ona kubita inzahabu iyelile ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />kwaapfila noyona imiko yako yose inogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">na chila nzila ihile nene nohihila.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubama ukukinda malaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Imiko yako yokangawatsa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">apfo nitsoikinda kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Ghamalonga ghako hagholongighwa mwatsi, ghoghala ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">na ghoweng'a tsimbusi iwanu ing'awomanya chinu.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Nyasama ghumlomo ghwangu aku nina batsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">kwaapfila nene nighabama ng'ani ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Uhunduke na umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">ka apfila pfauwatendela awala iwokunoghela.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Utsilongotse ghamaghulu ghangu ka pfaulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">uleke kughaleka ghehile ghanongotse.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Unikombole ndeke ukudununzighwa na iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">ili nidahe kuikinda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Unimwemwesela nene imtumighwa wako ghumwanga ghwa ichihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">unifunde imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Nenge tsangu tsolawa masotsi ka chikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwaapfila iwanu walema ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihaki ya malaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ghweghwe kotenda ighali ghahaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">na malamtsi ghako gha ghoya.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />imiko yautwing'ile inogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">na yolongesa ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Nene nodeseka sideke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">kwaapfila maaduwi tsangu woghabetsa ghaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Ghamalaghano ghako ghose ghotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">na nene mtumighwa wako nonoghelwa nagho.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Nene na mdodo na nobetsighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">lekeni nene siisemwa baye imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Ghweghwe kwa wahaki na kutsotenda ighali ghahaki matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">na malaghitso ghako gholongesa.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Ukughaya na usungu tsapfinitsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">lekeni ghamalaghitso ghanenda nene nideng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Ghamalamtsi ghako gha haki ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">ungaye tsimbutsi nidahe kukala mgima.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukombolighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nokulilila kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">unyidike ghwe IMNDEWA, niwinze ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Nokukema unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">na nene nitsokinda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Nolamka lupfilipfili na nokulilila unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">nene nehuwila ghamalonga ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Nokala meso chilo chigima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">aku noghapfikitsa ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Kwa uluso wako ghwe IMNDEWA, unihulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">uwike ugima wangu kwa kulola ghamalamtsi ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Iwanu iwonitendela litsengwe wahabehi wakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">wawo wakutali ghendo na ghamalaghitso ghako,<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA, kwahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">naghamalaghitso ghako gholongesa.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Kulawa ghumwande nene nighamanya ghamalamtsi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">naghwe kugheka ghakale matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Lola ghamaghayo ghangu na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwaapfila sighasemwile baye ghamalaghisto ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Unyamile mna lighomba alino na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">ungaye ugima ka apfila pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Iwanu wehile ng'awokombolighwa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwaapfila ng'awowinza baye ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, libatsi lyako kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">ungaye ugima wangu ka pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Maaduwi iwonidununza wa wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">lekeni nene sihunduke baye ndeke imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Haniwona iwanu ing'awokutoghola baye nene nodeseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwaapfila ng'awohulikitsa baye lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Lola apfila pfaniinoghela imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">umbuyitsile ugima wangu kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna uluso mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Ghose ghaulonga gholengesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">ghamalaghitso ghako gha ihaki ghokala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Iwakulu wanidununza hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">lekeni ghumoyo ghwangu ghodedemekela lilonga lyako.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Nodeng'elela lilaghano lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">k apfila imunu pfyayodeng'elela hayoboka pfinu pfinoghile kung'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Nowihila ughutsu nawo wonidesa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">lekeni nene noghakunda ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Chila tsuwa nene nokutunya mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwaapfila ghamalaghitso ghako ghahaki.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Iwoghakunda ghamalaghitso wokala tseghamba ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">kuduhu chinu ichiwatenda wekwale.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nene nobetetsa unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">na ghamalaghitso ghako nene noghakinda.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Noikinda imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">kuya noikunda ng'ani.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Noikinda imiko yako na ghamalamtsi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">kwaapfila tsinzila tsangu tsose tsa hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Ghwe, IMNDEEWA chililo changu chipfike kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">ungaye tsimbutsi ka apfila pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Chanilomba chipfike kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">nikombole ka pfaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Milomo yangu itsokutunya ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwaapfila konifunda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Lulimi lwangu lustolimbila lilonga lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwaapfila ghamalaghitso ghako ghose ghahaki.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Ghumoko ghwako ghukaleghe ghoya ukunyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwaapfila nisaghula kughawinza ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Nokubetetsa ghweghwe unikombole, Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">ghamalaghitso ghako ghonenda nene nideng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Undeke nene nikale mgima nikutunyeghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">na ghamalaghitso ghako ghanyapfile.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Nyanga akuno na akuno ka ng'olo yaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">utse unibame nene mtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwaapfila nene sighasemwile baye ghamalaghitso ghako.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Mna ghamaghayo ghangu nimkema IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">naye kanyidika.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">kulawa kwa iwanu wana imilomo ya ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">na wana imilimi ya ung'enye.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Mwemwe yamna milomo ya ughutsu, imunu yatsowatendatse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">yatsowongetsela choni?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Ng'ambe katsokutowa kwa imishale ihoma ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">na ghamakala ighakwaka ghumoto ghwa mbiki ghwa Mretemu.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Wenye ghwe! Nene nitsochona, kwaapfila nokala ka namgheni akuno Mesheki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">nokala mgheni mna ghamahema gha Kedari.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Nene nikala matsuwa mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">hamwe na awala ing'awobama baye ukukala tseghamba.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Nene nobama tukale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">lekeni wawo wobama ing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo iyotukinga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Nakwinula tsinenge tsangu ndole kupfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">ukwapfilighwa kwangu kulawa kwani?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Ukwapfilighwa kwangu kolawa kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">Iyaumbile kulanga na isi,<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Yeye ng'atsoghuleka baye ghumghulu ghwako ghuteletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">yeye iyokukinga ng'atsodongila baye.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Ona ghendo, yeye iyokalitsa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">ng'atsodongila baye, wala ng'atsowasa baye.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyokukalitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">yeye kachimbeho ichili ubali wako wa kujilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Litsuwa ng'alitsokulakatsa baye nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">wala ghumwetsi kuchilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />IMNDEWA katsokukinga na ghehile ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">katsoukinga ugima wako.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />IMNDEWA katsokukinga haukwingila na haulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kulawa sambi na matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s">Ukughutunya ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Tsanideng'elela hawanilongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Tuke ukaye kwa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Gwe Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">ghamaghulu ghetu ghema hana ghamalango ghako,<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Yerusalemu ghumji ghutsengighwe ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">ka ghumji ghwikindile hamwe ghendo,<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />ghamakabila ghogheluka ghoghenda ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">ghamakabila gha IMNDEWA, ighali ukalangama kwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">woghenda kulonga mighede kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Kwaapfila ako pfikighwa ipfighoda pfa ufalume pfa ukuhighila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">ipfighoda pfa ufalume pfa ikaya ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Muilombele Yerusalemu ikale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">“Wabweda awala wose iwokukunda.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Mghati mwa imibanda yako mkale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">kuwe na ugima mghati mwa tsingome tsako.”<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Kwaajili ya ndughu tsangu na sale tsangu nitsolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">“Ukale tseghamba.”<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Na kwaajili ya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">nene nitsokulombela ighanoghile.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wonelighwe libatsi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Nakwinula tsinenge tsangu nikulole ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">ghweghwe yukala mna ichighoda cha ufalume ichili kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Ka apfila tsinenge tsa imtumwa pfatsilolela ghumoko ghwa imtwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">ka apfila tsinenge tsa imtumwa pinga pfatsilolela ghumoko ghwa imtwa wake pinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">apfo pfipfo pfapfili tsinenge tsetu pfatsimlolela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">mbaka yeye imwenyegho hayatsotwonela libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Utwonele libatsi, ghwe IMNDEWA, utwonele ghendo libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kwaapfila twipfa ghendo ukubetsighwa.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Twipfa ghendo ukubetsighwa na awala wana ichidandali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">twipfa ghendo ukutendighwa utalatsi na awala iweghoda.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yuyo iyotukinga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Ka IMNDEWA ng'akalile ubali wetu baye, tsaing'awiletsa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Lelo Waisiraeli mlonge.<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />Ka IMNDEWA ng'akalile ubali wetu baye tsaing'awiletsa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">Ahala maaduwi tsetu hawabamile kututowa?<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />Ng'ambe wang'atumetsile aku twawagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">ahala imaya yawo ng'ulu hayakile mchanya mwetu.<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />Baho ghamatsi ighamemile ghang'atukululuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">na tung'atsamile mna ilukolongo lwa ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />Baho ghang'atudutile ghendo, ighamatsi ighotsuma.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />IMNDEWA yatunighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">kwaapfila yeye ng'awalekile baye maaduwi watutowe.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Natwe tuhepa ka ichideghe mna inyonzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">ghumtegho ghonzolighwa natwe tukomboka.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />IMNDEWA yuyo iyotwapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">yuyo iyalumbile lilanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Imulungu pfawokingighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Awala iwomlolela IMNDEWA weghala na chidunda Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">ng'aghuhighisika baye, ghokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Ka pfidunda pfapfitsunguluka Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayowatsunguluka iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">kulawa sambi mbaka matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Kwaapfila anu wehile ng'awatsoghendelela baye kuitawala isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">hela wanu wanoghile watsogholosa ghamoko ghawo watende ghehile.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, watendele ghanoghile awala iwanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">awala wana imimoyo igholoke.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Lekeni awala iwotsihundukila nzila tsawo tsihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">IMNDEWA katsowawinga hamwe na awala iwotenda ghehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Isiraeli ikale tseghamba!<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wing'ighwe ngupfu ingi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />IMNDEWA hayatuyitse Sayuni, twetwe itughoghighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">twetwe tsatuwa ka iwanu iwolota.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Milomo yetu isekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">na milimi yetu ing'ali itowa lukenze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">na wanu wa isi tsingi walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“IMNDEWA kawatendela makulu!”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />IMNDEWA tsakatututendela makulu ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">natwe tudeng'elela sideke.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, utuyitsile iwanu wetu iwaghoghighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">ka ghamatsi gha imvula ighobita mna ipfikolongo pfa Kusini ipfinyalile.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Awala iwohanda kwa masotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">watsopfuna aku wodeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Ayula iyoghenda kuhanda imbeghu aku kolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">katsakuya aku kakwimba kwa ukudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">aku koduta ipfijo pfayapfunile.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s">Bila Imulungu sang'ano ya imunu si chinu baye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Ka IMNDEWA ng'oitsenga ing'anda baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">iwoitsenga wosang'ana ng'onde ya hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">ka IMNDEWA ng'oghukalitsa ghumji baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">iwoghukalitsa wowasa meso hela.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Mwotenda ng'onde ya hela mwemwe imwidawa lupfilipfili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na imkawa kughenda kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">imghanzika mpate cha ukuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">kwaapfila IMNDEWA koweng'a ghawobama awala iyowakunda hata ka wowasa.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Iwana wamale nzawadi ilawa kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">wawo wa ghweko ililawa kwa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Ka imishale mna ghamoko gha imunu yana ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">pfipfo pfawali iwana wamale wa imunu iyoweleka aku kamsongolo.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyali na mishale ili mingi apfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">ng'atsohumbuka baye hana lilango, hayatsetingana na aduwi tsake.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s">Ikaye impfuka IMNDEWA pfaitsoghwekighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Wabweda awala wose iwompfuka IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">awala iwokala kwa kuwinza tsinzila tsake.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Kutsakuja ghamatunda gha tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">kutsodeng'elela na kutsobweda.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Mwehe wako katsakuwa ka mnzabibu ighukweleka ghamatunda mna ing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">iwanagho watsakuwa ka pfipughuti pfa minzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">iwoitsunguluka imetsa yawo.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Lola, apfi pfipfo pfayatsobweda imunu ayula iyompfuka IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />IMNDEWA yakubaliki kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">mna ghamatsuwa ghako ghose ghaukala mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">na wone ghendo apfila Yerusalemu pfaibweda,<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />na ukale uwone iwatsukulu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Isiraeli ikale tseghamba.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s">Ukuwalombela ighehile maaduwi wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Nene na munu wa ukudununzika kulawa usongolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">chila munu mna Isiraeli yalonge.<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />Wang'aii wonidununzagha kulawa hanili msongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">lekeni ng'awadahile baye kuhuma.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Wandagha pfihile mna ghumghongo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">ka apfila iwanu pfawolima ghamatuta kumghunda.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Lekeni yeye IMNDEWA ka wahaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">kaidumla imitsabi iwanyohile iwanu awo wehile.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Wone chinyala na woye kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">awala wose iwoghuhila ghumji ghwa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Wawe ka mitsani ikota mchiswili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">inyala ng'ana ikule baye,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />na imunu iyoikana ng'omemesa baye hata ghumoko ghumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">na ng'aipfika baye hata kinza limwe imunu yang'aikunga.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Awala iwobita habehi na ghweghwe waleke kuwalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“IMNDEWA yawabaliki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Towabaliki kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Kulawa hasi ihaghendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">nene nokulilila ghweghwe, ghwe MNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, tegheletsa litsi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">uwambe ghamaghutwi ghako ghahulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">ghahukitse chililo changu ichighela libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Ka ghwe IMNDEWA ung'apetile ighehile ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">ghwe Imndewa, nani yang'adahile kwima?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Lekeni ghweghwe koleghusa tsinzambi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">ili twetwe tukupfukeghe ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Nene nombeta IMNDEWA, ghumoyo ghwangu ghobetetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">nene nehuwila longa lyake.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Nombeta IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kubita iwakalitsi pfawobeta kunze kulangale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kubita apfila iwakalitsi pfawobeta nemitondo kuche.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Ghwe Isiraeli, umlolele IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwaapfila kuna yeye kuna uluso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">na yeye kana ngupfu nyingi tsa kutukombola.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Yeye imwenyegho katsoikombola Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">kulawa mna ighehile ghake ghose.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba ukuleka chidandali</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghwahela chidandali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">tsinenge tsangu ng'atsighoda baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">nene sihila na pfinu pfikulu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">apfila ipfikomu ng'ani kuna nene.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Lekeni nene ninyamala na ghumoyo ghwangu ghukala tulu ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">ka apfila imwana iyeghutile ukong'a pfayokala tulu mna ghamoko gha mai wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">pfipfo ghumoyo ghwangu pfaghwinyamale tulu.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Ghwe Isiraeli, wihuwile IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">kulawa sambi na matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s">Kulitunya Lihekalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA mkumbuke Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">na ukumbuke maghayo ghose ghayapatile.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Ukumbuke ukwilighita kwayelighite, Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">lilaghano lyayekile kuna ghweghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">yeye iyana ingupfu ya Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />Sitsakwingila baye mghati mwa ing'anda yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">wala sitsoghenda baye kuna ilulili lwangu,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />sitsoleka baye nenge tsangu tsidongile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">wala tsikope tsangu tsisinzile,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />mbaka nimwing'e hanu ha ukukala IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">hanu hake Imulungu wa Yakobo yana ingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Ako Efurata tsatuhulika imbuli ya lisanduku lya lilaghano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">na tulipata mna imighunda ya Yearimu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Lelo tukeni kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">na tukename hana ichighoda chake cha ukwikila ghamaghulu.<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Winuke Ghwe IMNDEWA, hanu hako ha ukubwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">winuke hamwe na lisanduku lya tsingupfu tsako.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Iwatambika wako watende ighali ghahaki matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">na iwanu wako iwotogholeka wembe kwa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Ghweghwe yuyo yumsaghule Daudi mtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">apfo uleke kumlema.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />IMNDEWA tsakelaha hayekile laghano lya kulongesa na Daudi apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Nitsomwika mwanagho yumwe kulawa mna iwanagho ghumwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">yawe mfalume, hanu hako.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Ka iwanagho watsokinda lilaghano lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">na kukinda imiko yangu yanitsowafunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">na iwana wawo wamale pfipfila watsokala mna ichighoda chako matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Kwapfila IMNDEWA kasaghula Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">kabama hawe hanu hake ha ukukala.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />Ghweghwe tsakulonga, “Ahano hanu hangu hakubwihila matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">nene nitsokala hanu ahano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">kwaapfila nene nibama nikale ahano.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Nitsoweng'a iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Sayuni ghose ghawobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">nitsoweng'a ichijo chingi iwanu wahingwa waje weghute.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Na iwatambika wake watsotangika ka wakombolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">na iwanu wako iwotogholeka wembe kwa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Baho nitsotenda imembe ya Daudi ikule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">nayo itsakuwa tala kwa ayula yanimsaghula.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Aduwi tsake nitsowatenda wone chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">lekeni yeye nitsompfalitsa litaji ilimeletseka.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s">Pfakunoghile ukukala hamwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Lola, pfinogha na pfonoghela ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">iwandughu kukala hamwe na kuwa chinu chimwe.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ka ghamapfuta ighanoghile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">ighohulumka kulawa mna litwi lya Aruni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">mbaka mna ichidepfu chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">na mbaka mna lipindo lya ligwanda lyake.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ka tungwe lya chidunda cha Herimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">ililaghala kulawa mchanya mwa ipfidunda pfa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">kuko IMNDEWA keka laghano lya ukuwabaliki iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">ka katsoweng'a ugima wa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s">Lukemo lwa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Mtse mumtunye IMNDEWA mwemwe wose imli watumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">mwemwe imsang'ana nechilo mng'anda mwake.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Mwinule ghamoko ghenu hanu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">na baho mumtunye IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />IMNDEWA, iyaumbile kulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">yawabaliki kulawa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu yatunyighwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">litunyeni litaghwa lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">mtunyeni yeye, mwemwe iwatumighwa wake.<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />Mwemwe imsang'ana mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">na mna ipfibwalu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA kwaapfila yeye konogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">Mlimbile litaghwa lyake kwaapfila linogha.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamsaghula Yakobo yawe wake mwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">na kawasaghula Waisiraeli wawe wanu wake ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Kwaapfila nomanya ghendo ka IMNDEWA kamkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">naye kamkulu kubita imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />IMNDEWA kotenda chochose chayobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kotenda kulanga na muisi, mna ibahali, na mna ipfinu pfose ipfighendese hasi.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Yeye yuyo iyoghala libingu kulawa kwaitsighila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">na iyoghala ilumwesa hamwe na imvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">yeye koghala libeho kulawa akula kwayalikile.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Kamkoma chila mwana chaudele ako Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">yawe wa munu au wa mnyama.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Tsakatenda ipfitango na pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa, ako Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">kamtendela agho mfalume Farao na pfilongotsi wake wose wali hasi hake.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Tsakawakoma wanu wengi wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">na kawakoma wafalume wana tsingupfu.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Ka apfila Sihoni mfalume wa Waamori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">Ogi mfalme wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na wafalume wose wa Kanani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Katsiboka isi tsawo kaweng'a iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">tsiwe tsa iwanu wake Isiraeli.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Litaghwa lyako, ghwe IMNDEWA, lyokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">pfeleko pfose pfitsokukumbuka ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />IMNDEWA katsowamila iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">na katsowonela libatsi iwatumighwa wake.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Imilungu ya iwanu wa isi tsingi ya fetsa na nzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">nayo ifinighwa kwa ghamoko gha iwanu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Ina milomo lekeni ng'aidaha baye kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">ina nenge lekeni ng'aidaha baye kwona.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Ina maghutwi lekeni ng'aidaha baye kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">wala ng'aidaha baye hata kuhumula.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Wose iwaipfinile na iweihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">watseghala na imilungu ayo.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Mwemwe iwanu wa Isiraeli, mtunyeni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mwemwe iwatambika mtunyeni IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />mwemwe Walawi mtunyeni IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mtunyeni IMNDEWA mwemwe imumpfuka Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">yeye iyokala Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukulonga mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Mlonge mighede kwa IMNDEWA, kwaapfila kanogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Mlonge mighede kwa Imulungu wa imilungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Mlonge mighede kwa IMNDEWA wa iwandewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Yeye yaliyeka yuyo iyotenda ipfinu pfikulu pfa ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Kwa ukumanya kwake kaumba kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Yeye iyaitandatse isi mchanya mwa ghamatsi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Yeye iyaumbile litsuwa, ghumwetsi na tsinondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Litsuwa litawale nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Ghumwetsi na tsinondo tsitawale nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Yeye iyawakomile iwana chaudele wa chilume wa Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Kawalapfa wanu wa Isiraeli kulawa kuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Kawalapfa kwa kugholosa ghumoko ghwake ghuna ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Yeye kaighola ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Kawaleka iwanu wake wabite haghati hake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Lekeni kamdidimitsa Farao na Maasikali wake mna ibahali ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Kawalongotsa iwanu wake mna inyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Kawakoma wafalume wana ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Kawakoma wafalume iwomanyika sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Kamkoma Sihoni, mfalume wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Na Ogu, mfalume wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose, ing'aghohupa<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Katsiboka isi tsawo kaweng'a iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />Tsiwe tsawo iwanu wa Isiraeli mtumighwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Katukumbuka hatung'ali twa nyonde nyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Katukombola kulawa kwa maaduwi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Yeye komwing'a ichijo chila chiumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Mlonge mighede kwa Imulungu wa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s">Ukudomboketsa kwa Waisiraeli kuna isi ya utumwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Hambalimbali ha imito ya Babeli baho hatukalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">tsatulila hatukumbuke Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Haghati ha imibiki ya isi aila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">tsatukondeka pfinubi pfetu.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Kwaapfila awala iwatughoghile na kutughala ako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">watubama tuwembile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">iwatudununze watubama tuwadeng'eletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">walonga, “Twimbileni wila umwe wa Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Tudahatse ukumwimbila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">aku twamna isi ya ugheni?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Ghwe Yerusalemu, ka nokuswemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">leka ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo ghuholole.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Na ilulimi lwangu lunanahile uchanya mwa ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">ka nokusemwa ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">ka sikutenda ghweghwe Yerusalemu, uwe chinu chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">na chinu ichinenda nene nideng'elele sideke.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Ukumbuke ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">chawatendile Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">matsuwa aghala Yerusalemu haighwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">ukumbuke ghawalongile, Bomoleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">bomoleni hata ghumsingi ghwake.<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Ghwe Babeli, yuli habehi na ukuhunyighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">kabweba ghendo ayula iyatsokuyitsila ighehile ghaututendele,<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />ayula iyatsowasola iwana wako iwakong'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">na kuwadughadugha mbambalawe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukulonga mighede</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">nitsokulongela mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">nitsokwimbila ghweghwe hambele ha milungu ingi.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Nitsakwinamitsa uhanga wangu mbaka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kulola ing'anda yako yelile kwaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">nitsolitunya litaghwa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwaapfila kulinula litaghwa lyako na ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">ghawe mchanya mwa chila chinu.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Hanikukemile ghweghwe kunyidika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">kunenda niwe na ngupfu na ndeke kwona wogha.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Wafalume wose wali muisi watsokutunya ghweghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">hawohulika ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwako.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Watsakwimba aghala ghautendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwaapfila utunitso wako mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Hata ka ghweghwe kwakutali kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">lekeni komlola iyali mhole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">na komtambula yana ichidandali kulawa kuko kutali kwauli.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Hanitingwa ghweghwe konikinga niwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kowagholosela ghumoko ghwako maaduwi tsangu iwonighudubukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">nagho ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghonikombola.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />IMNDEWA katsombuyitsila chochose chayanongele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Ghweghwe IMNDEWA uluso wako mkulu wokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Umalitse isang'ano ya ghamoko ghako, yawanzile kututendela.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komanya ghose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA kunipelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">na kunimanya.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Kohamanya hanikala na hanikwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">hata ning'awa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">kochimanya achila chanipfikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Konimanya nene hanighenda au hanibwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">ghweghwe komanya sang'ano tsangu tsose.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Sina nonge chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">ghweghwe komanya chanibama ukulonga.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Ghweghwe kunitsingila chila ubali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">konyikila ghumoko ghwako mchanya mwangu ghunikinge.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Tsimbutsi tsako tsonikangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">aghano makulu ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">na nene sidaha baye ukughamanya.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Nitsumila kwani niihepe iloho yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Nitsumila kwani hanu ghweghwe ng'auli baho baye?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Ning'aghenda kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">ghweghwe kwakuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">ning'aghenda kutsimu ghweghwe kwakuko.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Hata ning'aghuluka mbaka kwalilawila litsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">au kumwambu mwa ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />ako kose kwa kuko konilongotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">na ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghunikindilitsa.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Ka ning'alonga ichisi chinipfise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">na ghumwanga ghung'awile chilo ghunitsunguluke nene,<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />kuna ghweghwe ichisi ng'achitsakuwa baho baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">chilo chitsakuwa ka nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kwaapfila ichisi kuna ghweghwe ka mwanga.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Ghweghwe kuniumba pfiungo pfangu pfa mghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">na nibasa hamwe lida lya mai wangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Nitsolonga mighede kwaapfila niumbighwa kwa ukukangawatsa na kwa ukupfukighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">ghamatendo ghako ghokangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">na nene konimanya ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Imipate yangu ng'aipfisike baye kuna ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">ahala haniumbighwe kwa chinyele nyele mna isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">ahala hanikalie nibasa mghati mwa isi.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Ghweghwe tsakumbona ng'ana nene nyoneke baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">ghamatsuwa ghangu ghaunikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">ghose tsaghandikighwa mna ichitabu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">hata ng'ana litsuwa limwe lyanze baye.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Ghwe Imulungu, ghaukwalangula kuna nene makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">na ng'aghodaha ukupeteka baye.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Ning'aghapetile ghang'awile mengi kubita ghumsanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">na hanilamka ning'ali na hamwe na ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Ghwe Imulungu, nene chanibama ghendo ung'awakomile iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">na iwanu iwokoma wayao wakale kutali na nene.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Wawo wokulonga pfihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">na maaduwi tsako wolilonga pfihile litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, angu niwehile awala iwokuhila ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">Apfi niwabetse awala iwokulema ghweghwe?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Iwokuhila ghweghwe, na nene nowohila ghendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">wawo wawa maaduwi tsangu<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Ghwe Imulungu, unipelembe ughumanye ghumoyo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">unighetse ughamanye ghanipfikitsa.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Undole ka mna ghumoyo ghwangu mna ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">na unilongotse mna inzila ya matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yakukinge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, unikombole na iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">unikinge na iwanu iwaghobo.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Iwanu awo wopanga ghehile mna imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">na wotenda ing'ondo ilawile chila tsuwa.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Wonola imilimi yawo iwe mikali ka ya nzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">na mna imilomo yawo mna ghamalonga ghehile ka isumu ya moma<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, unikinge na ghamoko gha iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">na unikinge na iwanu iwokoma wayao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">iwobama kunighwisa nene.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Iwanu wana ichidandali waniteghela imitegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">watandatsa imitsabi ka lwapfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">weka imitegho mnzila wanighoghe.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, “Ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wangu.” Uhulike ichililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">na umbonele libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">Mkombotsi wangu, yuna ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">unikinge nene mna ing'ondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Ghwe IMNDEWA uleke kuweng'a iwanu wehile ghawobama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">wala ghehile ghawobama ukutenda ghaleke ukutendeka.<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Uleke kuwatenda maaduwi tsangu wanihume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">na ighehile igholawa mna imilomo yawo ghawoyile iwenyegho.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Ghamakala gha ghumoto ghawaghwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">wasighwe mna ghumoto, na kuna ghamapondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">na waleke kiulawa keli.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Awala iwowadeta wayao waleke kupata chinu chochose mna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">ghehile ghawapate na wakomighwe ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nomanya koweng'a iwahingwa ihaki yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">na kowamila awala iwodununzika.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Ona ghendo, iwanu wana ihaki watsokutunya ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">na watsokala hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba nemihe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nokukema ghweghwe unitegheletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">usumke utse unyapfile,<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Ghanilomba ughabokele ka upfumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">na hanikwinulila ghamoko ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">unitoghole ka nambiko ya nemihe.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ughukinge ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">wike mkalitsi hana ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Unikinge ndeke kutenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">hamwe na awala iwotenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">wala ndeke kwilunga nawo ahala hawotenda ipfihungo.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Ng'apfu imunu yana ihaki yanitowe, ayo kombonela libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">na yang'anikembele ayo konighidila ghendo ghamapfuta mwitwi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">lekeni nene sitoghola baye iwanu wehile wanitunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">kwaapfila matsuwa ghose nolomba kwaajili ya ighehile ghao.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Iwakulu wawo hawatsakwasighwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">kulawa kuna ingema ya libambalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">baho watsotanga ka ghamalonga ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">ghang'ali gholongesa.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Nawo watsolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">“Ka imunu pfayolima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">na kumwaghalula lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">pfipfo na imipate yetu pfaitsomwaghaluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">mna lilanga lya likabuli.”<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Lekeni nene nehuwila gheghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">nokutsumila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">uleke kunileka nife.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Unikinge na imitegho yawaniteghele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">imitegho ya iwanu iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Iwanu wehile weyonza mna imitegho yao iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">aku nene nimwenyegho nakuka tseghamba.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba Imulungu yakwapfile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Nomlilila IMNDEWA kwa litsi likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">nomlomba IMNDEWA kwa litsi lyangu yambonele libatsi.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Nitsolonga apfila pfanidununzika hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">na ghamaghayo ghangu nitsoghaghala hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Hanitenyuka ghumoyo ghweghwe kwabaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">na komanya nzila tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">mna tsinzila tsanibita, iwanu waniteghela imitegho.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Ning'alola ubali wa kujilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">haduhu munu iyodaha ukunyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">nahela hanu ha ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">wala haduhu munu iyodaha ukuwalangitsa ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, nene nokulilila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">nolonga, “Ghweghwe kwa hanu hangu ha ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">na kongaya chanibama mna isi yanikala.”<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Utegheletse ichililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaapfila nene nahela ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">unikombole na awala iwonidununza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaapfila wawo wana ngupfu kubita nene.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Unilapfe kulawa mna ichifungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">ili nene nililongele mighede litaghwa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">baho iwanu wana ihaki watsonitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">kwaapfila kunitendela uluso mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s">Ukulomba wapfilighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, utegheletse ukulomba kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">utegheletse chililo changu umbonele libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">unyidike kwaapfila ghweghwe kotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Uleke kunihigha nene mtumighwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwaapfila kuduhu munu iyali mgima iyana ihaki hambele hako.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Maaduwi waniwinzilitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">wanighwisa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">na wanyika mchisi ka iwanu iwafile ghumwande.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Iloho yangu itsilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">na ghumoyo ghwangu ghutenyuka ghendo.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Noghakumbuka ghamatsuwa ighapfosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nighapfikitsa ghamatendo ghose ghautendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">na nolola tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghako tsautendile.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Hanikulomba nogholosa ghamoko ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">nina ng'ilu ka isi ilihela ghamatsi.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, usumke unyidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">kwaapfila nikeng'eneka ghendo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Uleke kukala kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">hela nitseghala na awala iwotsikighwa kuna likabuli.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Nemitondo nihulikitse uluso wako ing'aumala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaapfila nene nehuwila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">unilanguse inzila yanitsobita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaapfila nene nokulongela aghala ghanibama.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">unikombole kulawa kwa maaduwi tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">kwaapfila nene nipfisa kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Unilangulitse nitende aghala ghaubama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">na Iloho yako inoghile inilongotse mna inzila igholoke.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Ghwe IMNDEWA kwaajili ya litaghwa lyako unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">kwa ihaki yako unilapfe mna ghamaghayo.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Kwaapfila konikunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwakome maaduwi tsangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwanange wose iwonidununza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwaapfila nene na mtumighwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s">Mighede kwa ukuhuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Yabalikighwe IMNDEWA, bambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">iyolangulitsa ghamoko ghangu ukwitowa ng'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">na iyolangulitsa ipfidole pfangu ukwitowa.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Yeye ka Imulungu wangu yanimkunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">yeye konikinga na konikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">yeye ka ngawo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">nomtsumila yeye nikale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">iyowahuma iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi na koweka mna ghamoko ghangu.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">imunu yali nani mbaka umtongelele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Na imwana wa imunu yali choni mbaka umfikitse?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Imunu pfayali ka muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">matsuwa ghake pfaghali ka ichimbeho ichipfosa.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">ulinamitse lilanga lyako uhulumke hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">udonze ipfidunda napfo pfilapfe lihosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Lughale lumwesa uwapwililise maaduwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">wase tsiminde tsako, uwawinge.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Ugholose ghumoko ghwako kulawa kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">unikombole na unilapfe mna ghamatsi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">na unilapfe mna ghamoko gha iwagheni,<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />iwolonga ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">na ghamoko ghawo gha kujilo ghosang'ana ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">nitsokwimbila wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">kwa iching'weng'we cha nyutsi kumi nene nitsokwimbila,<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />ghweghwe yuwatenda wafalume wahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">na yumkombola Daudi mtumighwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Unikombole, na unilapfe kulawa mna ghamoko gha iwagheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">iwolonga ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">na iwogholosa ghamoko ghao gha kujilo watende mbuli tsa ughutsu.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Iwasongolo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wakule ka imimeya ilolesighwe ghoya, mna usongolo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">na neghe tsetu wawe ka tsingutso tsikighwe unzolingo mna ing'anda ya mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Tsikano tsetu tsimeme chila chinu chatubama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">na wang'olo wetu weleke wana maelufu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Wang'ombe wetu wadute mitsigho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">wala tuleke kutowighwa na kughoghighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">wanyama wetu iwana ghamatombo waleke kuhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">wala kuleke kuwa chililo mna tsinzila tsetu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Wabalikighwa iwanu awala iweng'ighwe agho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">wabalikighwa iwanu awala IMNDEWA yali Imulungu wawo.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Nitsokutunya ghwe Imulungu wangu na mfalume wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">nitsolitunya litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Matsuwa ghose nitsokutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">nitsolitunya litaghwa lyako matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />IMNDEWA yuyo imkulu iyobamighwa ukutunyighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">na ukulu wake ng'udaha kuulinga baye.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Iwanu watsotsitunya tsisang'ano tsako kulawa cheleko chimwe mbaka cheleko chingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">iwanu watsoghalonga ghamatendo ghako makulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Watsolonga utunitso wako na ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">na watsoghapfikitsa ghamatendo ghako gha ukukangawatsa.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Iwanu woghalonga ghamatendo ghako makulu gha ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">na nene nitsoghalonga kwa mlomo ghwangu makulu ghautendile.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Watsokutunya kwa uluso wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">na watsokutunya kwa ukutogholeka kwako.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />IMNDEWA kamluso na kana libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">na ng'osumka ukughudubuka baye.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />IMNDEWA kanogha kwa iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">na kokonela libatsi pfinu pfose pfayaumbile.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, pfose pfaulumbile pfitsokutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">na iwanu wako iwotogholeka nawo watsokubaliki.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Watsosima ukulu wa ufalume wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">na watsoulonga ukulu wako,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />ili chila munu yamanye ghamatendo ghako makulu pfaghali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">na utunitso wa ufalume wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Ufalume wako ng'autsigha baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">naghwe kutsolongotsa matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Ghose ghayolonga IMNDEWA koghatenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">yeye kamluso mna ghose ghayotenda.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />IMNDEWA kowapfila wose iwoghaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">na kowenula wose iwakughwa.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Wapfiumbe wose wokulolela ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">ahala hawobama ichijo ghweghwe koweng'a.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Kwa ghumoko ghwako koweng'a ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">na koweneletsa wose chila chinu chawobama.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Chila chinu IMNDEWA kotenda kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">na kamluso mna ghose ghayotenda.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />IMNDEWA kahabehi na awala iwomkema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">awala wose iwomlomba kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Koweng'a chawobama awala wose iwompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">kohulika ichililo chawo na kowakombola.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />MNDEWA kowakinga wose iwomkunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">lekeni awala iwehile wose katsowadumlila kutali.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Nitsomtunya IMNDEWA kwa ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">na pfiumbe pfose watsolitunye litaghwa lyake lyelile matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s">Ukumtunya Imulungu Mkombotsi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Mtunye IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Leka nene nimtunye IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Nitsomtunya IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose ghanikala mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">Nitsomwimbila Imulungu wangu matsuwa ghose ghanikala mgima.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Mleke kwihuwila wapfilongotsi wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">awo wanu hela na ng'awodaha baye ukuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Yang'afa, kakuya mna litimwisi mwalawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">na chila chinu chayabamile ukutenda chotsighila baho.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyakwapfilighwa na Imulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">imunu ayula iyehuwila kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake,<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />iyaumbile lilanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">ibahali na pfose pfili mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">matsuwa ghose yeye kotenda lyaghano lyayekile.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Yeye koweng'a iwonelighwe achila chawobamighwa ukwing'ighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">koweng'a ichijo awala wana inzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">na kowalekela awala iwohighwe.<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />IMNDEWA kowafumbula tsinenge ipfifita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">kowenula awala iwaghwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">na kowakunda awala iwana ihaki.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />IMNDEWA kowakinga iwagheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">naye kowapfila awala walihela aba tsawo na ipfitsuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">lekeni kopfulaghitsa aghala ghawobama kutenda iwehile.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />IMNDEWA katsoghendelela kuwa mfalume matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Imulungu wako ghwe Sayuni ka mfalume pfeleko mbaka pfeleko! Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s">Pfinogha tumtunye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Mlole pfapfinoghile ukumtunya Imulungu wetu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Kwaapfila yeye kanogha na kobamighwa yatunyighwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />IMNDEWA yeye iyaghutsengile keli ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">kowoyitsa Waisiraeli iwakalile kuna isi ya utumwa.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Kowatenda awala iwatenyuke waleke ukutenyuka keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">naye kowahonetsa ipfilonda pfawo.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Kopeta tsinondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">na chila imwe koing'a taghwa.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />IMNDEWA ka mkulu na kana ngupfu nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">tsimbutsi tsake ng'atsilingighwa baye.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />IMNDEWA kowenula awala iwehulumsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">lekeni awala iwehile kowasa mna litimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Mmwimbile IMNDEWA tsiwila tsa mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mumtowele ching'weng'we Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Yeye kolighubika lilanga na libingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">koitenda imvula idiwe mna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">na koyotetsa imitsani yote mna ipfidunda.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Yeye koweng'a wanyama ichijo chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">koweng'a ichijo iwana wa ibondwa ahala hawolila.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Yeye ng'onoghelwa baye na tsingupfu tsa wafalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">wala asikali yana tsingupfu,<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />lekeni konoghelwa na awala iwompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">na awala iwehuwila uluso wake.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Umtunye IMNDEWA ghwe Yerusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Umtunye Imulungu wako ghwe Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Yeye koghatenda ghamalango ghako ghawe na ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">Na kowabaliki iwanu iwali mng'anda mwako.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Kowatenda iwanu iwali mna tsimbaka tsenu wakale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">na kokutenda wighute kwa ing'ano inoghile.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Yeye koghala malaghitso ghake muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">na ghayolonga ng'aghokawa baye ukutendeka.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Koitandatsa ibalafu kulonga mighala ya ng'olo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">kopwililisa ing'ungu kulonga lipfu.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Koghala mvula ya mabwe ka pfibwe pfidopfido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">Yuhi iyodaha ukududumila libeho alyo?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Kuya kolubula kwa lilonga lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">na koghala libeho, na ghamatsi gholawa.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Kuya usenga wake komlongela Jakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">naye koweng'a Waisiraeli imiko na ghamalaghitso.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Lekeni tsiisi tsingi ng'atsitendele apfo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">iwanu wangi ng'awomanya baye malaghitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mumtunye IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa tsiisi tsose mumtunye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Mumtunye IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Mumtunye IMNDEWA kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mumtunye ako kuna ipfidanando.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Mumtunye mwemwe wamalika wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mumtunye mwemwe maasikali wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Mumtunye mwemwe litsuwa na ghumwetsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">mumtunye mwemwe tsinondo tsose itsimeletseka.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Mumtunye mwemwe lilanga lya kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">mumtunye ghamatsi ighali kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Pfose pfilitunye litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwaapfila yeye tsakalaghitsa na pfose pfitendeka.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Yeye tsakapfika hanu hake matsuwa ghose ing'aghomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">tsakalapfa malaghitso ing'aghoghaluka baye.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Mtunyeni IMNDEWA kulawa kuna tsiisi tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">mwemwe ghamatsoka gha ibahali na ghamatsi ghaghendese hasi, mumtunye.<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />Mumtunye mwemwe ghumoto, imvula ya ghamabwe na ibalafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">na inyahemu ikinda ghamalaghitso ghake,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />mumtunye mwemwe ipfidunda na ipfidunda pfidopfido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">Imibiki ya ghamatunda na imikataluba,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />mumtunye mwemwe wanyama wa kwibagho na iwodimighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">wapfiumbe iwotambala na wapfideghe wose,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />mtunyeni mwemwe wafalume na iwanu wa isi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">wapfilongotsi na wose iwotawala isi,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />mumtunye mwemwe iwasongolo na iwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">iwanzehe wose na iwana.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Wose walitunye litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwaapfila taghwa lyake kulu kubita mataghwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">na utunitso wake mkulu kubita lilanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Kaweng'a tsingupfu iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">apfo iwanu wose womtunya yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">iwanu wa Isiraeli iyowakunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mtunyeni IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ukuhuma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Mumtunye IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Mmwimbile IMNDEWA wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mumtunye mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwotogholeka.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Ghwe Isiraeli umdeng'elele ayula iyakuumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">namwe iwanu wa Sayuni mumdeng'elele mfalume wenu.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Mlitunye litaghwa lyake kwa ipfigoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">na mmwimbile kwa tsingoma na pfinubi.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA ko noghelwa na iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">na kowapfatsa litaji lya ukombotsi awala iwehulumsa.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Leka iwanu iwotogholeka waudeng'elele utunitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">hata wang'awa mlusatsi wawo wadeng'elele.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Tsiwila tsa ukumtunya Imulungu tsikale mna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">na lipanga litema kosekose mna ghamoko ghawo,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />ili wawoyitsile iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">na wawatowe iwanu wa ing'awammanyile Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />Wawohe wafalume wawo kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">na ipfilongotsi wawo wawohe kwa tsipingu tsa chuma,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />ili wawahighe ka apfila pfayandikighwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Ako kuko ukutunyighwa kwa iwanu wa Imulungu iwotogholeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s">Mumtunye IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Mumtunye IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mumtunye Imulungu hanu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">mumtunye mna lilanga lyake kulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Mumtunye kwaapfila katenda makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mumtunye kwaajili ya utunitso wake mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Mumtunye kwa kumtowela malati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mumtunye kwa ipfinubi na ipfing'weng'we.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Mumtunye kwa tsingoma na kwa ukubigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mumtunye kwa kutowa tsifilimbi na tsimalati.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Mumtunye kwa matoatsi igholila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">mumtunye kwa matoatsi gha litsi likulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Chila iyali mgima yamtunye IMNDEWA.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mumtunye IMNDEWA!<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>